  anecdotes_i18n = '{"en":["Has played the same pink paisley Fender Telecaster, nicknamed \"Pinky,\" on nearly every album and almost every show for over 30 years. (Kilde: Wikipedia)","Discovered in Memphis by Antone''s Records founder Clifford Antone, who signed her in 1989. (Kilde: Wikipedia)","Her 2018 album \"The Ice Queen\" brought Billy Gibbons and Jimmie Vaughan into the studio together. (Kilde: Wikipedia)","Holds a PhD in musicology and has written for Guitar Player Magazine. (Kilde: Wikipedia)","Her book \"Guitar Women\" is due from Sutherland House Publishing in 2026. (Kilde: Wikipedia)"],"no":["Har spilt den samme rosa paisley Fender Telecasteren, kalt «Pinky», på nesten hvert album og show i over 30 år. (Kilde: Wikipedia)","Oppdaget i Memphis av Antone''s Records-grunnlegger Clifford Antone, som signerte henne i 1989. (Kilde: Wikipedia)","Hennes 2018-album «The Ice Queen» brakte Billy Gibbons og Jimmie Vaughan inn i studioet sammen. (Kilde: Wikipedia)","Har en doktorgrad i musikkvitenskap og har skrevet for Guitar Player Magazine. (Kilde: Wikipedia)","Boken hennes «Guitar Women» ventes fra Sutherland House Publishing i 2026. (Kilde: Wikipedia)"]}',
