"Quelle: Wikipédia FR."},{"year":2009,"title":"Night Work","notes":"Quelle: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2012,"title":"Electric Fingers","notes":"Quelle: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2016,"title":"It Never Comes Easy","notes":"Quelle: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2018,"title":"Fred Chapellier Plays Peter Green (live)","notes":"Hommage an Peter Green. Quelle: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2022,"title":"Straight to the Point","notes":"Quelle: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2024,"title":"Live in Paris","notes":"Doppel-Livealbum. Quelle: fredchapellier.fr."}],"pl":[{"year":2003,"title":"Blues Devil","label":"Mosaic Music","notes":"Źródło: Wikipédia FR."},{"year":2005,"title":"L''Œil du Blues","notes":"Źródło: Wikipédia FR."},{"year":2009,"title":"Night Work","notes":"Źródło: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2012,"title":"Electric Fingers","notes":"Źródło: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2016,"title":"It Never Comes Easy","notes":"Źródło: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2018,"title":"Fred Chapellier Plays Peter Green (live)","notes":"Hołd dla Petera Greena. Źródło: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2022,"title":"Straight to the Point","notes":"Źródło: fredchapellier.fr."},{"year":2024,"title":"Live in Paris","notes":"Podwójny album koncertowy. Źródło: fredchapellier.fr."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[{"year":2004,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Nominated \"blues revelation\" and \"best guitarist\""}],"no":[{"year":2004,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Nominert «blues-åpenbaring» og «beste gitarist»"}],"sv":[{"year":2004,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Nominerad »blues-uppenbarelse« och »bästa gitarrist«"}],"de":[{"year":2004,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Nominierung „Blues-Offenbarung“ und „bester Gitarrist“"}],"pl":[{"year":2004,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Nominacja „objawienie bluesa” i „najlepszy gitarzysta”"}]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Fred Chapellier – French Blues-Rock Guitarist | SlowBlues', 'Fred Chapellier – Fransk bluesrock-gitarist | SlowBlues', 'Fred Chapellier – Fransk bluesrock-gitarrist | SlowBlues', 'Fred Chapellier – Französischer Bluesrock-Gitarrist | SlowBlues', 'Fred Chapellier – Francuski gitarzysta blues-rockowy | SlowBlues', 'Fred Chapellier is a leading French blues-rock guitarist from Metz, known for his Peter Green-inspired style and work with Jacques Dutronc. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Fred Chapellier er en ledende fransk bluesrock-gitarist fra Metz, kjent for sin Peter Green-inspirerte stil og arbeid med Jacques Dutronc. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Fred Chapellier är en ledande fransk bluesrock-gitarrist från Metz, känd för sin Peter Green-inspirerade stil och sitt arbete med Jacques Dutronc. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Fred Chapellier ist einer der führenden französischen Bluesrock-Gitarristen aus Metz, bekannt für seinen von Peter Green inspirierten Stil und seine Arbeit mit Jacques Dutronc. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Fred Chapellier to czołowy francuski gitarzysta blues-rockowy z Metz, znany ze stylu inspirowanego Peterem Greenem i współpracy z Jacques''em Dutronkiem. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/fred.chapellier","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/@FREDCHAPELLIERmusic"}', '[{"label":"Wikipédia (FR)","url":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fred_Chapellier"}]', '[{"title":"Fred Chapellier — Wikipédia (FR)","url":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fred_Chapellier"},{"title":"Site officiel — fredchapellier.fr","url":"https://www.fredchapellier.fr/"}]', 'https://www.fredchapellier.fr/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"https://www.fredchapellier.fr/contact/","source_url":"https://www.fredchapellier.fr/contact/","note":"Kontakt/booking via offisielt kontaktskjema (fredchapellier.fr/contact). Ingen offentlig booking-e-post/telefon funnet — gjett ikke, bruk kontaktskjemaet."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('24f0ddd0-8e5b-4104-afe0-f6ff8b3997d1', 'gaelle-buswel', 'Gaëlle Buswel', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/Gaelle_Buswel.jpg', NULL, 'Foto: Philippe Bacchni (CC BY-SA 3.0, Wikimedia Commons, konsert 2008)', '[]', '[]', 'French singer-guitarist from Alfortville whose blues-rock draws on folk and 1970s rock, launched as a solo artist through a chance meeting with guitarist Neal Black.', 'Fransk vokalist og gitarist fra Alfortville hvis bluesrock trekker på folk og 1970-talls rock, lansert som soloartist gjennom et tilfeldig møte med gitaristen Neal Black.', 'Fransk sångerska och gitarrist från Alfortville vars bluesrock hämtar från folk och 1970-talsrock, lanserad som soloartist genom ett slumpmässigt möte med gitarristen Neal Black.', 'Französische Sängerin und Gitarristin aus Alfortville, deren Bluesrock von Folk und Rock der 1970er-Jahre geprägt ist, als Solokünstlerin gestartet durch eine zufällige Begegnung mit dem Gitarristen Neal Black.', 'Francuska wokalistka i gitarzystka z Alfortville, której blues-rock czerpie z folku i rocka lat 70., wystartowała jako artystka solowa dzięki przypadkowemu spotkaniu z gitarzystą Nealem Blackiem.', 'Gaëlle Buswel, from Alfortville, spent six years fronting the blues-rock band Cam On and lived in England before going solo (Source: fr.wikipedia.org). Her solo career began in 2010 after meeting guitarist Neal Black at a café-concert called Le Soubock in Cauville, Normandy; the pair self-produced her 2011 debut "Yesterday''s Shadow," which introduced her to the French blues scene and to Canada via the Festival d''été de Québec (Source: fr.wikipedia.org). Her second album, "Black to Blue" (November 2014), broadened her audience and opened doors across North America. She has now played more than 500 concerts in Europe and toured North America, French Polynesia and Japan (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Gaëlle Buswel, fra Alfortville, ledet bluesrock-bandet Cam On i seks år og bodde i England før hun gikk solo (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org). Solokarrieren startet i 2010 etter et møte med gitaristen Neal Black på en café-concert kalt Le Soubock i Cauville, Normandie; duoen egenproduserte debuten «Yesterday''s Shadow» i 2011, som introduserte henne for det franske bluesmiljøet og for Canada via Festival d''été de Québec (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org). Det andre albumet, «Black to Blue» (november 2014), utvidet publikummet hennes og åpnet dører i Nord-Amerika. Hun har nå spilt over 500 konserter i Europa og turnert i Nord-Amerika, Fransk Polynesia og Japan (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Gaëlle Buswel, från Alfortville, ledde bluesrockbandet Cam On i sex år och bodde i England innan hon gick solo (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org). Solokarriären inleddes 2010 efter ett möte med gitarristen Neal Black på en café-concert kallad Le Soubock i Cauville, Normandie; duon egenproducerade debuten »Yesterday''s Shadow« 2011, som introducerade henne för den franska bluesscenen och för Kanada via Festival d''été de Québec (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org). Det andra albumet, »Black to Blue« (november 2014), breddade hennes publik och öppnade dörrar i Nordamerika. Hon har nu spelat över 500 konserter i Europa och turnerat i Nordamerika, Franska Polynesien och Japan (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Gaëlle Buswel aus Alfortville leitete sechs Jahre lang die Bluesrock-Band Cam On und lebte in England, bevor sie solo ging (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org). Ihre Solokarriere begann 2010 nach einem Treffen mit dem Gitarristen Neal Black in einem Café-Concert namens Le Soubock in Cauville, Normandie; das Duo produzierte 2011 in Eigenregie das Debütalbum „Yesterday''s Shadow“, das sie der französischen Bluesszene und über das Festival d''été de Québec auch Kanada vorstellte (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org). Ihr zweites Album, „Black to Blue“ (November 2014), erweiterte ihr Publikum und öffnete Türen in Nordamerika. Sie hat inzwischen über 500 Konzerte in Europa gespielt und Nordamerika, Französisch-Polynesien und Japan bereist (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Gaëlle Buswel z Alfortville przez sześć lat prowadziła zespół blues-rockowy Cam On i mieszkała w Anglii, zanim rozpoczęła karierę solową (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org). Kariera solowa rozpoczęła się w 2010 roku po spotkaniu z gitarzystą Nealem Blackiem w kawiarni koncertowej Le Soubock w Cauville w Normandii; duet samodzielnie wyprodukował debiutancki album „Yesterday''s Shadow” z 2011 roku, który przedstawił ją francuskiej scenie bluesowej i Kanadzie za sprawą Festival d''été de Québec (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org). Jej drugi album, „Black to Blue” (listopad 2014), poszerzył grono odbiorców i otworzył drzwi w Ameryce Północnej. Zagrała już ponad 500 koncertów w Europie oraz koncertowała w Ameryce Północnej, Polinezji Francuskiej i Japonii (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alfortville, Frankrike', 'Alfortville, Frankrike', '2010–', 'Buswel''s folk-inflected, 1970s-rock-leaning approach to the blues has helped widen the genre''s palette in France beyond straight Chicago or Delta forms, and her international touring record has made her one of French blues'' more recognisable ambassadors abroad (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Buswels folk-pregede, 1970-talls-rock-orienterte tilnærming til bluesen har bidratt til å utvide sjangerens palett i Frankrike utover rene Chicago- eller Delta-former, og hennes internasjonale turnérute har gjort henne til en av fransk blues'' mer gjenkjennelige ambassadører i utlandet (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Buswels folkpräglade, 1970-talsrockinriktade sätt att närma sig bluesen har bidragit till att bredda genrens palett i Frankrike bortom renodlade Chicago- eller Deltaformer, och hennes internationella turnerande har gjort henne till en av fransk blues mer igenkännbara ambassadörer utomlands (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Buswels folkgeprägter, an 1970er-Jahre-Rock orientierter Zugang zum Blues hat dazu beigetragen, die Bandbreite des Genres in Frankreich über reine Chicago- oder Delta-Formen hinaus zu erweitern, und ihre internationale Tourbilanz hat sie zu einer der erkennbareren Botschafterinnen des französischen Blues im Ausland gemacht (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Folkowe, zakorzenione w rocku lat 70. podejście Buswel do bluesa pomogło poszerzyć paletę gatunku we Francji poza czyste formy chicagowskie czy deltowe, a jej międzynarodowa historia koncertowa uczyniła ją jedną z bardziej rozpoznawalnych ambasadorek francuskiego bluesa za granicą (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).', '[]', '{"en":["Yesterday''s Shadow (2011, debut with Neal Black)","LYA (official video)","Black to Blue (2014, title track)"],"no":["Yesterday''s Shadow (2011, debut med Neal Black)","LYA (offisiell video)","Black to Blue (2014, tittelspor)"],"sv":["Yesterday''s Shadow (2011, debut med Neal Black)","LYA (officiell video)","Black to Blue (2014, titelspår)"],"de":["Yesterday''s Shadow (2011, Debüt mit Neal Black)","LYA (offizielles Video)","Black to Blue (2014, Titeltrack)"],"pl":["Yesterday''s Shadow (2011, debiut z Nealem Blackiem)","LYA (oficjalny teledysk)","Black to Blue (2014, utwór tytułowy)"]}', '[]', '["Vocals","Guitar"]', '["Blues Rock","Folk Blues","70s Rock"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["2010: Met guitarist Neal Black at Le Soubock in Cauville, Normandy, launching her solo career (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).","2011: Self-produced debut album \"Yesterday''s Shadow\" (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).","2015: Won the Cahors Blues Festival prize and the France Blues prize; represented France at the International Blues Challenge in Horsens, Denmark (Source: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"no":["2010: Møtte gitaristen Neal Black på Le Soubock i Cauville, Normandie, og startet solokarrieren (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).","2011: Egenprodusert debutalbum «Yesterday''s Shadow» (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).","2015: Vant Cahors Blues Festival-prisen og France Blues-prisen; representerte Frankrike ved International Blues Challenge i Horsens, Danmark (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"sv":["2010: Träffade gitarristen Neal Black på Le Soubock i Cauville, Normandie, och inledde solokarriären (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).","2011: Egenproducerat debutalbum »Yesterday''s Shadow« (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).","2015: Vann Cahors Blues Festival-priset och France Blues-priset; representerade Frankrike vid International Blues Challenge i Horsens, Danmark (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"de":["2010: Traf den Gitarristen Neal Black im Le Soubock in Cauville, Normandie, und startete ihre Solokarriere (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).","2011: Eigenproduziertes Debütalbum „Yesterday''s Shadow“ (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).","2015: Gewann den Cahors Blues Festival-Preis und den France Blues-Preis; vertrat Frankreich bei der International Blues Challenge in Horsens, Dänemark (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"pl":["2010: Spotkała gitarzystę Neala Blacka w Le Soubock w Cauville w Normandii, rozpoczynając karierę solową (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).","2011: Samodzielnie wyprodukowany album debiutancki „Yesterday''s Shadow” (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).","2015: Zdobyła nagrodę Cahors Blues Festival i nagrodę France Blues; reprezentowała Francję na International Blues Challenge w Horsens w Danii (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"Gaelle Buswel \"LYA\" (Official Music Video)","youtube_id":"AqDUkMY9Wj8","channel":"Gaelle Buswel"},{"kind":"more","title":"Gaelle Buswel \"Somehow\" session acoustique (Album \"Black to Blue\")","youtube_id":"GtS7BFlIjeg","channel":"ScopandFolk TV"}]', '{"en":[{"year":2011,"title":"Yesterday''s Shadow","notes":"With Neal Black. Source: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Black to Blue","notes":"Source: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"no":[{"year":2011,"title":"Yesterday''s Shadow","notes":"Med Neal Black. Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Black to Blue","notes":"Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"sv":[{"year":2011,"title":"Yesterday''s Shadow","notes":"Med Neal Black. Källa: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Black to Blue","notes":"Källa: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"de":[{"year":2011,"title":"Yesterday''s Shadow","notes":"Mit Neal Black. Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Black to Blue","notes":"Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"pl":[{"year":2011,"title":"Yesterday''s Shadow","notes":"Z Nealem Blackiem. Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Black to Blue","notes":"Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[{"year":2015,"title":"Cahors Blues Festival Prize"},{"year":2015,"title":"France Blues Prize"}],"no":[{"year":2015,"title":"Cahors Blues Festival-prisen"},{"year":2015,"title":"France Blues-prisen"}],"sv":[{"year":2015,"title":"Cahors Blues Festival-priset"},{"year":2015,"title":"France Blues-priset"}],"de":[{"year":2015,"title":"Cahors Blues Festival-Preis"},{"year":2015,"title":"France Blues-Preis"}],"pl":[{"year":2015,"title":"Nagroda Cahors Blues Festival"},{"year":2015,"title":"Nagroda France Blues"}]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Gaëlle Buswel – French Blues-Rock Singer & Guitarist | SlowBlues', 'Gaëlle Buswel – Fransk bluesrock-vokalist og gitarist | SlowBlues', 'Gaëlle Buswel – Fransk bluesrock-sångerska och gitarrist | SlowBlues', 'Gaëlle Buswel – Französische Bluesrock-Sängerin und Gitarristin | SlowBlues', 'Gaëlle Buswel – Francuska wokalistka i gitarzystka blues-rockowa | SlowBlues', 'Gaëlle Buswel is a French blues-rock singer-guitarist from Alfortville, known for her folk- and 70s-rock-inflected sound. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Gaëlle Buswel er en fransk bluesrock-vokalist og gitarist fra Alfortville, kjent for sin folk- og 1970-talls-rock-pregede lyd. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Gaëlle Buswel är en fransk bluesrock-sångerska och gitarrist från Alfortville, känd för sitt folk- och 1970-talsrockpräglade sound. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Gaëlle Buswel ist eine französische Bluesrock-Sängerin und Gitarristin aus Alfortville, bekannt für ihren von Folk und 1970er-Rock geprägten Sound. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Gaëlle Buswel to francuska wokalistka i gitarzystka blues-rockowa z Alfortville, znana z brzmienia inspirowanego folkiem i rockiem lat 70. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://facebook.com/GaelleBuswel.OfficialFanPage","instagram":"https://instagram.com/gaellebuswel","youtube":"https://youtube.com/user/GaelleBuswel"}', '[]', '[{"title":"Gaëlle Buswel — Wikipédia (FR)","url":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ga%C3%ABlle_Buswel"}]', 'https://www.gaelle-buswel.fr/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"https://www.gaelle-buswel.fr/pages/contact/","source_url":"https://www.gaelle-buswel.fr/pages/contact/","note":"Kontakt/booking via offisiell kontaktside. Ingen offentlig booking-e-post/telefon funnet."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('a0c4f24a-040a-4948-a3d5-e828390eb7a3', 'jean-jacques-milteau', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau', NULL, 'Classic', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/57/JJ-Milteau-Paris-2006-07-08-pic61.jpg', NULL, 'Foto: Petko Yotov / 5ko.free.fr (CC BY-SA 3.0, Wikimedia Commons, Paris 2006)', '[]', '[]', 'France''s foremost blues harmonica player, a Victoire de la Musique winner who spent decades as the go-to harmonica voice for French chanson stars before building his own acclaimed solo catalogue.', 'Frankrikes fremste blues-munnspiller, vinner av Victoire de la Musique, som tilbrakte tiår som den foretrukne munnspill-stemmen for franske chanson-stjerner før han bygde sin egen anerkjente solokatalog.', 'Frankrikes främsta bluesmunspelare, vinnare av Victoire de la Musique, som tillbringade decennier som den självklara munspelsrösten åt franska chansonstjärnor innan han byggde sin egen hyllade solokatalog.', 'Frankreichs führender Blues-Mundharmonikaspieler, Gewinner des Victoire de la Musique, der jahrzehntelang die gefragte Mundharmonika-Stimme für französische Chanson-Stars war, bevor er seinen eigenen gefeierten Solokatalog aufbaute.', 'Czołowy francuski harmonijkarz bluesowy, laureat Victoire de la Musique, który przez dziesięciolecia był rozpoznawalnym głosem harmonijki u boku francuskich gwiazd chanson, zanim zbudował własny, uznany dorobek solowy.', 'Born in Paris on 17 April 1950, Jean-Jacques Milteau discovered the harmonica through 1960s folk and rock (Bob Dylan, the Rolling Stones), and a trip to the United States brought him face to face with American blues (Source: en.wikipedia.org). He first made his name as an in-demand session musician, accompanying a long list of major French artists — Yves Montand, Eddy Mitchell, Jean-Jacques Goldman, Maxime Le Forestier, Barbara, Charles Aznavour, Renaud (Source: en.wikipedia.org). He released his first solo album, "Blues Harp," in 1989, and went on to win Victoires de la Musique for "Explorer" (1991) and "Memphis" (2001) — a rare feat for a harmonica player in France. In 2014 he was named Officier des Arts et des Lettres, and his catalogue now runs to 18 albums including "Explorer," "Routes" and "Bastille Blues" (Source: en.wikipedia.org; jjmilteau.net).', 'Født i Paris 17. april 1950 oppdaget Jean-Jacques Milteau munnspillet gjennom 1960-tallets folk og rock (Bob Dylan, Rolling Stones), og en reise til USA satte ham ansikt til ansikt med amerikansk blues (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org). Han gjorde seg først et navn som en ettertraktet studiomusiker og akkompagnerte en lang rekke store franske artister — Yves Montand, Eddy Mitchell, Jean-Jacques Goldman, Maxime Le Forestier, Barbara, Charles Aznavour, Renaud (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org). Han ga ut sitt første soloalbum, «Blues Harp», i 1989, og vant senere Victoires de la Musique for «Explorer» (1991) og «Memphis» (2001) — en sjelden bragd for en munnspiller i Frankrike. I 2014 ble han utnevnt til Officier des Arts et des Lettres, og katalogen hans teller nå 18 album, inkludert «Explorer», «Routes» og «Bastille Blues» (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org; jjmilteau.net).', 'Född i Paris den 17 april 1950 upptäckte Jean-Jacques Milteau munspelet genom 1960-talets folk och rock (Bob Dylan, Rolling Stones), och en resa till USA förde honom ansikte mot ansikte med amerikansk blues (Källa: en.wikipedia.org). Han gjorde sig först ett namn som en efterfrågad studiomusiker och ackompanjerade en lång rad stora franska artister — Yves Montand, Eddy Mitchell, Jean-Jacques Goldman, Maxime Le Forestier, Barbara, Charles Aznavour, Renaud (Källa: en.wikipedia.org). Han släppte sitt första soloalbum, »Blues Harp«, 1989, och vann senare Victoires de la Musique för »Explorer« (1991) och »Memphis« (2001) — en sällsynt bedrift för en munspelare i Frankrike. 2014 utnämndes han till Officier des Arts et des Lettres, och hans katalog omfattar nu 18 album, inklusive »Explorer«, »Routes« och »Bastille Blues« (Källa: en.wikipedia.org; jjmilteau.net).', 'Geboren am 17. April 1950 in Paris, entdeckte Jean-Jacques Milteau die Mundharmonika durch den Folk und Rock der 1960er-Jahre (Bob Dylan, die Rolling Stones), und eine Reise in die USA brachte ihn direkt mit dem amerikanischen Blues in Berührung (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org). Zunächst machte er sich als gefragter Studiomusiker einen Namen und begleitete eine lange Liste großer französischer Künstler — Yves Montand, Eddy Mitchell, Jean-Jacques Goldman, Maxime Le Forestier, Barbara, Charles Aznavour, Renaud (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org). 1989 veröffentlichte er sein erstes Soloalbum „Blues Harp“ und gewann später Victoires de la Musique für „Explorer“ (1991) und „Memphis“ (2001) — eine seltene Leistung für einen Mundharmonikaspieler in Frankreich. 2014 wurde er zum Officier des Arts et des Lettres ernannt, sein Katalog umfasst inzwischen 18 Alben, darunter „Explorer“, „Routes“ und „Bastille Blues“ (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org; jjmilteau.net).', 'Urodzony w Paryżu 17 kwietnia 1950 roku, Jean-Jacques Milteau odkrył harmonijkę dzięki folkowi i rockowi lat 60. (Bob Dylan, Rolling Stones), a podróż do Stanów Zjednoczonych zetknęła go bezpośrednio z amerykańskim bluesem (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org). Najpierw zdobył rozgłos jako poszukiwany muzyk sesyjny, towarzysząc długiej liście czołowych francuskich artystów — Yves''owi Montandowi, Eddy''emu Mitchellowi, Jean-Jacques''owi Goldmanowi, Maxime''owi Le Forestierowi, Barbarze, Charles''owi Aznavourowi, Renaudowi (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org). Swój pierwszy solowy album, „Blues Harp”, wydał w 1989 roku, a później zdobył nagrody Victoires de la Musique za „Explorer” (1991) i „Memphis” (2001) — rzadkie osiągnięcie dla harmonijkarza we Francji. W 2014 roku otrzymał tytuł Officier des Arts et des Lettres, a jego dorobek liczy dziś 18 albumów, w tym „Explorer”, „Routes” i „Bastille Blues” (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org; jjmilteau.net).', '1950-04-17', NULL, NULL, 'Paris, Frankrike', 'Paris, Frankrike', '1970-tallet–', 'Milteau did more than any other musician to bring the blues harmonica into mainstream French popular music, both as the sound behind decades of chanson recordings and as a solo artist whose Victoires de la Musique gave the instrument a rare institutional recognition in France (Source: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Milteau har gjort mer enn noen annen musiker for å bringe blues-munnspillet inn i fransk mainstream-populærmusikk, både som lyden bak tiår med chanson-innspillinger og som soloartist hvis Victoires de la Musique ga instrumentet en sjelden institusjonell anerkjennelse i Frankrike (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Milteau har gjort mer än någon annan musiker för att föra in bluesmunspelet i fransk mainstream-populärmusik, både som ljudet bakom decennier av chansoninspelningar och som soloartist vars Victoires de la Musique gav instrumentet ett sällsynt institutionellt erkännande i Frankrike (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Milteau hat mehr als jeder andere Musiker dazu beigetragen, die Blues-Mundharmonika in die französische Mainstream-Popmusik zu bringen — sowohl als Klang hinter jahrzehntelangen Chanson-Aufnahmen als auch als Solokünstler, dessen Victoires de la Musique dem Instrument eine seltene institutionelle Anerkennung in Frankreich verschafften (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Milteau zrobił więcej niż jakikolwiek inny muzyk, by wprowadzić harmonijkę bluesową do głównego nurtu francuskiej muzyki popularnej — zarówno jako brzmienie stojące za dekadami nagrań chanson, jak i jako artysta solowy, którego Victoires de la Musique dały temu instrumentowi rzadkie, instytucjonalne uznanie we Francji (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).', '[]', '{"en":["Bastille Blues (1999)","Explorer (1991, Victoire de la Musique)","Memphis (2001, Victoire de la Musique)"],"no":["Bastille Blues (1999)","Explorer (1991, Victoire de la Musique)","Memphis (2001, Victoire de la Musique)"],"sv":["Bastille Blues (1999)","Explorer (1991, Victoire de la Musique)","Memphis (2001, Victoire de la Musique)"],"de":["Bastille Blues (1999)","Explorer (1991, Victoire de la Musique)","Memphis (2001, Victoire de la Musique)"],"pl":["Bastille Blues (1999)","Explorer (1991, Victoire de la Musique)","Memphis (2001, Victoire de la Musique)"]}', '[]', '["Harmonica"]', '["Harmonica Blues","Chicago Blues","Chanson"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["1989: Released debut solo album \"Blues Harp\" (Source: en.wikipedia.org).","1991: Won Victoire de la Musique for \"Explorer\" (Source: en.wikipedia.org).","1992: Joined the touring charity troupe Les Enfoirés (Source: en.wikipedia.org).","2001: Won a second Victoire de la Musique for \"Memphis\" (Source: en.wikipedia.org).","2014: Named Officier des Arts et des Lettres (Source: en.wikipedia.org)."],"no":["1989: Ga ut debut-soloalbumet «Blues Harp» (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).","1991: Vant Victoire de la Musique for «Explorer» (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).","1992: Ble med i den veldedige turnétroppen Les Enfoirés (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).","2001: Vant en ny Victoire de la Musique for «Memphis» (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).","2014: Utnevnt til Officier des Arts et des Lettres (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org)."],"sv":["1989: Släppte debut-soloalbumet »Blues Harp« (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).","1991: Vann Victoire de la Musique för »Explorer« (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).","1992: Gick med i den välgörande turnétruppen Les Enfoirés (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).","2001: Vann ytterligare en Victoire de la Musique för »Memphis« (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).","2014: Utnämnd till Officier des Arts et des Lettres (Källa: en.wikipedia.org)."],"de":["1989: Veröffentlichung des Solo-Debütalbums „Blues Harp“ (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).","1991: Gewinn des Victoire de la Musique für „Explorer“ (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).","1992: Beitritt zur Wohltätigkeits-Tourtruppe Les Enfoirés (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).","2001: Zweiter Victoire de la Musique für „Memphis“ (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).","2014: Ernennung zum Officier des Arts et des Lettres (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org)."],"pl":["1989: Wydanie debiutanckiego albumu solowego „Blues Harp” (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).","1991: Zdobycie Victoire de la Musique za „Explorer” (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).","1992: Dołączenie do charytatywnej trupy koncertowej Les Enfoirés (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).","2001: Kolejne Victoire de la Musique za „Memphis” (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).","2014: Otrzymanie tytułu Officier des Arts et des Lettres (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"Jean-Jacques Milteau - Keep on Moving (Clip officiel)","youtube_id":"U9Clw6taDXQ","channel":"JJMilteauVEVO"},{"kind":"more","title":"People get ready - Jean-Jacques Milteau - Live @ Le Pont des Artistes","youtube_id":"2T44J3ig_ag","channel":"Le Triton"}]', '{"en":[{"year":1989,"title":"Blues Harp","notes":"Debut solo album. Source: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1991,"title":"Explorer","notes":"Victoire de la Musique winner. Source: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1999,"title":"Bastille Blues"},{"year":2001,"title":"Memphis","notes":"Victoire de la Musique winner. Source: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2010,"title":"Routes","notes":"Source: en.wikipedia.org."}],"no":[{"year":1989,"title":"Blues Harp","notes":"Debut-soloalbum. Kilde: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1991,"title":"Explorer","notes":"Vant Victoire de la Musique. Kilde: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1999,"title":"Bastille Blues"},{"year":2001,"title":"Memphis","notes":"Vant Victoire de la Musique. Kilde: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2010,"title":"Routes","notes":"Kilde: en.wikipedia.org."}],"sv":[{"year":1989,"title":"Blues Harp","notes":"Debut-soloalbum. Källa: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1991,"title":"Explorer","notes":"Vann Victoire de la Musique. Källa: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1999,"title":"Bastille Blues"},{"year":2001,"title":"Memphis","notes":"Vann Victoire de la Musique. Källa: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2010,"title":"Routes","notes":"Källa: en.wikipedia.org."}],"de":[{"year":1989,"title":"Blues Harp","notes":"Solo-Debütalbum. Quelle: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1991,"title":"Explorer","notes":"Victoire de la Musique. Quelle: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1999,"title":"Bastille Blues"},{"year":2001,"title":"Memphis","notes":"Victoire de la Musique. Quelle: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2010,"title":"Routes","notes":"Quelle: en.wikipedia.org."}],"pl":[{"year":1989,"title":"Blues Harp","notes":"Debiutancki album solowy. Źródło: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1991,"title":"Explorer","notes":"Zdobył Victoire de la Musique. Źródło: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":1999,"title":"Bastille Blues"},{"year":2001,"title":"Memphis","notes":"Zdobył Victoire de la Musique. Źródło: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2010,"title":"Routes","notes":"Źródło: en.wikipedia.org."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[{"year":1991,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Explorer"},{"year":2001,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Memphis"},{"year":2014,"title":"Officier des Arts et des Lettres","category":"French state honour"}],"no":[{"year":1991,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Explorer"},{"year":2001,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Memphis"},{"year":2014,"title":"Officier des Arts et des Lettres","category":"Fransk statsutmerkelse"}],"sv":[{"year":1991,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Explorer"},{"year":2001,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Memphis"},{"year":2014,"title":"Officier des Arts et des Lettres","category":"Fransk statlig utmärkelse"}],"de":[{"year":1991,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Explorer"},{"year":2001,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Memphis"},{"year":2014,"title":"Officier des Arts et des Lettres","category":"Französische Staatsauszeichnung"}],"pl":[{"year":1991,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Explorer"},{"year":2001,"title":"Victoire de la Musique","category":"Memphis"},{"year":2014,"title":"Officier des Arts et des Lettres","category":"Francuskie odznaczenie państwowe"}]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau – France''s Leading Blues Harmonica Player | SlowBlues', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau – Frankrikes fremste blues-munnspiller | SlowBlues', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau – Frankrikes främsta bluesmunspelare | SlowBlues', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau – Frankreichs führender Blues-Mundharmonikaspieler | SlowBlues', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau – Czołowy francuski harmonijkarz bluesowy | SlowBlues', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau is France''s most decorated blues harmonica player, a two-time Victoire de la Musique winner from Paris. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau er Frankrikes mest prisbelønte blues-munnspiller, dobbel vinner av Victoire de la Musique, fra Paris. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau är Frankrikes mest prisbelönta bluesmunspelare, dubbel vinnare av Victoire de la Musique, från Paris. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau ist Frankreichs meistausgezeichneter Blues-Mundharmonikaspieler, zweifacher Gewinner des Victoire de la Musique, aus Paris. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Jean-Jacques Milteau to najbardziej utytułowany francuski harmonijkarz bluesowy, dwukrotny laureat Victoire de la Musique, pochodzący z Paryża. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{}', '[]', '[{"title":"Jean-Jacques Milteau — Wikipedia (EN)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean-Jacques_Milteau"},{"title":"Site officiel — jjmilteau.net","url":"https://jjmilteau.net/"}]', 'https://jjmilteau.net/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":null,"note":"Ingen offentlig booking-kontakt funnet — kontakt via offisiell nettside."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('b185e042-8023-495e-ae7f-39fec110b9a2', 'jessie-lee-and-the-alchemists', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://i0.wp.com/www.luxe-infinity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/jessie-alchemists-groupe.jpg?fit=1200%2C700%26ssl=1', NULL, 'Foto: Denis Darotcheche (luxe-infinity.com, Cognac Blues Passions)', '[]', '[]', 'Modern French blues-rock quintet co-led by singer-guitarist Jessie Lee and guitarist-composer Alexis "Mr AL" Didier, whose 2022 album was mixed by Kevin Shirley (Aerosmith, Led Zeppelin, Joe Bonamassa).', 'Moderne fransk bluesrock-kvintett co-ledet av vokalist-gitarist Jessie Lee og gitarist-komponist Alexis «Mr AL» Didier, hvis album fra 2021 ble mikset av Kevin Shirley (Aerosmith, Led Zeppelin, Joe Bonamassa).', 'Modern fransk bluesrock-kvintett samledd av sångerskan-gitarristen Jessie Lee och gitarristen-kompositören Alexis »Mr AL« Didier, vars album från 2021 mixades av Kevin Shirley (Aerosmith, Led Zeppelin, Joe Bonamassa).', 'Modernes französisches Bluesrock-Quintett, gemeinsam geleitet von Sängerin-Gitarristin Jessie Lee und Gitarrist-Komponist Alexis „Mr AL“ Didier, dessen Album von 2021 von Kevin Shirley (Aerosmith, Led Zeppelin, Joe Bonamassa) abgemischt wurde.', 'Nowoczesny francuski kwintet blues-rockowy prowadzony wspólnie przez wokalistkę i gitarzystkę Jessie Lee oraz gitarzystę i kompozytora Alexisa „Mr AL” Didiera, którego album z 2021 roku zmiksował Kevin Shirley (Aerosmith, Led Zeppelin, Joe Bonamassa).', 'Jessie Lee met guitarist and composer Alexis Didier in late 2011, and after several years performing together they formalised Jessie Lee & The Alchemists in 2015 as a modern blues-rock quintet, rounded out by bassist Laurent Cokelaere, drummer Stéphane Minana and organist Laurian Daire (Source: rockmadeinfrance.com; jessieleeandthealchemists.fr). Drawing on blues, rock, soul, pop and jazz, the band builds original material described as combining "emotion, freedom and power." In 2018 they won five awards at the International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge, followed in 2019 by winning the Challenge France Blues, then reached the top 5 at the European Blues Challenge 2022 in Malmö, Sweden, and opened for Jeff Beck at Paris''s L''Olympia in July 2022 (Source: rockmadeinfrance.com). Their second album, "Let It Shine" (2021, Dixiefrog), was mixed by Kevin Shirley, and Jessie Lee received the France Blues Award for "Voice of the Year" for 2025 (Source: rockmadeinfrance.com).', 'Jessie Lee møtte gitarist og komponist Alexis Didier sent i 2011, og etter flere år med felles opptredener formaliserte de Jessie Lee & The Alchemists i 2015 som en moderne bluesrock-kvintett, komplettert med bassist Laurent Cokelaere, trommeslager Stéphane Minana og organist Laurian Daire (Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com; jessieleeandthealchemists.fr). Med utgangspunkt i blues, rock, soul, pop og jazz bygger bandet originalmateriale beskrevet som en kombinasjon av «følelse, frihet og kraft». I 2018 vant de fem priser ved International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge, fulgt i 2019 av seier i Challenge France Blues, deretter topp 5 ved European Blues Challenge 2022 i Malmö, Sverige, og åpnet for Jeff Beck på L''Olympia i Paris i juli 2022 (Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com). Det andre albumet, «Let It Shine» (2021, Dixiefrog), ble mikset av Kevin Shirley, og Jessie Lee mottok France Blues Award for «Årets vokalist» for 2025 (Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com).', 'Jessie Lee träffade gitarristen och kompositören Alexis Didier i slutet av 2011, och efter flera års gemensamma framträdanden formaliserade de Jessie Lee & The Alchemists 2015 som en modern bluesrock-kvintett, kompletterad med basisten Laurent Cokelaere, trumslagaren Stéphane Minana och organisten Laurian Daire (Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com; jessieleeandthealchemists.fr). Med utgångspunkt i blues, rock, soul, pop och jazz bygger bandet originalmaterial som beskrivs som en kombination av »känsla, frihet och kraft«. 2018 vann de fem priser vid International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge, följt av seger i Challenge France Blues 2019, sedan topp 5 vid European Blues Challenge 2022 i Malmö, Sverige, och öppnade för Jeff Beck på L''Olympia i Paris i juli 2022 (Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com). Det andra albumet, »Let It Shine« (2021, Dixiefrog), mixades av Kevin Shirley, och Jessie Lee tilldelades France Blues Award för »Årets röst« för 2025 (Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com).', 'Jessie Lee lernte den Gitarristen und Komponisten Alexis Didier Ende 2011 kennen, und nach mehreren Jahren gemeinsamer Auftritte formalisierten sie 2015 Jessie Lee & The Alchemists als modernes Bluesrock-Quintett, ergänzt durch Bassist Laurent Cokelaere, Schlagzeuger Stéphane Minana und Organist Laurian Daire (Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com; jessieleeandthealchemists.fr). Ausgehend von Blues, Rock, Soul, Pop und Jazz baut die Band eigenes Material, das als Kombination aus „Emotion, Freiheit und Kraft“ beschrieben wird. 2018 gewannen sie fünf Auszeichnungen bei der International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge, gefolgt vom Sieg bei der Challenge France Blues 2019, dann Platz unter den Top 5 bei der European Blues Challenge 2022 in Malmö, Schweden, und eröffneten im Juli 2022 für Jeff Beck im Pariser L''Olympia (Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com). Ihr zweites Album „Let It Shine“ (2021, Dixiefrog) wurde von Kevin Shirley abgemischt, und Jessie Lee erhielt den France Blues Award als „Stimme des Jahres“ für 2025 (Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com).', 'Jessie Lee poznała gitarzystę i kompozytora Alexisa Didiera pod koniec 2011 roku, a po kilku latach wspólnych występów sformalizowali w 2015 roku Jessie Lee & The Alchemists jako nowoczesny kwintet blues-rockowy, uzupełniony przez basistę Laurenta Cokelaere''a, perkusistę Stéphane''a Minanę i organistę Lauriana Daire''a (Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com; jessieleeandthealchemists.fr). Czerpiąc z bluesa, rocka, soulu, popu i jazzu, zespół tworzy autorski materiał opisywany jako połączenie „emocji, wolności i mocy”. W 2018 roku zdobyli pięć nagród na International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge, w 2019 roku wygrali Challenge France Blues, a następnie znaleźli się w top 5 na European Blues Challenge 2022 w Malmö w Szwecji i wystąpili przed Jeffem Beckiem w paryskim L''Olympia w lipcu 2022 roku (Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com). Ich drugi album, „Let It Shine” (2021, Dixiefrog), zmiksował Kevin Shirley, a Jessie Lee otrzymała nagrodę France Blues Award dla „Głosu Roku” za 2025 rok (Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Frankrike', '2015–', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists exemplify the internationally competitive edge of contemporary French blues — a band whose Mississippi and European Challenge results and Jeff Beck support slot have put them on a genuinely international stage rather than a purely domestic one (Source: rockmadeinfrance.com).', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists eksemplifiserer den internasjonalt konkurransedyktige kanten av samtidig fransk blues — et band hvis resultater i Mississippi- og Europa-utfordringene og support-spillejobben for Jeff Beck har plassert dem på en genuint internasjonal scene fremfor en rent innenlandsk (Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com).', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists exemplifierar den internationellt konkurrenskraftiga kanten av samtida fransk blues — ett band vars resultat i Mississippi- och Europachallengerna och supportjobbet åt Jeff Beck har placerat dem på en genuint internationell scen snarare än en rent inhemsk (Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com).', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists verkörpern die international konkurrenzfähige Seite des zeitgenössischen französischen Blues — eine Band, deren Ergebnisse bei den Mississippi- und Europa-Challenges sowie das Vorprogramm für Jeff Beck sie auf eine wirklich internationale statt rein nationale Bühne gebracht haben (Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com).', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists uosabiają międzynarodowo konkurencyjne oblicze współczesnego francuskiego bluesa — zespół, którego wyniki na Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge i European Blues Challenge oraz występ supportujący Jeffa Becka wyniosły ich na naprawdę międzynarodową, a nie tylko krajową scenę (Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com).', '[]', '{"en":["Oh My Love (official video, from Legacy)","I''m Gonna Play The Blues (official video)","What I Need (official video)"],"no":["Oh My Love (offisiell video, fra Legacy)","I''m Gonna Play The Blues (offisiell video)","What I Need (offisiell video)"],"sv":["Oh My Love (officiell video, från Legacy)","I''m Gonna Play The Blues (officiell video)","What I Need (officiell video)"],"de":["Oh My Love (offizielles Video, von Legacy)","I''m Gonna Play The Blues (offizielles Video)","What I Need (offizielles Video)"],"pl":["Oh My Love (oficjalny teledysk, z Legacy)","I''m Gonna Play The Blues (oficjalny teledysk)","What I Need (oficjalny teledysk)"]}', '[]', '["Vocals","Guitar","Bass","Drums","Organ"]', '["Blues Rock","Soul","Modern Blues"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["2015: Formalised as Jessie Lee & The Alchemists (Source: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2018: Won five awards at the International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge (Source: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2019: Won the Challenge France Blues (Source: rockmadeinfrance.com).","July 2022: Opened for Jeff Beck at L''Olympia, Paris (Source: rockmadeinfrance.com).","End of 2024: Jessie Lee awarded France Blues \"Voice of the Year\" 2025 (Source: rockmadeinfrance.com)."],"no":["2015: Formalisert som Jessie Lee & The Alchemists (Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2018: Vant fem priser ved International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge (Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2019: Vant Challenge France Blues (Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com).","Juli 2022: Åpnet for Jeff Beck på L''Olympia i Paris (Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com).","Slutten av 2024: Jessie Lee tildelt France Blues «Årets vokalist» 2025 (Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com)."],"sv":["2015: Formaliserades som Jessie Lee & The Alchemists (Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2018: Vann fem priser vid International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge (Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2019: Vann Challenge France Blues (Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com).","Juli 2022: Öppnade för Jeff Beck på L''Olympia i Paris (Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com).","Slutet av 2024: Jessie Lee tilldelades France Blues »Årets röst« 2025 (Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com)."],"de":["2015: Formalisierung als Jessie Lee & The Alchemists (Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2018: Fünf Auszeichnungen bei der International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge (Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2019: Sieg bei der Challenge France Blues (Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com).","Juli 2022: Vorprogramm für Jeff Beck im L''Olympia, Paris (Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com).","Ende 2024: Jessie Lee erhält France Blues „Stimme des Jahres“ 2025 (Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com)."],"pl":["2015: Formalizacja jako Jessie Lee & The Alchemists (Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2018: Pięć nagród na International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge (Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com).","2019: Zwycięstwo w Challenge France Blues (Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com).","Lipiec 2022: Support przed Jeffem Beckiem w L''Olympia w Paryżu (Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com).","Koniec 2024: Jessie Lee otrzymuje nagrodę France Blues „Głos Roku” 2025 (Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists - \"Oh My Love\" (Official Music Video)","youtube_id":"-FZqt87NrwY","channel":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists"},{"kind":"more","title":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists - \"What I Feel\" (Official Music Video)","youtube_id":"kSesOJKZj-k","channel":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists"}]', '{"en":[{"year":2018,"title":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists","notes":"Debut album. Source: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2021,"title":"Let It Shine","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Mixed by Kevin Shirley. Source: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2025,"title":"Legacy","notes":"Released 4 July 2025. Source: rockmadeinfrance.com."}],"no":[{"year":2018,"title":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists","notes":"Debutalbum. Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2021,"title":"Let It Shine","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Mikset av Kevin Shirley. Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2025,"title":"Legacy","notes":"Utgitt 4. juli 2025. Kilde: rockmadeinfrance.com."}],"sv":[{"year":2018,"title":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists","notes":"Debutalbum. Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2021,"title":"Let It Shine","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Mixat av Kevin Shirley. Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2025,"title":"Legacy","notes":"Släppt 4 juli 2025. Källa: rockmadeinfrance.com."}],"de":[{"year":2018,"title":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists","notes":"Debütalbum. Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2021,"title":"Let It Shine","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Abgemischt von Kevin Shirley. Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2025,"title":"Legacy","notes":"Veröffentlicht am 4. Juli 2025. Quelle: rockmadeinfrance.com."}],"pl":[{"year":2018,"title":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists","notes":"Album debiutancki. Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2021,"title":"Let It Shine","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Zmiksowany przez Kevina Shirleya. Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com."},{"year":2025,"title":"Legacy","notes":"Wydany 4 lipca 2025. Źródło: rockmadeinfrance.com."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[{"year":2018,"title":"International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge","category":"5 awards"},{"year":2019,"title":"Challenge France Blues","category":"Winner"},{"year":2022,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Malmö","category":"Top 5"},{"year":2025,"title":"France Blues Award","category":"Voice of the Year (Jessie Lee)"}],"no":[{"year":2018,"title":"International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge","category":"5 priser"},{"year":2019,"title":"Challenge France Blues","category":"Vinner"},{"year":2022,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Malmö","category":"Topp 5"},{"year":2025,"title":"France Blues Award","category":"Årets vokalist (Jessie Lee)"}],"sv":[{"year":2018,"title":"International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge","category":"5 priser"},{"year":2019,"title":"Challenge France Blues","category":"Vinnare"},{"year":2022,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Malmö","category":"Topp 5"},{"year":2025,"title":"France Blues Award","category":"Årets röst (Jessie Lee)"}],"de":[{"year":2018,"title":"International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge","category":"5 Auszeichnungen"},{"year":2019,"title":"Challenge France Blues","category":"Sieger"},{"year":2022,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Malmö","category":"Top 5"},{"year":2025,"title":"France Blues Award","category":"Stimme des Jahres (Jessie Lee)"}],"pl":[{"year":2018,"title":"International Mississippi Blues Trail Challenge","category":"5 nagród"},{"year":2019,"title":"Challenge France Blues","category":"Zwycięzca"},{"year":2022,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Malmö","category":"Top 5"},{"year":2025,"title":"France Blues Award","category":"Głos Roku (Jessie Lee)"}]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists – French Blues-Rock Quintet | SlowBlues', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists – Fransk bluesrock-kvintett | SlowBlues', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists – Fransk bluesrock-kvintett | SlowBlues', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists – Französisches Bluesrock-Quintett | SlowBlues', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists – Francuski kwintet blues-rockowy | SlowBlues', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists is an award-winning modern French blues-rock quintet led by Jessie Lee and Alexis Didier. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists er en prisbelønt moderne fransk bluesrock-kvintett ledet av Jessie Lee og Alexis Didier. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists är en prisbelönt modern fransk bluesrock-kvintett ledd av Jessie Lee och Alexis Didier. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists ist ein preisgekröntes modernes französisches Bluesrock-Quintett unter der Leitung von Jessie Lee und Alexis Didier. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Jessie Lee & The Alchemists to nagradzany nowoczesny francuski kwintet blues-rockowy prowadzony przez Jessie Lee i Alexisa Didiera. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/Jessie-Lee-The-Alchemists-1723949824499868/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jessieleeandthealchemists/","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWGKe8ckdhR05WAyxUZwN8Q"}', '[]', '[{"title":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists — Rock made in France","url":"https://www.rockmadeinfrance.com/encyclo/jessie-lee-the-alchemists/38218/"},{"title":"Jessie Lee & The Alchemists — Dixiefrog Records","url":"https://dixiefrog.com/en/artist/jessie-lee-the-alchemists-2/"}]', 'https://jessieleeandthealchemists.fr/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"https://jessieleeandthealchemists.fr/","note":"Ingen offentlig booking-kontakt funnet — kontakt via offisiell nettside."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('ec8650b4-c167-4e87-bf01-3dfadf08d057', 'la-bedoune', 'La Bedoune', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://i0.wp.com/storyboardmemphis.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_2065.jpg?resize=790%2C593&ssl=1', NULL, 'Foto: Ken Billett (storyboardmemphis.org, International Blues Challenge Memphis 2022)', '[]', '[]', 'French "one woman & man band" duo — Cécile Perfetti (vocals, fretless bass) and Greg Perfetti (guitars, percussion) — that blends blues, jazz and folk with French lyrics.', 'Fransk «one woman & man band»-duo — Cécile Perfetti (vokal, bånd-løs bass) og Greg Perfetti (gitarer, perkusjon) — som blander blues, jazz og folk med franske tekster.', 'Fransk »one woman & man band«-duo — Cécile Perfetti (sång, bandlös bas) och Greg Perfetti (gitarrer, percussion) — som blandar blues, jazz och folk med franska texter.', 'Französisches „One Woman & Man Band“-Duo — Cécile Perfetti (Gesang, bundloser Bass) und Greg Perfetti (Gitarren, Percussion) — das Blues, Jazz und Folk mit französischen Texten verbindet.', 'Francuski duet w formule „one woman & man band” — Cécile Perfetti (wokal, bezprogowa gitara basowa) i Greg Perfetti (gitary, perkusjonalia) — łączący blues, jazz i folk z francuskimi tekstami.', 'La Bedoune is built around Cécile Perfetti, who lends the project its name, and Greg Perfetti, working as a self-described "one woman & man band" (Source: labedoune.fr). Cécile handles lead vocals and fretless bass while Greg covers guitars and percussion; the act started life as a trio, then quartet, before settling into its current duo format. The pair won the French Blues Challenge in 2019 and reached the semi-finals of the International Blues Challenge in Memphis, returning as finalists in 2022 (Source: labedoune.fr). Their fourth album, "Roue de fortune," is a 12-track set blending blues, jazz and folk with French-language lyrics, and the band has more recently been recognised as Francophone Blues Artist of the Year 2026, Voice of the Year 2026, and Album of the Year 2025 (Source: labedoune.fr).', 'La Bedoune er bygget rundt Cécile Perfetti, som gir prosjektet navnet sitt, og Greg Perfetti, og opererer som et selverklært «one woman & man band» (Kilde: labedoune.fr). Cécile står for lead-vokal og bånd-løs bass mens Greg dekker gitarer og perkusjon; duoen startet som trio, deretter kvartett, før den ble til dagens duoformat. Paret vant Challenge France Blues i 2019 og nådde semifinalen i International Blues Challenge i Memphis, med retur som finalister i 2022 (Kilde: labedoune.fr). Det fjerde albumet, «Roue de fortune», er en 12-spors samling som blander blues, jazz og folk med fransk-språklige tekster, og bandet er nylig blitt kåret til Francophone Blues Artist of the Year 2026, Voice of the Year 2026, og Album of the Year 2025 (Kilde: labedoune.fr).', 'La Bedoune är byggt kring Cécile Perfetti, som ger projektet dess namn, och Greg Perfetti, och verkar som ett självutnämnt »one woman & man band« (Källa: labedoune.fr). Cécile står för lead-sång och bandlös bas medan Greg täcker gitarrer och percussion; duon startade som trio, sedan kvartett, innan den blev dagens duoformat. Paret vann Challenge France Blues 2019 och nådde semifinalen i International Blues Challenge i Memphis, med återkomst som finalister 2022 (Källa: labedoune.fr). Det fjärde albumet, »Roue de fortune«, är en samling med 12 spår som blandar blues, jazz och folk med franskspråkiga texter, och bandet har nyligen utsetts till Francophone Blues Artist of the Year 2026, Voice of the Year 2026 och Album of the Year 2025 (Källa: labedoune.fr).', 'La Bedoune ist um Cécile Perfetti, die dem Projekt ihren Namen gibt, und Greg Perfetti aufgebaut und tritt als selbsternannte „One Woman & Man Band“ auf (Quelle: labedoune.fr). Cécile übernimmt Leadgesang und bundlosen Bass, während Greg Gitarren und Percussion abdeckt; das Duo startete als Trio, dann Quartett, bevor es sich zum heutigen Duo-Format entwickelte. Das Paar gewann 2019 die Challenge France Blues und erreichte das Halbfinale der International Blues Challenge in Memphis, mit einer Rückkehr als Finalisten 2022 (Quelle: labedoune.fr). Ihr viertes Album, „Roue de fortune“, ist eine 12 Titel umfassende Sammlung, die Blues, Jazz und Folk mit französischsprachigen Texten verbindet, und die Band wurde kürzlich als Francophone Blues Artist of the Year 2026, Voice of the Year 2026 und Album of the Year 2025 ausgezeichnet (Quelle: labedoune.fr).', 'La Bedoune to projekt zbudowany wokół Cécile Perfetti, która nadaje mu nazwę, oraz Grega Perfettiego, działający jako samookreślony „one woman & man band” (Źródło: labedoune.fr). Cécile odpowiada za wokal prowadzący i bezprogową gitarę basową, a Greg za gitary i perkusjonalia; zespół zaczynał jako trio, potem kwartet, zanim ustabilizował się w obecnym formacie duetu. Duet wygrał Challenge France Blues w 2019 roku i dotarł do półfinału International Blues Challenge w Memphis, wracając jako finaliści w 2022 roku (Źródło: labedoune.fr). Ich czwarty album, „Roue de fortune”, to zestaw 12 utworów łączących blues, jazz i folk z francuskojęzycznymi tekstami, a zespół został ostatnio uhonorowany tytułami Francophone Blues Artist of the Year 2026, Voice of the Year 2026 i Album of the Year 2025 (Źródło: labedoune.fr).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Frankrike', '2019–', 'La Bedoune''s stripped-down, two-piece format and French-language songwriting represent a distinctly homegrown strand of the contemporary French blues scene, proving a full band sound is achievable with just voice, fretless bass and guitar/percussion (Source: labedoune.fr).', 'La Bedounes nedstrippede toparts-format og fransk-språklige låtskriving representerer en tydelig hjemmegrodd gren av den samtidige franske bluesscenen, og beviser at en full bandlyd er oppnåelig med bare vokal, bånd-løs bass og gitar/perkusjon (Kilde: labedoune.fr).', 'La Bedounes avskalade tvådelade format och franskspråkiga låtskrivande representerar en tydligt hemvuxen gren av den samtida franska bluesscenen, och bevisar att ett fullt bandsound är möjligt med enbart sång, bandlös bas och gitarr/percussion (Källa: labedoune.fr).', 'La Bedounes reduziertes Zweier-Format und die französischsprachige Songwriting-Tradition stehen für einen deutlich hausgemachten Zweig der zeitgenössischen französischen Bluesszene und beweisen, dass ein voller Bandsound allein mit Stimme, bundlosem Bass und Gitarre/Percussion erreichbar ist (Quelle: labedoune.fr).', 'Okrojony, dwuosobowy format La Bedoune i francuskojęzyczne teksty reprezentują wyraźnie rodzimą gałąź współczesnej francuskiej sceny bluesowej, dowodząc, że pełne brzmienie zespołu można osiągnąć samym głosem, bezprogową gitarą basową i gitarą/perkusjonaliami (Źródło: labedoune.fr).', '[]', '{"en":["Straight Ahead (Cécile Perfetti/Greg Perfetti)","Mississippi Flowers (Cécile Perfetti)","Damn Ringing Phone"],"no":["Straight Ahead (Cécile Perfetti/Greg Perfetti)","Mississippi Flowers (Cécile Perfetti)","Damn Ringing Phone"],"sv":["Straight Ahead (Cécile Perfetti/Greg Perfetti)","Mississippi Flowers (Cécile Perfetti)","Damn Ringing Phone"],"de":["Straight Ahead (Cécile Perfetti/Greg Perfetti)","Mississippi Flowers (Cécile Perfetti)","Damn Ringing Phone"],"pl":["Straight Ahead (Cécile Perfetti/Greg Perfetti)","Mississippi Flowers (Cécile Perfetti)","Damn Ringing Phone"]}', '[]', '["Vocals","Fretless bass","Guitar","Percussion"]', '["Acoustic Blues","Folk Blues","Jazz Blues"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["2019: Won the French Blues Challenge (Source: labedoune.fr).","2022: Finalists at the International Blues Challenge, Memphis (Source: labedoune.fr).","2025–2026: Named Francophone Blues Artist of the Year, Voice of the Year, and Album of the Year (Source: labedoune.fr)."],"no":["2019: Vant Challenge France Blues (Kilde: labedoune.fr).","2022: Finalister ved International Blues Challenge, Memphis (Kilde: labedoune.fr).","2025–2026: Kåret til Francophone Blues Artist of the Year, Voice of the Year, og Album of the Year (Kilde: labedoune.fr)."],"sv":["2019: Vann Challenge France Blues (Källa: labedoune.fr).","2022: Finalister vid International Blues Challenge, Memphis (Källa: labedoune.fr).","2025–2026: Utsedd till Francophone Blues Artist of the Year, Voice of the Year och Album of the Year (Källa: labedoune.fr)."],"de":["2019: Sieg bei der Challenge France Blues (Quelle: labedoune.fr).","2022: Finalisten bei der International Blues Challenge, Memphis (Quelle: labedoune.fr).","2025–2026: Auszeichnung als Francophone Blues Artist of the Year, Voice of the Year und Album of the Year (Quelle: labedoune.fr)."],"pl":["2019: Zwycięstwo w Challenge France Blues (Źródło: labedoune.fr).","2022: Finaliści International Blues Challenge w Memphis (Źródło: labedoune.fr).","2025–2026: Tytuły Francophone Blues Artist of the Year, Voice of the Year i Album of the Year (Źródło: labedoune.fr)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"La Bedoune - Straight Ahead (Cécile Perfetti/Greg Perfetti)","youtube_id":"RFeuEhbN8q8","channel":"La Bedoune"},{"kind":"more","title":"La Bedoune - Mississippi flowers (Cécile Perfetti)","youtube_id":"ljWdX11ivb8","channel":"La Bedoune"}]', '{"en":[{"year":2025,"title":"Roue de fortune","notes":"Fourth album, 12 tracks, French lyrics. Source: labedoune.fr."}],"no":[{"year":2025,"title":"Roue de fortune","notes":"Fjerde album, 12 spor, franske tekster. Kilde: labedoune.fr."}],"sv":[{"year":2025,"title":"Roue de fortune","notes":"Fjärde albumet, 12 spår, franska texter. Källa: labedoune.fr."}],"de":[{"year":2025,"title":"Roue de fortune","notes":"Viertes Album, 12 Titel, französische Texte. Quelle: labedoune.fr."}],"pl":[{"year":2025,"title":"Roue de fortune","notes":"Czwarty album, 12 utworów, francuskie teksty. Źródło: labedoune.fr."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[{"year":2019,"title":"French Blues Challenge","category":"Winner"},{"year":2026,"title":"Francophone Blues Artist of the Year"},{"year":2026,"title":"Voice of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"Album of the Year"}],"no":[{"year":2019,"title":"Challenge France Blues","category":"Vinner"},{"year":2026,"title":"Francophone Blues Artist of the Year"},{"year":2026,"title":"Voice of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"Album of the Year"}],"sv":[{"year":2019,"title":"Challenge France Blues","category":"Vinnare"},{"year":2026,"title":"Francophone Blues Artist of the Year"},{"year":2026,"title":"Voice of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"Album of the Year"}],"de":[{"year":2019,"title":"Challenge France Blues","category":"Sieger"},{"year":2026,"title":"Francophone Blues Artist of the Year"},{"year":2026,"title":"Voice of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"Album of the Year"}],"pl":[{"year":2019,"title":"Challenge France Blues","category":"Zwycięzca"},{"year":2026,"title":"Francophone Blues Artist of the Year"},{"year":2026,"title":"Voice of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"Album of the Year"}]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'La Bedoune – French Blues Duo | SlowBlues', 'La Bedoune – Fransk bluesduo | SlowBlues', 'La Bedoune – Fransk bluesduo | SlowBlues', 'La Bedoune – Französisches Blues-Duo | SlowBlues', 'La Bedoune – Francuski duet bluesowy | SlowBlues', 'La Bedoune is a French "one woman & man band" blues duo, French Blues Challenge winners with a genuinely acoustic, French-language sound. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'La Bedoune er en fransk «one woman & man band» blues-duo, vinnere av Challenge France Blues med en genuint akustisk, fransk-språklig lyd. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'La Bedoune är en fransk »one woman & man band« bluesduo, vinnare av Challenge France Blues med ett genuint akustiskt, franskspråkigt sound. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'La Bedoune ist ein französisches „One Woman & Man Band“-Blues-Duo, Sieger der Challenge France Blues mit einem echten akustischen, französischsprachigen Sound. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'La Bedoune to francuski bluesowy duet w formule „one woman & man band”, zwycięzcy Challenge France Blues z prawdziwie akustycznym, francuskojęzycznym brzmieniem. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/bedouneblues","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/la.bedoune/","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/@labedounemusic"}', '[]', '[{"title":"La Bedoune — Site officiel","url":"https://labedoune.fr/"}]', 'https://labedoune.fr/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"https://labedoune.fr/booking.html","source_url":"https://labedoune.fr/booking.html","note":"Kontakt/booking via offisiell nettside. Ingen offentlig booking-e-post/telefon funnet."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('beefb962-384b-4925-b944-624c7f80d644', 'malted-milk', 'Malted Milk', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://i0.wp.com/lestempsdublues.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/MM2.jpeg?resize=1024%2C683&ssl=1', NULL, 'Foto: Margaux Martin (lestempsdublues.com)', '[]', '[]', 'Nantes-based band led by guitarist-singer Arnaud Fradin, evolved from an acoustic Delta-blues duo in the 1990s into a horn-driven soul and funk septet.', 'Nantes-basert band ledet av gitarist-vokalist Arnaud Fradin, utviklet fra en akustisk Delta-blues-duo på 1990-tallet til en blåserdrevet soul- og funk-septett.', 'Nantes-baserat band lett av gitarristen-sångaren Arnaud Fradin, utvecklat från en akustisk Delta-bluesduo på 1990-talet till en blåsardriven soul- och funksextett.', 'Band aus Nantes unter der Leitung von Gitarrist und Sänger Arnaud Fradin, entwickelt von einem akustischen Delta-Blues-Duo in den 1990er-Jahren zu einem bläsergetriebenen Soul- und Funk-Septett.', 'Zespół z Nantes prowadzony przez gitarzystę i wokalistę Arnauda Fradina, który ewoluował od akustycznego duetu delta-bluesowego w latach 90. do sekstetu soul-funkowego z sekcją dętą.', 'Malted Milk''s story begins in summer 1993 with a duo of Arnaud Fradin, then 17 and drawn to the Chicago sound, and Jean-Pierre Boyer, 27, originally playing under the name Delta Blues and performing Memphis soul (Source: fr.wikipedia.org). Renamed Malted Milk in 1998, the group expanded to include harmonica player Emmanuel Frangeul alongside drums, bass, a second guitar and organ. When Frangeul left in 2007, a small horn section replaced him, shifting the band''s sound from acoustic blues toward brassier funk (Source: fr.wikipedia.org). Now a septet fronted by Arnaud Fradin (vocals/guitar), with Igor Pichon (bass), Richard Housset (drums), Damien Cornelis (keys), Eric Chambouleyron (guitar), and horn players Vincent Aubert and Pierre-Marie Humeau, the band has released albums including "Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine" (2000), "Easy Baby" (2005), "Get Some" (2012), "Love, Tears and Guns" (2019) and "1975" (2024), and regularly competes internationally, including finals of the International Blues Challenge (Source: fr.wikipedia.org; malted-milk.com).', 'Malted Milks historie starter sommeren 1993 med en duo bestående av Arnaud Fradin, da 17 og trukket mot Chicago-lyden, og Jean-Pierre Boyer, 27, opprinnelig under navnet Delta Blues og med fokus på Memphis-soul (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org). Omdøpt til Malted Milk i 1998, utvidet gruppen med munnspillspiller Emmanuel Frangeul ved siden av trommer, bass, en ekstra gitar og orgel. Da Frangeul forlot bandet i 2007, erstattet en liten blåserseksjon ham, noe som skiftet lyden fra akustisk blues mot mer messingtung funk (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org). Nå en septett anført av Arnaud Fradin (vokal/gitar), med Igor Pichon (bass), Richard Housset (trommer), Damien Cornelis (keys), Eric Chambouleyron (gitar), og blåserne Vincent Aubert og Pierre-Marie Humeau, har bandet gitt ut album som «Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine» (2000), «Easy Baby» (2005), «Get Some» (2012), «Love, Tears and Guns» (2019) og «1975» (2024), og konkurrerer jevnlig internasjonalt, inkludert finaler i International Blues Challenge (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org; malted-milk.com).', 'Malted Milks historia börjar sommaren 1993 med en duo bestående av Arnaud Fradin, då 17 och dragen till Chicagoljudet, och Jean-Pierre Boyer, 27, ursprungligen under namnet Delta Blues med fokus på Memphis-soul (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org). Omdöpt till Malted Milk 1998 utökades gruppen med munspelaren Emmanuel Frangeul vid sidan av trummor, bas, ytterligare en gitarr och orgel. När Frangeul lämnade 2007 ersattes han av en liten blåssektion, vilket förde ljudet från akustisk blues mot mässingstyngre funk (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org). Nu en sjumannagrupp ledd av Arnaud Fradin (sång/gitarr), med Igor Pichon (bas), Richard Housset (trummor), Damien Cornelis (keyboard), Eric Chambouleyron (gitarr) och blåsarna Vincent Aubert och Pierre-Marie Humeau, har bandet släppt album som »Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine« (2000), »Easy Baby« (2005), »Get Some« (2012), »Love, Tears and Guns« (2019) och »1975« (2024), och tävlar regelbundet internationellt, inklusive finaler i International Blues Challenge (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org; malted-milk.com).', 'Die Geschichte von Malted Milk beginnt im Sommer 1993 mit einem Duo aus Arnaud Fradin, damals 17 und vom Chicago-Sound fasziniert, und Jean-Pierre Boyer, 27, ursprünglich unter dem Namen Delta Blues und mit Fokus auf Memphis-Soul (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org). 1998 in Malted Milk umbenannt, erweiterte sich die Gruppe um den Mundharmonikaspieler Emmanuel Frangeul neben Schlagzeug, Bass, einer zweiten Gitarre und Orgel. Als Frangeul 2007 die Band verließ, ersetzte ihn eine kleine Bläsersektion, was den Sound von akustischem Blues zu blechlastigerem Funk verschob (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org). Heute ein Septett unter Führung von Arnaud Fradin (Gesang/Gitarre), mit Igor Pichon (Bass), Richard Housset (Schlagzeug), Damien Cornelis (Keyboard), Eric Chambouleyron (Gitarre) und den Bläsern Vincent Aubert und Pierre-Marie Humeau, hat die Band Alben wie „Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine“ (2000), „Easy Baby“ (2005), „Get Some“ (2012), „Love, Tears and Guns“ (2019) und „1975“ (2024) veröffentlicht und tritt regelmäßig international an, unter anderem im Finale der International Blues Challenge (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org; malted-milk.com).', 'Historia Malted Milk zaczyna się latem 1993 roku od duetu Arnauda Fradina, wówczas 17-latka zafascynowanego brzmieniem Chicago, i Jean-Pierre''a Boyera, lat 27, występujących pierwotnie pod nazwą Delta Blues i grających memphiski soul (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org). Przemianowany na Malted Milk w 1998 roku zespół powiększył się o harmonijkarza Emmanuela Frangeula obok perkusji, basu, drugiej gitary i organów. Gdy Frangeul odszedł w 2007 roku, zastąpiła go niewielka sekcja dęta, co przesunęło brzmienie zespołu od akustycznego bluesa ku bardziej dętemu funkowi (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org). Dziś, jako septet prowadzony przez Arnauda Fradina (wokal/gitara), z Igorem Pichonem (bas), Richardem Houssetem (perkusja), Damienem Cornelisem (instrumenty klawiszowe), Erikiem Chambouleyronem (gitara) oraz sekcją dętą Vincentem Aubertem i Pierre''em-Marie Humeau, zespół wydał albumy takie jak „Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine” (2000), „Easy Baby” (2005), „Get Some” (2012), „Love, Tears and Guns” (2019) i „1975” (2024), regularnie startując w międzynarodowych konkursach, w tym w finałach International Blues Challenge (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org; malted-milk.com).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nantes, Frankrike', '1998–', 'Malted Milk''s three-decade evolution from acoustic Delta duo to horn-driven soul-funk septet traces, almost in miniature, the broader story of how French blues bands have widened their sound over time without losing the genre''s core (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Malted Milks tre tiår lange utvikling fra akustisk Delta-duo til blåserdrevet soul-funk-septett sporer, nesten i miniatyr, den bredere historien om hvordan franske bluesband har utvidet lyden sin over tid uten å miste sjangerens kjerne (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Malted Milks tre decennier långa utveckling från akustisk Delta-duo till blåsardriven soul-funksextett speglar, nästan i miniatyr, den bredare historien om hur franska bluesband har breddat sitt ljud över tid utan att förlora genrens kärna (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Malted Milks dreißigjährige Entwicklung von einem akustischen Delta-Duo zu einem bläsergetriebenen Soul-Funk-Septett spiegelt fast im Kleinen die größere Geschichte wider, wie französische Bluesbands ihren Sound im Laufe der Zeit erweitert haben, ohne den Kern des Genres zu verlieren (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Trwająca trzy dekady ewolucja Malted Milk od akustycznego duetu deltowego do sekstetu soul-funkowego z sekcją dętą odzwierciedla niemal w miniaturze szerszą historię tego, jak francuskie zespoły bluesowe poszerzały swoje brzmienie z biegiem czasu, nie tracąc przy tym rdzenia gatunku (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).', '[]', '{"en":["Love for Yourself (official video, from Love, Tears & Guns)","More & More","Children of the World"],"no":["Love for Yourself (offisiell video, fra Love, Tears & Guns)","More & More","Children of the World"],"sv":["Love for Yourself (officiell video, från Love, Tears & Guns)","More & More","Children of the World"],"de":["Love for Yourself (offizielles Video, von Love, Tears & Guns)","More & More","Children of the World"],"pl":["Love for Yourself (oficjalny teledysk, z Love, Tears & Guns)","More & More","Children of the World"]}', '[]', '["Vocals","Guitar","Bass","Drums","Keys","Trombone","Trumpet"]', '["Soul Blues","Funk","Memphis Soul"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["Summer 1993: Arnaud Fradin and Jean-Pierre Boyer begin performing as Delta Blues (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).","1998: Renamed Malted Milk, expanded with harmonica (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).","2007: Emmanuel Frangeul departs; horn section added, sound shifts toward funk (Source: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"no":["Sommeren 1993: Arnaud Fradin og Jean-Pierre Boyer begynner å opptre som Delta Blues (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).","1998: Omdøpt til Malted Milk, utvidet med munnspill (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).","2007: Emmanuel Frangeul slutter; blåserseksjon lagt til, lyden skifter mot funk (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"sv":["Sommaren 1993: Arnaud Fradin och Jean-Pierre Boyer börjar uppträda som Delta Blues (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).","1998: Omdöpt till Malted Milk, utökat med munspel (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).","2007: Emmanuel Frangeul slutar; blåssektion tillagd, ljudet skiftar mot funk (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"de":["Sommer 1993: Arnaud Fradin und Jean-Pierre Boyer beginnen als Delta Blues aufzutreten (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).","1998: Umbenennung in Malted Milk, Erweiterung um Mundharmonika (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).","2007: Emmanuel Frangeul verlässt die Band; Bläsersektion hinzugefügt, Sound verschiebt sich zu Funk (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"pl":["Lato 1993: Arnaud Fradin i Jean-Pierre Boyer zaczynają występować jako Delta Blues (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).","1998: Zmiana nazwy na Malted Milk, poszerzenie składu o harmonijkę (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).","2007: Odejście Emmanuela Frangeula; dodanie sekcji dętej, przesunięcie brzmienia w stronę funku (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"Malted Milk - Love for Yourself - official video","youtube_id":"w5XmdI5Cf98","channel":"MALTEDMILKMUSIC"},{"kind":"more","title":"Malted Milk (LOVE, TEARS & GUNS) - More & more","youtube_id":"ihkVr_5Gt5g","channel":"MALTEDMILKMUSIC"}]', '{"en":[{"year":2000,"title":"Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine","notes":"Source: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2005,"title":"Easy Baby"},{"year":2010,"title":"Sweet Soul Blues"},{"year":2012,"title":"Get Some"},{"year":2019,"title":"Love, Tears and Guns"},{"year":2024,"title":"1975","notes":"Seventh album. Source: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"no":[{"year":2000,"title":"Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine","notes":"Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2005,"title":"Easy Baby"},{"year":2010,"title":"Sweet Soul Blues"},{"year":2012,"title":"Get Some"},{"year":2019,"title":"Love, Tears and Guns"},{"year":2024,"title":"1975","notes":"Sjuende album. Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"sv":[{"year":2000,"title":"Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine","notes":"Källa: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2005,"title":"Easy Baby"},{"year":2010,"title":"Sweet Soul Blues"},{"year":2012,"title":"Get Some"},{"year":2019,"title":"Love, Tears and Guns"},{"year":2024,"title":"1975","notes":"Sjunde albumet. Källa: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"de":[{"year":2000,"title":"Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine","notes":"Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2005,"title":"Easy Baby"},{"year":2010,"title":"Sweet Soul Blues"},{"year":2012,"title":"Get Some"},{"year":2019,"title":"Love, Tears and Guns"},{"year":2024,"title":"1975","notes":"Siebtes Album. Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"pl":[{"year":2000,"title":"Peaches, Ice Cream & Wine","notes":"Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2005,"title":"Easy Baby"},{"year":2010,"title":"Sweet Soul Blues"},{"year":2012,"title":"Get Some"},{"year":2019,"title":"Love, Tears and Guns"},{"year":2024,"title":"1975","notes":"Siódmy album. Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Malted Milk – French Soul-Blues Band from Nantes | SlowBlues', 'Malted Milk – Fransk soul-blues-band fra Nantes | SlowBlues', 'Malted Milk – Franskt soul-bluesband från Nantes | SlowBlues', 'Malted Milk – Französische Soul-Blues-Band aus Nantes | SlowBlues', 'Malted Milk – Francuski zespół soul-bluesowy z Nantes | SlowBlues', 'Malted Milk is a Nantes-based soul-blues and funk band led by Arnaud Fradin, active since 1998. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Malted Milk er et soul-blues- og funk-band fra Nantes ledet av Arnaud Fradin, aktivt siden 1998. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Malted Milk är ett soul-blues- och funkband från Nantes lett av Arnaud Fradin, aktivt sedan 1998. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Malted Milk ist eine Soul-Blues- und Funk-Band aus Nantes unter der Leitung von Arnaud Fradin, aktiv seit 1998. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Malted Milk to zespół soul-bluesowy i funkowy z Nantes prowadzony przez Arnauda Fradina, działający od 1998 roku. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/maltedmilkofficiel","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/malted_milk/","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/user/MALTEDMILKMUSIC"}', '[]', '[{"title":"Malted Milk — Wikipédia (FR)","url":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malted_Milk"}]', 'https://www.malted-milk.com/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"https://www.malted-milk.com/contact","source_url":"https://www.malted-milk.com/contact","note":"Kontakt/booking via offisiell nettside. Ingen offentlig booking-e-post/telefon funnet."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('72230cf8-8233-4673-8dc8-0335aa1da381', 'manu-lanvin-the-devil-blues', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4f6ea0_3d95198d8d9d4dc98f60b82b07423b13~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1920,h_795,fp_0.54_0.46,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/4f6ea0_3d95198d8d9d4dc98f60b82b07423b13~mv2.jpg', NULL, 'Foto: Laetitia Benady (manulanvin.com, offisielt pressebilde)', '[]', '[]', 'Paris-born blues-rock power trio led by guitarist-singer Emmanuel "Manu" Lanvin, son of actor Gérard Lanvin, forged through a formative collaboration with Texan bluesman Calvin Russell.', 'Bluesrock-power trio fra Paris ledet av gitarist-vokalist Emmanuel «Manu» Lanvin, sønn av skuespiller Gérard Lanvin, formet gjennom et formende samarbeid med den texanske bluesmusikeren Calvin Russell.', 'Bluesrock-power trio från Paris ledd av gitarrist-sångaren Emmanuel »Manu« Lanvin, son till skådespelaren Gérard Lanvin, formad genom ett formativt samarbete med den texanske bluesmusikern Calvin Russell.', 'Bluesrock-Power-Trio aus Paris unter Leitung von Gitarrist und Sänger Emmanuel „Manu“ Lanvin, Sohn des Schauspielers Gérard Lanvin, geformt durch eine prägende Zusammenarbeit mit dem texanischen Bluesmusiker Calvin Russell.', 'Paryski power trio blues-rockowe prowadzone przez gitarzystę i wokalistę Emmanuela „Manu” Lanvina, syna aktora Gérarda Lanvina, ukształtowane przez przełomową współpracę z teksańskim bluesmanem Calvinem Russellem.', 'Emmanuel Lanvin was born in Paris on 24 November 1974 and picked up the electric guitar at 15 (Source: en.wikipedia.org). After three rock-leaning solo albums between 2000 and 2006, his direction shifted decisively through a partnership with Texan singer Calvin Russell, whose album "Dawg Eat Dawg" Lanvin co-wrote, produced and directed in 2009 (Source: en.wikipedia.org). That collaboration pointed him toward the blues, and in 2012 he formed the power trio Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, releasing "Mauvais Casting" the same year, followed by "Son(s) of the Blues" (2014) and "Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll" (2016) (Source: en.wikipedia.org; manulanvin.com). Recognised by figures including Johnny Hallyday and Quincy Jones, the band has been a repeat guest of the Jazz Foundation of America and has played more than 600 shows since 2012 (Source: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Emmanuel Lanvin ble født i Paris 24. november 1974 og begynte på elgitar som 15-åring (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org). Etter tre rockorienterte soloalbum mellom 2000 og 2006, tok retningen hans en avgjørende vending gjennom et samarbeid med den texanske vokalisten Calvin Russell, hvis album «Dawg Eat Dawg» Lanvin var medforfatter av, produserte og regisserte i 2009 (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org). Samarbeidet pekte ham mot bluesen, og i 2012 formet han power trioen Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, med utgivelsen av «Mauvais Casting» samme år, fulgt av «Son(s) of the Blues» (2014) og «Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll» (2016) (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org; manulanvin.com). Anerkjent av navn som Johnny Hallyday og Quincy Jones, har bandet vært gjentatt gjest hos Jazz Foundation of America og spilt mer enn 600 konserter siden 2012 (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Emmanuel Lanvin föddes i Paris den 24 november 1974 och började spela elgitarr som 15-åring (Källa: en.wikipedia.org). Efter tre rockorienterade soloalbum mellan 2000 och 2006 tog hans inriktning en avgörande vändning genom ett samarbete med den texanske vokalisten Calvin Russell, vars album »Dawg Eat Dawg« Lanvin var medförfattare till, producerade och regisserade 2009 (Källa: en.wikipedia.org). Samarbetet pekade honom mot bluesen, och 2012 bildade han power trion Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, med utgivningen av »Mauvais Casting« samma år, följt av »Son(s) of the Blues« (2014) och »Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll« (2016) (Källa: en.wikipedia.org; manulanvin.com). Erkänd av namn som Johnny Hallyday och Quincy Jones har bandet varit återkommande gäst hos Jazz Foundation of America och spelat mer än 600 konserter sedan 2012 (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Emmanuel Lanvin wurde am 24. November 1974 in Paris geboren und griff mit 15 Jahren zur E-Gitarre (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org). Nach drei eher rockorientierten Soloalben zwischen 2000 und 2006 nahm seine Richtung durch die Zusammenarbeit mit dem texanischen Sänger Calvin Russell eine entscheidende Wende — dessen Album „Dawg Eat Dawg“ Lanvin 2009 mitschrieb, produzierte und leitete (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org). Diese Zusammenarbeit führte ihn zum Blues, und 2012 gründete er das Power-Trio Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, mit dem im selben Jahr erschienenen Album „Mauvais Casting“, gefolgt von „Son(s) of the Blues“ (2014) und „Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll“ (2016) (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org; manulanvin.com). Von Persönlichkeiten wie Johnny Hallyday und Quincy Jones anerkannt, war die Band wiederholt Gast der Jazz Foundation of America und hat seit 2012 mehr als 600 Konzerte gespielt (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Emmanuel Lanvin urodził się w Paryżu 24 listopada 1974 roku i w wieku 15 lat sięgnął po gitarę elektryczną (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org). Po trzech rockowych albumach solowych wydanych między 2000 a 2006 rokiem, jego kierunek zmienił się zdecydowanie dzięki współpracy z teksańskim wokalistą Calvinem Russellem, którego album „Dawg Eat Dawg” Lanvin współtworzył, produkował i reżyserował w 2009 roku (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org). Ta współpraca skierowała go ku bluesowi, a w 2012 roku założył power trio Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, wydając w tym samym roku „Mauvais Casting”, a następnie „Son(s) of the Blues” (2014) i „Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll” (2016) (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org; manulanvin.com). Doceniony przez takie postacie jak Johnny Hallyday i Quincy Jones, zespół był wielokrotnym gościem Jazz Foundation of America i zagrał ponad 600 koncertów od 2012 roku (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).', '1974-11-24', NULL, NULL, 'Paris, Frankrike', 'Paris, Frankrike', '2012–', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues represent the raw, power-trio wing of French blues-rock — a stripped-down, road-hardened sound built on hundreds of live shows rather than studio polish, that has earned respect from figures as varied as Johnny Hallyday and Quincy Jones (Source: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues representerer den rå, power trio-grenen av fransk bluesrock — en nedstrippet, veiherdet lyd bygget på hundrevis av liveopptredener fremfor studiopoler, som har vunnet respekt fra navn så ulike som Johnny Hallyday og Quincy Jones (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues representerar den råa power trio-grenen av fransk bluesrock — ett avskalat, vägfärdat sound byggt på hundratals liveframträdanden snarare än studiopolityr, som vunnit respekt från namn så skilda som Johnny Hallyday och Quincy Jones (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues verkörpern den rohen Power-Trio-Zweig des französischen Bluesrock — einen reduzierten, straßenerprobten Sound, aufgebaut auf Hunderten von Liveauftritten statt Studioglanz, der Respekt von so unterschiedlichen Persönlichkeiten wie Johnny Hallyday und Quincy Jones eingebracht hat (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues reprezentują surowy, oparty na formule power trio nurt francuskiego blues-rocka — okrojone, wypracowane na trasie brzmienie budowane na setkach koncertów, a nie studyjnym poloru, które zdobyło szacunek tak różnych postaci jak Johnny Hallyday i Quincy Jones (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).', '[]', '{"en":["Make My Escape (official video)","All Night Long (official video)","Blues, Booze and Rock ''n'' Roll (title track, 2016)"],"no":["Make My Escape (offisiell video)","All Night Long (offisiell video)","Blues, Booze and Rock ''n'' Roll (tittelspor, 2016)"],"sv":["Make My Escape (officiell video)","All Night Long (officiell video)","Blues, Booze and Rock ''n'' Roll (titelspår, 2016)"],"de":["Make My Escape (offizielles Video)","All Night Long (offizielles Video)","Blues, Booze and Rock ''n'' Roll (Titeltrack, 2016)"],"pl":["Make My Escape (oficjalny teledysk)","All Night Long (oficjalny teledysk)","Blues, Booze and Rock ''n'' Roll (utwór tytułowy, 2016)"]}', '[]', '["Vocals","Guitar"]', '["Blues Rock","Power Trio Blues","Southern Blues"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["2009: Co-wrote, produced and directed Calvin Russell''s album \"Dawg Eat Dawg\" (Source: en.wikipedia.org).","2012: Formed Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, released \"Mauvais Casting\" (Source: en.wikipedia.org).","2019: Released \"Grand Casino\" (Source: en.wikipedia.org)."],"no":["2009: Medforfatter, produsent og regissør for Calvin Russells album «Dawg Eat Dawg» (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).","2012: Formet Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, ga ut «Mauvais Casting» (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).","2019: Ga ut «Grand Casino» (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org)."],"sv":["2009: Medförfattare, producent och regissör för Calvin Russells album »Dawg Eat Dawg« (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).","2012: Bildade Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, släppte »Mauvais Casting« (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).","2019: Släppte »Grand Casino« (Källa: en.wikipedia.org)."],"de":["2009: Mitautor, Produzent und Regisseur von Calvin Russells Album „Dawg Eat Dawg“ (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).","2012: Gründung von Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, Veröffentlichung von „Mauvais Casting“ (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).","2019: Veröffentlichung von „Grand Casino“ (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org)."],"pl":["2009: Współautor, producent i reżyser albumu Calvina Russella „Dawg Eat Dawg” (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).","2012: Utworzenie Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues, wydanie „Mauvais Casting” (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).","2019: Wydanie „Grand Casino” (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"MANU LANVIN & THE DEVIL BLUES - \"Make my escape\" (Official Music Video)","youtube_id":"YhfiOtJPqKc","channel":"Manu Lanvin"},{"kind":"more","title":"Manu Lanvin and the Devil Blues All night Long (OFFICIAL VIDEO)","youtube_id":"ZdtAAteMOpY","channel":"Negatif-Ju Patrice"}]', '{"en":[{"year":2012,"title":"Mauvais Casting","notes":"Source: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Son(s) of the Blues"},{"year":2016,"title":"Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll"},{"year":2019,"title":"Grand Casino"}],"no":[{"year":2012,"title":"Mauvais Casting","notes":"Kilde: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Son(s) of the Blues"},{"year":2016,"title":"Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll"},{"year":2019,"title":"Grand Casino"}],"sv":[{"year":2012,"title":"Mauvais Casting","notes":"Källa: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Son(s) of the Blues"},{"year":2016,"title":"Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll"},{"year":2019,"title":"Grand Casino"}],"de":[{"year":2012,"title":"Mauvais Casting","notes":"Quelle: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Son(s) of the Blues"},{"year":2016,"title":"Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll"},{"year":2019,"title":"Grand Casino"}],"pl":[{"year":2012,"title":"Mauvais Casting","notes":"Źródło: en.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2014,"title":"Son(s) of the Blues"},{"year":2016,"title":"Blues, Booze & Rock''n''Roll"},{"year":2019,"title":"Grand Casino"}]}', '[]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues – French Blues-Rock Power Trio | SlowBlues', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues – Fransk bluesrock power trio | SlowBlues', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues – Fransk bluesrock power trio | SlowBlues', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues – Französisches Bluesrock-Power-Trio | SlowBlues', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues – Francuskie power trio blues-rockowe | SlowBlues', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues is a Paris blues-rock power trio led by Emmanuel Lanvin, shaped by his work with Calvin Russell. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues er en bluesrock power trio fra Paris ledet av Emmanuel Lanvin, formet av samarbeidet med Calvin Russell. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues är en bluesrock power trio från Paris ledd av Emmanuel Lanvin, formad av samarbetet med Calvin Russell. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues ist ein Pariser Bluesrock-Power-Trio unter Leitung von Emmanuel Lanvin, geprägt durch die Zusammenarbeit mit Calvin Russell. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Manu Lanvin & The Devil Blues to paryskie power trio blues-rockowe prowadzone przez Emmanuela Lanvina, ukształtowane przez współpracę z Calvinem Russellem. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/officialmanulanvin","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/manulanvin/","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfUIQ05KEWSbX2KW4e82mTA"}', '[]', '[{"title":"Manu Lanvin — Wikipedia (EN)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manu_Lanvin"},{"title":"Site officiel — manulanvin.com","url":"https://www.manulanvin.com/en/biographie"}]', 'https://www.manulanvin.com/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"https://www.manulanvin.com/en/pro","source_url":"https://www.manulanvin.com/en/pro","note":"Profesjonell/booking-tilgang via offisiell nettside (Professional Access). Ingen offentlig booking-e-post/telefon funnet."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('2fbc698d-c325-4aeb-bf87-56f818fb5520', 'nico-wayne-toussaint', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/69972a536aaa9a5ba34da512/1771514502015-4OYQSNU6CJJJ4MCUM0RJ/NWTS%40Eric+Traversie.jpeg', NULL, 'Foto: Eric Traversie (via kbkc-artistes.com, offisiell pressefoto)', '[]', '[]', 'French blues harmonica player from Toulon, a Dixiefrog Records mainstay who cut his teeth jamming with Chicago blues veterans in Minneapolis in the early 1990s.', 'Fransk blues-munnspiller fra Toulon, en fast størrelse på Dixiefrog Records, som lærte håndverket ved å spille med Chicago-blueveteraner i Minneapolis tidlig på 1990-tallet.', 'Fransk blues-munspelare från Toulon, en fast storhet på Dixiefrog Records, som lärde sig hantverket genom att spela med Chicago-bluesveteraner i Minneapolis i början av 1990-talet.', 'Französischer Blues-Mundharmonikaspieler aus Toulon, eine feste Größe bei Dixiefrog Records, der sein Handwerk Anfang der 1990er-Jahre beim gemeinsamen Spiel mit Chicago-Blues-Veteranen in Minneapolis lernte.', 'Francuski bluesowy harmonijkarz z Toulon, stały twarz wytwórni Dixiefrog Records, który uczył się rzemiosła, grając z weteranami chicagowskiego bluesa w Minneapolis na początku lat 90.', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint was born in Toulon in 1973 and discovered blues at 15 through Muddy Waters'' "Hard Again," picking up harmonica at 18 (Source: Last.fm; nicowaynetoussaint.com). His nickname "Wayne" comes from his American godfather in Minnesota. Regular trips to the US from 1992, including a spell as a French-language teaching assistant near Minneapolis, put him on stage with Chicago blues names like Jimmy Johnson, Billy Branch and Luther Allison (Source: nicowaynetoussaint.com). Professional since 1998, he has recorded 14 albums under his own name, 12 of them on the French blues label Dixiefrog, and was voted best blues harmonica player at the 2003 Trophées France Blues (Source: nicowaynetoussaint.com; jazzradio.fr).', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint ble født i Toulon i 1973 og oppdaget blues som 15-åring gjennom Muddy Waters'' «Hard Again», og begynte på munnspill som 18-åring (Kilde: Last.fm; nicowaynetoussaint.com). Kallenavnet «Wayne» kommer fra hans amerikanske gudfar i Minnesota. Regelmessige turer til USA fra 1992, blant annet som fransklærerassistent nær Minneapolis, satte ham på scenen med Chicago-blues-navn som Jimmy Johnson, Billy Branch og Luther Allison (Kilde: nicowaynetoussaint.com). Profesjonell siden 1998, har han spilt inn 14 album i eget navn, 12 av dem på det franske bluesselskapet Dixiefrog, og ble kåret til beste blues-munnspiller ved Trophées France Blues i 2003 (Kilde: nicowaynetoussaint.com; jazzradio.fr).', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint föddes i Toulon 1973 och upptäckte blues som 15-åring genom Muddy Waters «Hard Again», och började spela munspel vid 18 års ålder (Källa: Last.fm; nicowaynetoussaint.com). Smeknamnet »Wayne« kommer från hans amerikanska gudfar i Minnesota. Regelbundna resor till USA från 1992, bland annat som fransklärarassistent nära Minneapolis, förde honom upp på scenen med Chicago-bluesnamn som Jimmy Johnson, Billy Branch och Luther Allison (Källa: nicowaynetoussaint.com). Professionell sedan 1998 har han spelat in 14 album i eget namn, 12 av dem på det franska bluesbolaget Dixiefrog, och röstades fram till bästa bluesmunspelare vid Trophées France Blues 2003 (Källa: nicowaynetoussaint.com; jazzradio.fr).', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint wurde 1973 in Toulon geboren und entdeckte den Blues mit 15 Jahren durch Muddy Waters'' „Hard Again“, mit 18 begann er Mundharmonika zu spielen (Quelle: Last.fm; nicowaynetoussaint.com). Der Spitzname „Wayne“ stammt von seinem amerikanischen Patenonkel in Minnesota. Regelmäßige USA-Reisen ab 1992, darunter eine Zeit als Französisch-Lehrassistent nahe Minneapolis, brachten ihn mit Chicago-Blues-Größen wie Jimmy Johnson, Billy Branch und Luther Allison auf die Bühne (Quelle: nicowaynetoussaint.com). Professionell seit 1998, hat er 14 Alben unter eigenem Namen aufgenommen, 12 davon beim französischen Blueslabel Dixiefrog, und wurde 2003 bei den Trophées France Blues zum besten Blues-Mundharmonikaspieler gewählt (Quelle: nicowaynetoussaint.com; jazzradio.fr).', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint urodził się w Toulon w 1973 roku i odkrył bluesa w wieku 15 lat dzięki płycie Muddy''ego Watersa „Hard Again”, a w wieku 18 lat zaczął grać na harmonijce (Źródło: Last.fm; nicowaynetoussaint.com). Przydomek „Wayne” pochodzi od jego amerykańskiego ojca chrzestnego z Minnesoty. Regularne wyjazdy do USA od 1992 roku, w tym praca jako asystent nauczyciela francuskiego niedaleko Minneapolis, wprowadziły go na scenę z legendami chicagowskiego bluesa, takimi jak Jimmy Johnson, Billy Branch i Luther Allison (Źródło: nicowaynetoussaint.com). Zawodowo od 1998 roku, nagrał 14 albumów pod własnym nazwiskiem, z czego 12 dla francuskiej wytwórni bluesowej Dixiefrog, i został wybrany najlepszym harmonijkarzem bluesowym na Trophées France Blues w 2003 roku (Źródło: nicowaynetoussaint.com; jazzradio.fr).', '1973', NULL, NULL, 'Toulon, Frankrike', 'Pau, Béarn, Frankrike', '1998–', 'As one of Dixiefrog''s most recorded artists, Toussaint has helped anchor a genuinely Chicago-rooted harmonica tradition within French blues, learned directly from American veterans rather than at second hand (Source: nicowaynetoussaint.com).', 'Som en av Dixiefrogs mest innspilte artister har Toussaint bidratt til å forankre en genuint Chicago-basert munnspilltradisjon i fransk blues, lært direkte av amerikanske veteraner fremfor på annenhånd (Kilde: nicowaynetoussaint.com).', 'Som en av Dixiefrogs mest inspelade artister har Toussaint bidragit till att förankra en genuint Chicago-baserad munspelstradition inom fransk blues, inlärd direkt av amerikanska veteraner snarare än i andra hand (Källa: nicowaynetoussaint.com).', 'Als einer der meistaufgenommenen Künstler von Dixiefrog hat Toussaint dazu beigetragen, eine wirklich in Chicago verwurzelte Mundharmonika-Tradition im französischen Blues zu verankern — direkt von amerikanischen Veteranen gelernt statt aus zweiter Hand (Quelle: nicowaynetoussaint.com).', 'Jako jeden z najczęściej nagrywających artystów Dixiefrog, Toussaint pomógł zakorzenić w francuskim bluesie autentyczną, chicagowską tradycję gry na harmonijce, wyuczoną bezpośrednio od amerykańskich weteranów, a nie z drugiej ręki (Źródło: nicowaynetoussaint.com).', '[]', '{"en":["C''est Si Bon (1997, debut album, recorded in Minneapolis)","My Kind of Blues (1998)","Southern Wind Blowin'' (2007)"],"no":["C''est Si Bon (1997, debutalbum, spilt inn i Minneapolis)","My Kind of Blues (1998)","Southern Wind Blowin'' (2007)"],"sv":["C''est Si Bon (1997, debutalbum, inspelat i Minneapolis)","My Kind of Blues (1998)","Southern Wind Blowin'' (2007)"],"de":["C''est Si Bon (1997, Debütalbum, aufgenommen in Minneapolis)","My Kind of Blues (1998)","Southern Wind Blowin'' (2007)"],"pl":["C''est Si Bon (1997, album debiutancki, nagrany w Minneapolis)","My Kind of Blues (1998)","Southern Wind Blowin'' (2007)"]}', '["Dixiefrog"]', '["Harmonica","Vocals"]', '["Chicago Blues","Harmonica Blues","Southern Blues"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["1992: First trip to the United States (Source: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","March 1997: Recorded debut album \"C''est Si Bon\" in Minneapolis (Source: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","2003: Voted best blues harmonica player at the Trophées France Blues (Source: jazzradio.fr).","2011: Collaborated with Fred Chapellier and Neal Black (Source: fredchapellier.fr)."],"no":["1992: Første tur til USA (Kilde: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","Mars 1997: Spilte inn debutalbumet «C''est Si Bon» i Minneapolis (Kilde: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","2003: Kåret til beste blues-munnspiller ved Trophées France Blues (Kilde: jazzradio.fr).","2011: Samarbeidet med Fred Chapellier og Neal Black (Kilde: fredchapellier.fr)."],"sv":["1992: Första resan till USA (Källa: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","Mars 1997: Spelade in debutalbumet «C''est Si Bon» i Minneapolis (Källa: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","2003: Röstades fram till bästa bluesmunspelare vid Trophées France Blues (Källa: jazzradio.fr).","2011: Samarbetade med Fred Chapellier och Neal Black (Källa: fredchapellier.fr)."],"de":["1992: Erste Reise in die USA (Quelle: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","März 1997: Aufnahme des Debütalbums „C''est Si Bon“ in Minneapolis (Quelle: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","2003: Zum besten Blues-Mundharmonikaspieler bei den Trophées France Blues gewählt (Quelle: jazzradio.fr).","2011: Zusammenarbeit mit Fred Chapellier und Neal Black (Quelle: fredchapellier.fr)."],"pl":["1992: Pierwsza podróż do USA (Źródło: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","Marzec 1997: Nagranie albumu debiutanckiego „C''est Si Bon” w Minneapolis (Źródło: nicowaynetoussaint.com).","2003: Wybrany najlepszym harmonijkarzem bluesowym na Trophées France Blues (Źródło: jazzradio.fr).","2011: Współpraca z Fredem Chapellierem i Nealem Blackiem (Źródło: fredchapellier.fr)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"NICO WAYNE TOUSSAINT QUARTET - live Festival Coutras Jazz Vibration","youtube_id":"PeVimcHRyJU","channel":"Sabine SIMONNET"},{"kind":"more","title":"Nico Wayne Toussaint Live - Midnight Creeper","youtube_id":"A3vyviETqKo","channel":"bluesnicky"}]', '{"en":[{"year":1997,"title":"C''est Si Bon","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Debut, recorded in Minneapolis. Source: nicowaynetoussaint.com."},{"year":1998,"title":"My Kind of Blues","label":"Dixiefrog"},{"year":2007,"title":"Southern Wind Blowin''","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Tribute to Southern US music. Source: absmag.fr."}],"no":[{"year":1997,"title":"C''est Si Bon","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Debut, spilt inn i Minneapolis. Kilde: nicowaynetoussaint.com."},{"year":1998,"title":"My Kind of Blues","label":"Dixiefrog"},{"year":2007,"title":"Southern Wind Blowin''","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Hyllest til sørstatsmusikken. Kilde: absmag.fr."}],"sv":[{"year":1997,"title":"C''est Si Bon","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Debut, inspelad i Minneapolis. Källa: nicowaynetoussaint.com."},{"year":1998,"title":"My Kind of Blues","label":"Dixiefrog"},{"year":2007,"title":"Southern Wind Blowin''","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Hyllning till sydstatsmusiken. Källa: absmag.fr."}],"de":[{"year":1997,"title":"C''est Si Bon","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Debüt, aufgenommen in Minneapolis. Quelle: nicowaynetoussaint.com."},{"year":1998,"title":"My Kind of Blues","label":"Dixiefrog"},{"year":2007,"title":"Southern Wind Blowin''","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Hommage an die Musik der US-Südstaaten. Quelle: absmag.fr."}],"pl":[{"year":1997,"title":"C''est Si Bon","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Debiut, nagrany w Minneapolis. Źródło: nicowaynetoussaint.com."},{"year":1998,"title":"My Kind of Blues","label":"Dixiefrog"},{"year":2007,"title":"Southern Wind Blowin''","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Hołd dla muzyki południa USA. Źródło: absmag.fr."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[{"year":2003,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Best blues harmonica player"},{"year":2021,"title":"France Blues Hall of Fame","category":"Inducted"}],"no":[{"year":2003,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Beste blues-munnspiller"},{"year":2021,"title":"France Blues Hall of Fame","category":"Innlemmet"}],"sv":[{"year":2003,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Bästa bluesmunspelare"},{"year":2021,"title":"France Blues Hall of Fame","category":"Invald"}],"de":[{"year":2003,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Bester Blues-Mundharmonikaspieler"},{"year":2021,"title":"France Blues Hall of Fame","category":"Aufgenommen"}],"pl":[{"year":2003,"title":"Trophées France Blues","category":"Najlepszy harmonijkarz bluesowy"},{"year":2021,"title":"France Blues Hall of Fame","category":"Wprowadzony"}]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint – French Blues Harmonica Player | SlowBlues', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint – Fransk blues-munnspiller | SlowBlues', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint – Fransk bluesmunspelare | SlowBlues', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint – Französischer Blues-Mundharmonikaspieler | SlowBlues', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint – Francuski harmonijkarz bluesowy | SlowBlues', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint is a Chicago blues-rooted French harmonica player and Dixiefrog Records mainstay from Toulon. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint er en fransk munnspiller med røtter i Chicago-blues, fast artist på Dixiefrog Records, fra Toulon. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint är en fransk munspelare med rötter i Chicagoblues, fast artist på Dixiefrog Records, från Toulon. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint ist ein französischer Mundharmonikaspieler mit Wurzeln im Chicago-Blues und feste Größe bei Dixiefrog Records aus Toulon. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Nico Wayne Toussaint to francuski harmonijkarz zakorzeniony w chicagowskim bluesie, stała twarz Dixiefrog Records, pochodzący z Toulon. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{}', '[]', '[{"title":"Nico Wayne Toussaint — Site officiel","url":"https://www.nicowaynetoussaint.com/"},{"title":"NICO WAYNE TOUSSAINT — Jazzradio.fr","url":"https://www.jazzradio.fr/artiste/singer/5810/nico-wayne-toussaint"}]', 'https://www.nicowaynetoussaint.com/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"https://www.nicowaynetoussaint.com/contact","source_url":"https://www.nicowaynetoussaint.com/contact","note":"Kontakt/booking via offisielt kontaktskjema. Ingen offentlig booking-e-post/telefon funnet."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('c119bed4-c548-45b9-b09b-e08ab047e5a4', 'nina-attal', 'Nina Attal', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Nina_Attal_-_Leverkusener_Jazztage_2017-8650.jpg', NULL, 'Foto: Andreas Lawen / Fotandi (CC BY-SA 4.0, Wikimedia Commons, Leverkusener Jazztage 2017)', '[]', '[]', 'French singer-guitarist and songwriter who emerged from Paris''s blues jam scene as a teenager and became one of French blues-rock''s most consistently touring artists.', 'Fransk vokalist, gitarist og låtskriver som kom fra Paris'' bluesjam-scene som tenåring og ble en av fransk bluesrocks mest turnerende artister.', 'Fransk sångerska, gitarrist och låtskrivare som kom från Paris bluesjamscen som tonåring och blev en av fransk bluesrocks mest turnerande artister.', 'Französische Sängerin, Gitarristin und Songwriterin, die als Teenager aus der Pariser Blues-Jam-Szene hervorging und zu einer der meistauftretenden Künstlerinnen des französischen Bluesrock wurde.', 'Francuska wokalistka, gitarzystka i autorka piosenek, która jako nastolatka wyrosła z paryskiej sceny jam session i stała się jedną z najczęściej koncertujących artystek francuskiego blues-rocka.', 'Nina Attal was born on 13 April 1992 and started guitar at 13 (Source: fr.wikipedia.org). She emerged from Paris''s blues jam sessions, and at the end of 2009 swept five prizes at the Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine — unprecedented in the competition''s 12 editions — which opened doors to major French blues festivals and a breakthrough at Quebec''s Festival d''été in summer 2010 (Source: fr.wikipedia.org). Her debut EP "Urgency" (May 2010) blended blues with soul and funk, followed by the albums "Yellow 6/17" (2011), "Wha" (2014) and "Jump," with "Pieces of Soul" (May 2021) marking an explicit return to blues, R&B and rock (Source: fr.wikipedia.org). With four albums and close to 1,000 concerts behind her, she has built a reputation as a relentless live performer (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Nina Attal ble født 13. april 1992 og begynte på gitar som 13-åring (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org). Hun kom fra Paris'' bluesjam-scene, og ved utgangen av 2009 vant hun fem priser ved Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine — uten sidestykke i konkurransens 12 utgaver — noe som åpnet dører til store franske bluesfestivaler og et gjennombrudd ved Festival d''été i Québec sommeren 2010 (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org). Debut-EP-en «Urgency» (mai 2010) blandet blues med soul og funk, fulgt av albumene «Yellow 6/17» (2011), «Wha» (2014) og «Jump», mens «Pieces of Soul» (mai 2021) markerte en tydelig retur til blues, R&B og rock (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org). Med fire album og nær 1000 konserter bak seg har hun bygget seg et rykte som en ustoppelig liveartist (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Nina Attal föddes den 13 april 1992 och började spela gitarr vid 13 års ålder (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org). Hon kom från Paris bluesjamscen, och i slutet av 2009 vann hon fem priser vid Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine — utan motstycke under tävlingens 12 upplagor — vilket öppnade dörrar till stora franska bluesfestivaler och ett genombrott vid Festival d''été i Québec sommaren 2010 (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org). Debut-EP:n »Urgency« (maj 2010) blandade blues med soul och funk, följd av albumen »Yellow 6/17« (2011), »Wha« (2014) och »Jump«, medan »Pieces of Soul« (maj 2021) markerade en tydlig återgång till blues, R&B och rock (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org). Med fyra album och nära 1000 konserter bakom sig har hon byggt sig ett rykte som en outtröttlig liveartist (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Nina Attal wurde am 13. April 1992 geboren und begann mit 13 Jahren Gitarre zu spielen (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org). Sie kam aus der Pariser Blues-Jam-Szene, und Ende 2009 gewann sie fünf Preise beim Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine — beispiellos in den 12 Ausgaben des Wettbewerbs — was ihr Türen zu großen französischen Bluesfestivals öffnete und im Sommer 2010 einen Durchbruch beim Festival d''été in Québec brachte (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org). Ihre Debüt-EP „Urgency“ (Mai 2010) verband Blues mit Soul und Funk, gefolgt von den Alben „Yellow 6/17“ (2011), „Wha“ (2014) und „Jump“, während „Pieces of Soul“ (Mai 2021) eine deutliche Rückkehr zu Blues, R&B und Rock markierte (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org). Mit vier Alben und fast 1000 Konzerten im Rücken hat sie sich den Ruf einer unermüdlichen Liveperformerin erarbeitet (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Nina Attal urodziła się 13 kwietnia 1992 roku i zaczęła grać na gitarze w wieku 13 lat (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org). Wywodzi się z paryskiej sceny jam session bluesowych, a pod koniec 2009 roku zdobyła pięć nagród na Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine — bezprecedensowy wynik w 12 edycjach konkursu — co otworzyło jej drzwi do dużych francuskich festiwali bluesowych i przełom na Festival d''été w Quebecu latem 2010 roku (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org). Jej debiutancka EP-ka „Urgency” (maj 2010) łączyła blues z soulem i funkiem, po niej ukazały się albumy „Yellow 6/17” (2011), „Wha” (2014) i „Jump”, a „Pieces of Soul” (maj 2021) oznaczał wyraźny powrót do bluesa, R&B i rocka (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org). Mając na koncie cztery albumy i blisko 1000 koncertów, zbudowała sobie reputację niestrudzonej artystki koncertowej (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).', '1992-04-13', NULL, NULL, 'Frankrike', 'Paris, Frankrike', '2009–', 'Attal''s sweep of the 2009 Tremplin Blues sur Seine helped open the modern French blues scene to younger, genre-blending artists, and her sustained touring pace has made her a visible model for how blues, soul and funk can coexist in a single French career (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Attals rene sopp ved Tremplin Blues sur Seine i 2009 bidro til å åpne den moderne franske bluesscenen for yngre, sjangerblandende artister, og hennes vedvarende turnétempo har gjort henne til et synlig eksempel på hvordan blues, soul og funk kan sameksistere i én fransk karriere (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Attals rena drag vid Tremplin Blues sur Seine 2009 bidrog till att öppna den moderna franska bluesscenen för yngre, genreblandande artister, och hennes ihållande turnétempo har gjort henne till ett synligt exempel på hur blues, soul och funk kan samexistera i en och samma franska karriär (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Attals Rekordausbeute beim Tremplin Blues sur Seine 2009 trug dazu bei, die moderne französische Bluesszene für jüngere, genreübergreifende Künstler zu öffnen, und ihr anhaltendes Tourtempo hat sie zu einem sichtbaren Beispiel dafür gemacht, wie Blues, Soul und Funk in einer einzigen französischen Karriere koexistieren können (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).', 'Zdobycie przez Attal aż pięciu nagród na Tremplin Blues sur Seine w 2009 roku pomogło otworzyć współczesną francuską scenę bluesową na młodszych artystów łączących gatunki, a jej nieustanne tempo koncertowania uczyniło ją widocznym przykładem tego, jak blues, soul i funk mogą współistnieć w jednej francuskiej karierze (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).', '[]', '{"en":["Urgency (2010, debut EP)","Jump","Pieces of Soul (2021, title track)"],"no":["Urgency (2010, debut-EP)","Jump","Pieces of Soul (2021, tittelspor)"],"sv":["Urgency (2010, debut-EP)","Jump","Pieces of Soul (2021, titelspår)"],"de":["Urgency (2010, Debüt-EP)","Jump","Pieces of Soul (2021, Titeltrack)"],"pl":["Urgency (2010, debiutancka EP)","Jump","Pieces of Soul (2021, utwór tytułowy)"]}', '[]', '["Vocals","Guitar"]', '["Blues Rock","Soul","Funk"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["End of 2009: Won 5 prizes at the Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).","Summer 2010: Breakthrough performance at Quebec''s Festival d''été (Source: fr.wikipedia.org).","2021: Released \"Pieces of Soul,\" a return to blues and R&B (Source: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"no":["Slutten av 2009: Vant 5 priser ved Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).","Sommeren 2010: Gjennombruddsopptreden ved Festival d''été i Québec (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org).","2021: Ga ut «Pieces of Soul», en retur til blues og R&B (Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"sv":["Slutet av 2009: Vann 5 priser vid Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).","Sommaren 2010: Genombrottsframträdande vid Festival d''été i Québec (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org).","2021: Släppte »Pieces of Soul«, en återgång till blues och R&B (Källa: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"de":["Ende 2009: Gewann 5 Preise beim Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).","Sommer 2010: Durchbruchsauftritt beim Festival d''été in Québec (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org).","2021: Veröffentlichung von „Pieces of Soul“, einer Rückkehr zu Blues und R&B (Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org)."],"pl":["Koniec 2009: Zdobyła 5 nagród na Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).","Lato 2010: Przełomowy występ na Festival d''été w Quebecu (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org).","2021: Wydała „Pieces of Soul”, powrót do bluesa i R&B (Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"Nina Attal - I won''t make it (Live @ Studios Ferber)","youtube_id":"S_0uGjCaNwM","channel":"Nina Attal"},{"kind":"more","title":"NINA ATTAL \"JUMP\" 11 - FACE AU MUR","youtube_id":"xBeLe-iNsM0","channel":"Nina Attal"}]', '{"en":[{"year":2010,"title":"Urgency","notes":"Debut EP. Source: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2011,"title":"Yellow 6/17"},{"year":2014,"title":"Wha"},{"year":2021,"title":"Pieces of Soul","notes":"Source: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"no":[{"year":2010,"title":"Urgency","notes":"Debut-EP. Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2011,"title":"Yellow 6/17"},{"year":2014,"title":"Wha"},{"year":2021,"title":"Pieces of Soul","notes":"Kilde: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"sv":[{"year":2010,"title":"Urgency","notes":"Debut-EP. Källa: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2011,"title":"Yellow 6/17"},{"year":2014,"title":"Wha"},{"year":2021,"title":"Pieces of Soul","notes":"Källa: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"de":[{"year":2010,"title":"Urgency","notes":"Debüt-EP. Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2011,"title":"Yellow 6/17"},{"year":2014,"title":"Wha"},{"year":2021,"title":"Pieces of Soul","notes":"Quelle: fr.wikipedia.org."}],"pl":[{"year":2010,"title":"Urgency","notes":"Debiutancka EP. Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org."},{"year":2011,"title":"Yellow 6/17"},{"year":2014,"title":"Wha"},{"year":2021,"title":"Pieces of Soul","notes":"Źródło: fr.wikipedia.org."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[{"year":2009,"title":"Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine","category":"5 prizes, unprecedented in the competition''s history"}],"no":[{"year":2009,"title":"Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine","category":"5 priser, uten sidestykke i konkurransens historie"}],"sv":[{"year":2009,"title":"Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine","category":"5 priser, utan motstycke i tävlingens historia"}],"de":[{"year":2009,"title":"Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine","category":"5 Preise, beispiellos in der Geschichte des Wettbewerbs"}],"pl":[{"year":2009,"title":"Tremplin national de Blues sur Seine","category":"5 nagród, wynik bez precedensu w historii konkursu"}]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Nina Attal – French Blues-Rock Singer & Guitarist | SlowBlues', 'Nina Attal – Fransk bluesrock-vokalist og gitarist | SlowBlues', 'Nina Attal – Fransk bluesrock-sångerska och gitarrist | SlowBlues', 'Nina Attal – Französische Bluesrock-Sängerin und Gitarristin | SlowBlues', 'Nina Attal – Francuska wokalistka i gitarzystka blues-rockowa | SlowBlues', 'Nina Attal is a leading French blues-rock singer-guitarist known for blending blues, soul and funk. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Nina Attal er en ledende fransk bluesrock-vokalist og gitarist kjent for å blande blues, soul og funk. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Nina Attal är en ledande fransk bluesrock-sångerska och gitarrist känd för att blanda blues, soul och funk. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Nina Attal ist eine führende französische Bluesrock-Sängerin und Gitarristin, bekannt für ihre Mischung aus Blues, Soul und Funk. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Nina Attal to czołowa francuska wokalistka i gitarzystka blues-rockowa, znana z łączenia bluesa, soulu i funku. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{}', '[]', '[{"title":"Nina Attal — Wikipédia (FR)","url":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nina_Attal"}]', 'https://ninaattal.com/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":"Zamora Prod","agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"https://zamoraprod.com/en/artists/nina-attal","source_url":"https://zamoraprod.com/en/artists/nina-attal","note":"Booking via Zamora Prod (offisielt oppgitt agentur). Ingen offentlig direkte e-post/telefon funnet."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('4e5d0177-4f4e-428b-b8f0-64c2d08dc49b', 'the-freaky-buds', 'The Freaky Buds', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://www.bluztrack-productions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/TFB-3-credits-_-Jean-Marie-JAGU-768x1150.jpg', NULL, 'Foto: Jean Marie Jagu (bluztrack-productions.com, offisiell pressefoto)', '[]', '[]', 'Bass-less roots-blues quartet from Nantes with a Hill Country and swamp blues core, recorded by Kid Andersen at his Greaseland Studio in California for their second album.', 'Bass-løs roots-blues-kvartett fra Nantes med en Hill Country- og swamp-blues-kjerne, spilt inn av Kid Andersen på hans Greaseland Studio i California for det andre albumet.', 'Basfri roots-blueskvartett från Nantes med en Hill Country- och swamp-bluesskärna, inspelad av Kid Andersen på hans Greaseland Studio i Kalifornien för det andra albumet.', 'Bassloses Roots-Blues-Quartett aus Nantes mit einem Kern aus Hill Country und Swamp Blues, für das zweite Album von Kid Andersen in seinem Greaseland Studio in Kalifornien aufgenommen.', 'Pozbawiony basu kwartet roots blues z Nantes z rdzeniem hill country i swamp blues, którego drugi album nagrał Kid Andersen w swoim Greaseland Studio w Kalifornii.', 'The Freaky Buds formed in Nantes in 2018 around guitarist-singer Maxime Genouel, drummer Hugo Deviers and harmonica player Thomas Troussier, joined months later by a second guitarist known as Lonj (Source: mazik.info). Based between Nantes and Bordeaux, the band''s music is firmly rooted in roots blues, with a heavy Hill Country and swamp blues influence and the groove and energy of live performance placed front and centre; they draw on Howlin'' Wolf, John Lee Hooker, Muddy Waters and R.L. Burnside while folding in contemporary touches reminiscent of The Black Keys or Royal Blood (Source: mazik.info). Their well-received 2022 debut, "Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights," was followed on 17 October 2025 by "Western Smoke" on Freak Land Records/Inouïe Distribution — recorded and produced by Kid Andersen at his renowned Greaseland Studio, a session the band describes as a fervent, authentic and intensely alive blues record (Source: mazik.info; paris-move.com).', 'The Freaky Buds ble dannet i Nantes i 2018 rundt gitarist-vokalist Maxime Genouel, trommeslager Hugo Deviers og munnspillspiller Thomas Troussier, med en andre gitarist kjent som Lonj som ble med noen måneder senere (Kilde: mazik.info). Basert mellom Nantes og Bordeaux er bandets musikk solid forankret i roots-blues, med sterk Hill Country- og swamp-blues-innflytelse og groove og live-energi satt i sentrum; de trekker på Howlin'' Wolf, John Lee Hooker, Muddy Waters og R.L. Burnside, samtidig som de blander inn samtidige elementer som minner om The Black Keys eller Royal Blood (Kilde: mazik.info). Den godt mottatte debuten «Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights» fra 2022 ble fulgt 17. oktober 2025 av «Western Smoke» på Freak Land Records/Inouïe Distribution — spilt inn og produsert av Kid Andersen på hans anerkjente Greaseland Studio, en sesjon bandet beskriver som en glødende, autentisk og intenst levende blues-plate (Kilde: mazik.info; paris-move.com).', 'The Freaky Buds bildades i Nantes 2018 kring gitarristen-sångaren Maxime Genouel, trumslagaren Hugo Deviers och munspelaren Thomas Troussier, med en andra gitarrist känd som Lonj som anslöt några månader senare (Källa: mazik.info). Baserat mellan Nantes och Bordeaux är bandets musik fast förankrad i roots-blues, med tung Hill Country- och swamp-bluesinfluens och groove och liveenergi satta i centrum; de hämtar från Howlin'' Wolf, John Lee Hooker, Muddy Waters och R.L. Burnside samtidigt som de blandar in samtida inslag som påminner om The Black Keys eller Royal Blood (Källa: mazik.info). Den väl mottagna debuten »Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights« från 2022 följdes den 17 oktober 2025 av »Western Smoke« på Freak Land Records/Inouïe Distribution — inspelad och producerad av Kid Andersen på hans ansedda Greaseland Studio, en session bandet beskriver som en glödande, autentisk och intensivt levande bluesskiva (Källa: mazik.info; paris-move.com).', 'The Freaky Buds gründeten sich 2018 in Nantes um Gitarrist-Sänger Maxime Genouel, Schlagzeuger Hugo Deviers und Mundharmonikaspieler Thomas Troussier, wenige Monate später kam ein zweiter Gitarrist namens Lonj hinzu (Quelle: mazik.info). Die zwischen Nantes und Bordeaux ansässige Band verwurzelt ihre Musik fest im Roots-Blues, mit starkem Hill-Country- und Swamp-Blues-Einfluss und Groove sowie Live-Energie im Zentrum; sie schöpfen aus Howlin'' Wolf, John Lee Hooker, Muddy Waters und R.L. Burnside und mischen zeitgenössische Anklänge an The Black Keys oder Royal Blood ein (Quelle: mazik.info). Auf das gut aufgenommene Debüt „Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights“ von 2022 folgte am 17. Oktober 2025 „Western Smoke“ bei Freak Land Records/Inouïe Distribution — aufgenommen und produziert von Kid Andersen in seinem renommierten Greaseland Studio, eine Session, die die Band als glühende, authentische und intensiv lebendige Bluesplatte beschreibt (Quelle: mazik.info; paris-move.com).', 'The Freaky Buds powstali w Nantes w 2018 roku wokół gitarzysty-wokalisty Maxime''a Genouela, perkusisty Hugo Deviersa i harmonijkarza Thomasa Troussiera, do których kilka miesięcy później dołączył drugi gitarzysta znany jako Lonj (Źródło: mazik.info). Zespół, działający między Nantes a Bordeaux, mocno zakorzenia swoją muzykę w roots blues, z silnym wpływem hill country i swamp blues oraz naciskiem na groove i energię koncertową; czerpią z Howlin'' Wolfa, Johna Lee Hookera, Muddy''ego Watersa i R.L. Burnside''a, wplatając jednocześnie współczesne elementy przypominające The Black Keys czy Royal Blood (Źródło: mazik.info). Po dobrze przyjętym debiucie „Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights” z 2022 roku, 17 października 2025 roku ukazał się „Western Smoke” nakładem Freak Land Records/Inouïe Distribution — nagrany i wyprodukowany przez Kida Andersena w jego renomowanym Greaseland Studio, sesja, którą zespół opisuje jako żarliwą, autentyczną i intensywnie żywą płytę bluesową (Źródło: mazik.info; paris-move.com).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nantes, Frankrike', '2018–', 'By working without a bassist and leaning hard into Hill Country and swamp blues, The Freaky Buds represent one of the more traditionalist, roots-focused strands of the younger French blues generation, while still speaking to modern rock audiences (Source: mazik.info).', 'Ved å jobbe uten bassist og lene seg hardt på Hill Country- og swamp-blues, representerer The Freaky Buds en av de mer tradisjonalistiske, roots-fokuserte grenene av den yngre franske bluesgenerasjonen, samtidig som de fortsatt taler til moderne rockpublikum (Kilde: mazik.info).', 'Genom att arbeta utan basist och luta sig hårt mot Hill Country- och swampblues representerar The Freaky Buds en av de mer traditionalistiska, rotsfokuserade grenarna av den yngre franska bluesgenerationen, samtidigt som de fortfarande talar till moderna rockpublik (Källa: mazik.info).', 'Indem sie ohne Bassisten arbeiten und sich stark auf Hill-Country- und Swamp-Blues stützen, verkörpern The Freaky Buds einen der eher traditionalistischen, wurzelorientierten Zweige der jüngeren französischen Blues-Generation, sprechen dabei aber weiterhin ein modernes Rockpublikum an (Quelle: mazik.info).', 'Grając bez basisty i mocno opierając się na hill country i swamp blues, The Freaky Buds reprezentują jeden z bardziej tradycjonalistycznych, zakorzenionych w korzeniach nurtów młodszego pokolenia francuskiego bluesa, przemawiając jednocześnie do współczesnej publiczności rockowej (Źródło: mazik.info).', '[]', '{"en":["Too Far Gone (Official Video)","She''s Made Of Fire","Struggling and Shuffling (from Western Smoke, 2025)"],"no":["Too Far Gone (offisiell video)","She''s Made Of Fire","Struggling and Shuffling (fra Western Smoke, 2025)"],"sv":["Too Far Gone (officiell video)","She''s Made Of Fire","Struggling and Shuffling (från Western Smoke, 2025)"],"de":["Too Far Gone (offizielles Video)","She''s Made Of Fire","Struggling and Shuffling (von Western Smoke, 2025)"],"pl":["Too Far Gone (oficjalny teledysk)","She''s Made Of Fire","Struggling and Shuffling (z Western Smoke, 2025)"]}', '["Freak Land Records"]', '["Vocals","Guitar","Drums","Harmonica"]', '["Hill Country Blues","Swamp Blues","Roots Blues"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["2018: Formed in Nantes as a trio, joined months later by second guitarist Lonj (Source: mazik.info).","2022: Released well-received debut \"Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights\" (Source: mazik.info).","17 October 2025: Released \"Western Smoke,\" recorded at Kid Andersen''s Greaseland Studio, California (Source: mazik.info)."],"no":["2018: Dannet i Nantes som trio, med gitarist Lonj som ble med noen måneder senere (Kilde: mazik.info).","2022: Ga ut den godt mottatte debuten «Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights» (Kilde: mazik.info).","17. oktober 2025: Ga ut «Western Smoke», spilt inn på Kid Andersens Greaseland Studio, California (Kilde: mazik.info)."],"sv":["2018: Bildades i Nantes som trio, med gitarristen Lonj som anslöt några månader senare (Källa: mazik.info).","2022: Släppte den väl mottagna debuten »Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights« (Källa: mazik.info).","17 oktober 2025: Släppte »Western Smoke«, inspelad på Kid Andersens Greaseland Studio, Kalifornien (Källa: mazik.info)."],"de":["2018: Gründung in Nantes als Trio, wenige Monate später Erweiterung um Gitarrist Lonj (Quelle: mazik.info).","2022: Veröffentlichung des gut aufgenommenen Debüts „Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights“ (Quelle: mazik.info).","17. Oktober 2025: Veröffentlichung von „Western Smoke“, aufgenommen in Kid Andersens Greaseland Studio, Kalifornien (Quelle: mazik.info)."],"pl":["2018: Powstanie w Nantes jako trio, do którego kilka miesięcy później dołączył gitarzysta Lonj (Źródło: mazik.info).","2022: Wydanie dobrze przyjętego debiutu „Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights” (Źródło: mazik.info).","17 października 2025: Wydanie „Western Smoke”, nagranego w Greaseland Studio Kida Andersena w Kalifornii (Źródło: mazik.info)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"The Freaky Buds - Too Far Gone (Official Video)","youtube_id":"74iyUrsgpmc","channel":"The Freaky Buds"},{"kind":"more","title":"The Freaky Buds - She''s Made Of Fire","youtube_id":"59TzaofisJs","channel":"The Freaky Buds"}]', '{"en":[{"year":2022,"title":"Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights","notes":"Debut album. Source: mazik.info."},{"year":2025,"title":"Western Smoke","label":"Freak Land Records / Inouïe Distribution","notes":"Recorded and produced by Kid Andersen at Greaseland Studio, California. Source: mazik.info."}],"no":[{"year":2022,"title":"Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights","notes":"Debutalbum. Kilde: mazik.info."},{"year":2025,"title":"Western Smoke","label":"Freak Land Records / Inouïe Distribution","notes":"Spilt inn og produsert av Kid Andersen på Greaseland Studio, California. Kilde: mazik.info."}],"sv":[{"year":2022,"title":"Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights","notes":"Debutalbum. Källa: mazik.info."},{"year":2025,"title":"Western Smoke","label":"Freak Land Records / Inouïe Distribution","notes":"Inspelad och producerad av Kid Andersen på Greaseland Studio, Kalifornien. Källa: mazik.info."}],"de":[{"year":2022,"title":"Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights","notes":"Debütalbum. Quelle: mazik.info."},{"year":2025,"title":"Western Smoke","label":"Freak Land Records / Inouïe Distribution","notes":"Aufgenommen und produziert von Kid Andersen im Greaseland Studio, Kalifornien. Quelle: mazik.info."}],"pl":[{"year":2022,"title":"Hard Days, Fuzzy Nights","notes":"Album debiutancki. Źródło: mazik.info."},{"year":2025,"title":"Western Smoke","label":"Freak Land Records / Inouïe Distribution","notes":"Nagrany i wyprodukowany przez Kida Andersena w Greaseland Studio w Kalifornii. Źródło: mazik.info."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'The Freaky Buds – French Roots Blues Quartet | SlowBlues', 'The Freaky Buds – Fransk roots-blues-kvartett | SlowBlues', 'The Freaky Buds – Fransk roots-blueskvartett | SlowBlues', 'The Freaky Buds – Französisches Roots-Blues-Quartett | SlowBlues', 'The Freaky Buds – Francuski kwartet roots blues | SlowBlues', 'The Freaky Buds are a Nantes bass-less roots-blues quartet, Hill Country and swamp blues rooted, recorded by Kid Andersen at Greaseland Studio. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'The Freaky Buds er en bass-løs roots-blues-kvartett fra Nantes, forankret i Hill Country- og swamp-blues, spilt inn av Kid Andersen på Greaseland Studio. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'The Freaky Buds är en basfri roots-blueskvartett från Nantes, förankrad i Hill Country- och swampblues, inspelad av Kid Andersen på Greaseland Studio. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'The Freaky Buds sind ein bassloses Roots-Blues-Quartett aus Nantes, verwurzelt in Hill Country und Swamp Blues, aufgenommen von Kid Andersen im Greaseland Studio. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'The Freaky Buds to pozbawiony basu kwartet roots blues z Nantes, zakorzeniony w hill country i swamp blues, nagrany przez Kida Andersena w Greaseland Studio. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://nl-nl.facebook.com/thefreakybuds","instagram":"https://instagram.com/thefreakybuds","youtube":"https://youtube.com/@thefreakybuds"}', '[]', '[{"title":"The Freaky Buds — Western Smoke — Paris Move","url":"https://www.paris-move.com/reviews/the-freaky-buds-western-smoke/"},{"title":"The Freaky Buds : ADN modern traditional blues — Artistikrezo","url":"https://www.artistikrezo.com/musique/the-freaky-buds-adn-modern-traditional-blues.html"}]', NULL, NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":null,"note":"Ingen offentlig booking-kontakt funnet — kontakt via bandets sosiale kanaler."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('e3822663-f464-48e5-8bfd-bd09b2d92dbf', 'the-supersoul-brothers', 'The SuperSoul Brothers', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Europe', 'France', '/artists', 'https://www.thesupersoulbrothers.com/images/presse/SSB_LAAS.jpg', NULL, 'Foto: Rock Story (Transhumances de Laàs, august 2024, thesupersoulbrothers.com)', '[]', '[]', 'Seven-piece deep-soul and rhythm & blues band from Pau in the Pyrénées-Atlantiques, France''s official representatives at the European Blues Challenge 2026 in Katowice, Poland.', 'Syvmanns deep soul- og rhythm & blues-band fra Pau i Pyrénées-Atlantiques, Frankrikes offisielle representanter ved European Blues Challenge 2026 i Katowice, Polen.', 'Sjumannagrupp inom deep soul och rhythm & blues från Pau i Pyrénées-Atlantiques, Frankrikes officiella representanter vid European Blues Challenge 2026 i Katowice, Polen.', 'Siebenköpfige Deep-Soul- und Rhythm-and-Blues-Band aus Pau in den Pyrénées-Atlantiques, offizielle Vertreter Frankreichs bei der European Blues Challenge 2026 in Kattowitz, Polen.', 'Siedmioosobowy zespół deep soul i rhythm & blues z Pau w regionie Pyrénées-Atlantiques, oficjalni reprezentanci Francji na European Blues Challenge 2026 w Katowicach.', 'The SuperSoul Brothers formed in 2016 in Pau, in the Pyrénées-Atlantiques, driven by founder-singer David Noël''s childhood dream of playing authentic deep soul (Source: ambassadeursdubearn.com; thesupersoulbrothers.com). Ten years after their first rehearsal in a cold rehearsal room in Mourenx, the seven musicians — David Noël (vocals), Pierre-Antoine Dumora (guitar), Ludovic Timoteo (bass), Fabrice Seny-Couty (drums), Julien Stantau (keys), Julien Suhubiette (slide trombone) and Claire Rousselot-Paillez (backing vocals) — became France''s official representatives at the European Blues Challenge 2026 in Katowice, Poland (Source: ambassadeursdubearn.com). Drawing on Ray Charles, James Brown, Otis Redding and Wilson Pickett alongside the Rolling Stones, Tom Jones and Joe Cocker, the band signed to the label Dixiefrog in September 2021 and released the studio album "Shadows And Lights," followed by the live album "The Road to Sound Live" and a third album, "By The Way" (Source: ambassadeursdubearn.com). They won first prize at the 9th Challenge Blues Français and were nominated to represent France at the 39th International Blues Challenge in Memphis in January 2024.', 'The SuperSoul Brothers ble dannet i 2016 i Pau, i Pyrénées-Atlantiques, drevet av grunnlegger-vokalist David Noëls barndomsdrøm om å spille autentisk deep soul (Kilde: ambassadeursdubearn.com; thesupersoulbrothers.com). Ti år etter den første øvingen i et kaldt øvingslokale i Mourenx, ble de syv musikerne — David Noël (vokal), Pierre-Antoine Dumora (gitar), Ludovic Timoteo (bass), Fabrice Seny-Couty (trommer), Julien Stantau (keys), Julien Suhubiette (slide-trombone) og Claire Rousselot-Paillez (bakgrunnsvokal) — Frankrikes offisielle representanter ved European Blues Challenge 2026 i Katowice, Polen (Kilde: ambassadeursdubearn.com). Med utgangspunkt i Ray Charles, James Brown, Otis Redding og Wilson Pickett ved siden av Rolling Stones, Tom Jones og Joe Cocker, signerte bandet med plateselskapet Dixiefrog i september 2021 og ga ut studioalbumet «Shadows And Lights», fulgt av livealbumet «The Road to Sound Live» og et tredje album, «By The Way» (Kilde: ambassadeursdubearn.com). De vant førstepremie ved den 9. Challenge Blues Français og ble nominert til å representere Frankrike ved den 39. International Blues Challenge i Memphis i januar 2024.', 'The SuperSoul Brothers bildades 2016 i Pau, i Pyrénées-Atlantiques, drivna av grundaren-sångaren David Noëls barndomsdröm om att spela autentisk deep soul (Källa: ambassadeursdubearn.com; thesupersoulbrothers.com). Tio år efter den första repetitionen i ett kallt replokal i Mourenx blev de sju musikerna — David Noël (sång), Pierre-Antoine Dumora (gitarr), Ludovic Timoteo (bas), Fabrice Seny-Couty (trummor), Julien Stantau (keyboard), Julien Suhubiette (slide-trombon) och Claire Rousselot-Paillez (bakgrundssång) — Frankrikes officiella representanter vid European Blues Challenge 2026 i Katowice, Polen (Källa: ambassadeursdubearn.com). Med utgångspunkt i Ray Charles, James Brown, Otis Redding och Wilson Pickett vid sidan av Rolling Stones, Tom Jones och Joe Cocker skrev bandet kontrakt med skivbolaget Dixiefrog i september 2021 och släppte studioalbumet »Shadows And Lights«, följt av livealbumet »The Road to Sound Live« och ett tredje album, »By The Way« (Källa: ambassadeursdubearn.com). De vann första pris vid den 9:e Challenge Blues Français och nominerades att representera Frankrike vid den 39:e International Blues Challenge i Memphis i januari 2024.', 'The SuperSoul Brothers wurden 2016 in Pau, in den Pyrénées-Atlantiques, gegründet, angetrieben vom Kindheitstraum des Gründers und Sängers David Noël, authentischen Deep Soul zu spielen (Quelle: ambassadeursdubearn.com; thesupersoulbrothers.com). Zehn Jahre nach ihrer ersten Probe in einem kalten Proberaum in Mourenx wurden die sieben Musiker — David Noël (Gesang), Pierre-Antoine Dumora (Gitarre), Ludovic Timoteo (Bass), Fabrice Seny-Couty (Schlagzeug), Julien Stantau (Keyboard), Julien Suhubiette (Slide-Posaune) und Claire Rousselot-Paillez (Backgroundgesang) — offizielle Vertreter Frankreichs bei der European Blues Challenge 2026 in Kattowitz, Polen (Quelle: ambassadeursdubearn.com). Inspiriert von Ray Charles, James Brown, Otis Redding und Wilson Pickett sowie den Rolling Stones, Tom Jones und Joe Cocker, unterschrieb die Band im September 2021 beim Label Dixiefrog und veröffentlichte das Studioalbum „Shadows And Lights“, gefolgt vom Livealbum „The Road to Sound Live“ und einem dritten Album, „By The Way“ (Quelle: ambassadeursdubearn.com). Sie gewannen den ersten Preis bei der 9. Challenge Blues Français und wurden nominiert, Frankreich bei der 39. International Blues Challenge im Januar 2024 in Memphis zu vertreten.', 'The SuperSoul Brothers powstali w 2016 roku w Pau, w regionie Pyrénées-Atlantiques, napędzani dziecięcym marzeniem założyciela i wokalisty Davida Noëla o graniu autentycznego deep soul (Źródło: ambassadeursdubearn.com; thesupersoulbrothers.com). Dziesięć lat po pierwszej próbie w zimnej sali prób w Mourenx, siedmioro muzyków — David Noël (wokal), Pierre-Antoine Dumora (gitara), Ludovic Timoteo (bas), Fabrice Seny-Couty (perkusja), Julien Stantau (instrumenty klawiszowe), Julien Suhubiette (puzon slide) i Claire Rousselot-Paillez (chórki) — zostało oficjalnymi reprezentantami Francji na European Blues Challenge 2026 w Katowicach (Źródło: ambassadeursdubearn.com). Czerpiąc z Raya Charlesa, Jamesa Browna, Otisa Reddinga i Wilsona Picketta, a także Rolling Stonesów, Toma Jonesa i Joe Cockera, zespół podpisał kontrakt z wytwórnią Dixiefrog we wrześniu 2021 roku i wydał album studyjny „Shadows And Lights”, po którym ukazał się album koncertowy „The Road to Sound Live” oraz trzeci album, „By The Way” (Źródło: ambassadeursdubearn.com). Zdobyli pierwszą nagrodę na 9. Challenge Blues Français i zostali nominowani do reprezentowania Francji na 39. International Blues Challenge w Memphis w styczniu 2024 roku.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pau, Pyrénées-Atlantiques, Frankrike', '2016–', 'As France''s chosen representatives at the European Blues Challenge 2026, The SuperSoul Brothers carry a genuinely classic deep-soul and R&B lineage — Ray Charles, James Brown, Otis Redding, Wilson Pickett — into contemporary French blues festival programming (Source: ambassadeursdubearn.com).', 'Som Frankrikes valgte representanter ved European Blues Challenge 2026 bærer The SuperSoul Brothers en genuint klassisk deep soul- og R&B-arv — Ray Charles, James Brown, Otis Redding, Wilson Pickett — inn i den samtidige franske bluesfestival-programmeringen (Kilde: ambassadeursdubearn.com).', 'Som Frankrikes utvalda representanter vid European Blues Challenge 2026 bär The SuperSoul Brothers ett genuint klassiskt deep soul- och R&B-arv — Ray Charles, James Brown, Otis Redding, Wilson Pickett — in i den samtida franska bluesfestivalprogrammeringen (Källa: ambassadeursdubearn.com).', 'Als von Frankreich gewählte Vertreter bei der European Blues Challenge 2026 tragen The SuperSoul Brothers ein wirklich klassisches Deep-Soul- und R&B-Erbe — Ray Charles, James Brown, Otis Redding, Wilson Pickett — in das zeitgenössische französische Bluesfestival-Programm (Quelle: ambassadeursdubearn.com).', 'Jako wybrani przedstawiciele Francji na European Blues Challenge 2026, The SuperSoul Brothers wnoszą prawdziwie klasyczne dziedzictwo deep soul i R&B — Raya Charlesa, Jamesa Browna, Otisa Reddinga, Wilsona Picketta — do współczesnego programu francuskich festiwali bluesowych (Źródło: ambassadeursdubearn.com).', '[]', '{"en":["Shadows & Lights (Music Video)","Please Forgive My Heart (Music Video)","Sookie Sookie Baby (Music Video)"],"no":["Shadows & Lights (musikkvideo)","Please Forgive My Heart (musikkvideo)","Sookie Sookie Baby (musikkvideo)"],"sv":["Shadows & Lights (musikvideo)","Please Forgive My Heart (musikvideo)","Sookie Sookie Baby (musikvideo)"],"de":["Shadows & Lights (Musikvideo)","Please Forgive My Heart (Musikvideo)","Sookie Sookie Baby (Musikvideo)"],"pl":["Shadows & Lights (teledysk)","Please Forgive My Heart (teledysk)","Sookie Sookie Baby (teledysk)"]}', '["Dixiefrog"]', '["Vocals","Guitar","Bass","Drums","Keys","Trombone","Backing vocals"]', '["Soul","Rhythm & Blues","Deep Soul"]', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":["2016: Formed in Mourenx/Pau (Source: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","September 2021: Signed to Dixiefrog Records (Source: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","2024: Nominated to represent France at the International Blues Challenge, Memphis.","2026: Chosen as France''s official representatives at the European Blues Challenge, Katowice (Source: ambassadeursdubearn.com)."],"no":["2016: Dannet i Mourenx/Pau (Kilde: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","September 2021: Signerte med Dixiefrog Records (Kilde: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","2024: Nominert til å representere Frankrike ved International Blues Challenge, Memphis.","2026: Valgt som Frankrikes offisielle representanter ved European Blues Challenge, Katowice (Kilde: ambassadeursdubearn.com)."],"sv":["2016: Bildades i Mourenx/Pau (Källa: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","September 2021: Skrev kontrakt med Dixiefrog Records (Källa: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","2024: Nominerades att representera Frankrike vid International Blues Challenge, Memphis.","2026: Utsedda till Frankrikes officiella representanter vid European Blues Challenge, Katowice (Källa: ambassadeursdubearn.com)."],"de":["2016: Gründung in Mourenx/Pau (Quelle: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","September 2021: Vertrag mit Dixiefrog Records (Quelle: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","2024: Nominierung zur Vertretung Frankreichs bei der International Blues Challenge, Memphis.","2026: Als offizielle Vertreter Frankreichs bei der European Blues Challenge in Kattowitz ausgewählt (Quelle: ambassadeursdubearn.com)."],"pl":["2016: Powstanie w Mourenx/Pau (Źródło: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","Wrzesień 2021: Podpisanie kontraktu z Dixiefrog Records (Źródło: ambassadeursdubearn.com).","2024: Nominacja do reprezentowania Francji na International Blues Challenge w Memphis.","2026: Wybór na oficjalnych reprezentantów Francji na European Blues Challenge w Katowicach (Źródło: ambassadeursdubearn.com)."]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"The SuperSoul Brothers \"Shadows & Lights\" (Music Video)","youtube_id":"7CzUtmfvE60","channel":"The SuperSoul Brothers Officiel"},{"kind":"more","title":"The SuperSoul Brothers - \"Please Forgive My Heart\" (Music Video)","youtube_id":"raVGzqvaWJo","channel":"The SuperSoul Brothers Officiel"}]', '{"en":[{"year":2021,"title":"Shadows And Lights","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Debut studio album. Source: ambassadeursdubearn.com."},{"year":2022,"title":"The Road to Sound Live","notes":"Live album."},{"year":2024,"title":"By The Way","notes":"Third album."}],"no":[{"year":2021,"title":"Shadows And Lights","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Debut-studioalbum. Kilde: ambassadeursdubearn.com."},{"year":2022,"title":"The Road to Sound Live","notes":"Livealbum."},{"year":2024,"title":"By The Way","notes":"Tredje album."}],"sv":[{"year":2021,"title":"Shadows And Lights","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Debut-studioalbum. Källa: ambassadeursdubearn.com."},{"year":2022,"title":"The Road to Sound Live","notes":"Livealbum."},{"year":2024,"title":"By The Way","notes":"Tredje albumet."}],"de":[{"year":2021,"title":"Shadows And Lights","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Studio-Debütalbum. Quelle: ambassadeursdubearn.com."},{"year":2022,"title":"The Road to Sound Live","notes":"Livealbum."},{"year":2024,"title":"By The Way","notes":"Drittes Album."}],"pl":[{"year":2021,"title":"Shadows And Lights","label":"Dixiefrog","notes":"Debiutancki album studyjny. Źródło: ambassadeursdubearn.com."},{"year":2022,"title":"The Road to Sound Live","notes":"Album koncertowy."},{"year":2024,"title":"By The Way","notes":"Trzeci album."}]}', '[]', '{"en":[{"year":2024,"title":"9th Challenge Blues Français","category":"First prize"},{"year":2024,"title":"International Blues Challenge, Memphis","category":"Nominated to represent France"},{"year":2026,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Katowice","category":"France''s official representatives"}],"no":[{"year":2024,"title":"9. Challenge Blues Français","category":"Førstepremie"},{"year":2024,"title":"International Blues Challenge, Memphis","category":"Nominert til å representere Frankrike"},{"year":2026,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Katowice","category":"Frankrikes offisielle representanter"}],"sv":[{"year":2024,"title":"9:e Challenge Blues Français","category":"Första pris"},{"year":2024,"title":"International Blues Challenge, Memphis","category":"Nominerad att representera Frankrike"},{"year":2026,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Katowice","category":"Frankrikes officiella representanter"}],"de":[{"year":2024,"title":"9. Challenge Blues Français","category":"Erster Preis"},{"year":2024,"title":"International Blues Challenge, Memphis","category":"Nominierung zur Vertretung Frankreichs"},{"year":2026,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Kattowitz","category":"Offizielle Vertreter Frankreichs"}],"pl":[{"year":2024,"title":"9. Challenge Blues Français","category":"Pierwsza nagroda"},{"year":2024,"title":"International Blues Challenge, Memphis","category":"Nominacja do reprezentowania Francji"},{"year":2026,"title":"European Blues Challenge, Katowice","category":"Oficjalni reprezentanci Francji"}]}', '{"en":[],"no":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'The SuperSoul Brothers – French Deep Soul Band | SlowBlues', 'The SuperSoul Brothers – Fransk deep soul-band | SlowBlues', 'The SuperSoul Brothers – Franskt deep soul-band | SlowBlues', 'The SuperSoul Brothers – Französische Deep-Soul-Band | SlowBlues', 'The SuperSoul Brothers – Francuski zespół deep soul | SlowBlues', 'The SuperSoul Brothers are a Pau-based deep soul and rhythm & blues band, France''s official representatives at the European Blues Challenge 2026. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'The SuperSoul Brothers er et deep soul- og rhythm & blues-band fra Pau, Frankrikes offisielle representanter ved European Blues Challenge 2026. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'The SuperSoul Brothers är ett deep soul- och rhythm & blues-band från Pau, Frankrikes officiella representanter vid European Blues Challenge 2026. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'The SuperSoul Brothers sind eine Deep-Soul- und Rhythm-and-Blues-Band aus Pau, offizielle Vertreter Frankreichs bei der European Blues Challenge 2026. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'The SuperSoul Brothers to zespół deep soul i rhythm & blues z Pau, oficjalni reprezentanci Francji na European Blues Challenge 2026. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/TheSuperSoulBrothers","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/thesupersoulbrothers/"}', '[]', '[{"title":"David Noël, fondateur de The SuperSoul Brothers — Ambassadeurs du Béarn","url":"https://ambassadeursdubearn.com/actualites/portraits-dambassadeurs/david-noel/"},{"title":"Site officiel","url":"https://www.thesupersoulbrothers.com/"}]', 'https://www.thesupersoulbrothers.com/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":"Music For Ever Production","agent_name":"David Noël","booking_email":"david@music-for-ever.fr","booking_phone":"+33 3 89 64 21 36","booking_url":"https://www.thesupersoulbrothers.com/","source_url":"https://www.thesupersoulbrothers.com/","note":"Booking- og managementkontakt: Music For Ever Production, Rixheim, Frankrike. Merk: telefonnummer konvertert til internasjonalt format fra nasjonal notasjon (03 89 64 21 36)."}', '[]');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('f5570626-668c-4aa2-8975-0f4d69e4cc09', 'paul-lamb', 'Paul Lamb & The King Snakes', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'United Kingdom', 'United Kingdom', '/artists', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/Paul_Lamb_and_the_King_Snakes.jpg', 'Foto: Superikonoskop / Wikimedia Commons (CC BY-SA 4.0)', '[]', '[]', 'Europe''s premier blues harmonica player, fronting one of Britain''s longest-running electric blues bands since 1990.', 'Europas fremste bluesmunnspiller, i spissen for et av Storbritannias mest langvarige elektriske bluesband siden 1990.', 'Europas främsta bluesmunspelare, i spetsen för ett av Storbritanniens mest långvariga elektriska bluesband sedan 1990.', 'Europas führender Blues-Mundharmonika-Spieler, seit 1990 an der Spitze einer der langlebigsten britischen Electric-Blues-Bands.', 'Czołowy europejski harmonijkarz bluesowy, na czele jednego z najdłużej działających brytyjskich zespołów electric blues od 1990 roku.', 'Paul Lamb, born 9 July 1955 in Blyth, Northumberland, picked up the harmonica as a boy after hearing Sonny Terry, and by fifteen was already working the North East England club circuit (Source: Wikipedia). At twenty he represented Great Britain at the World Harmonica Championships, an experience that led to him meeting and studying under Terry himself, and to early stage time alongside Buddy Guy, Junior Wells and Brownie McGhee (Source: allaboutbluesmusic.com; Wikipedia). Around 1980 Lamb switched to amplified harmonica in the Walter Horton style and, after a decade as a solo player on the British club scene, formed the Blues Burglars with guitarist Johnny Whitehill, recording for the Red Lightnin'' label in 1986 (Source: allaboutbluesmusic.com).\n\nLamb moved to London and, building on the Blues Burglars partnership, formed Paul Lamb & The King Snakes, whose eponymous debut appeared on Ace Records around 1990. The classic early-1990s line-up featured Whitehill on guitar alongside Martin Deegan (drums), Chad Strentz (vocals/guitar) and Jim Mercer (bass) (Source: Wikipedia). The band signed to Ace Records and later released a long run of albums through Indigo Records, building a touring schedule that has run to roughly 290 dates a year at its peak (Source: hohner.de).\n\nIn 1994 Lamb reached the UK Singles Chart with \"Harmonica Man,\" recorded under the pseudonym Bravado for Pete Waterman''s PWL label — a pop crossover moment for an artist otherwise rooted in traditional electric blues (Source: Wikipedia). He has gone on to work with Mark Knopfler, Rod Stewart, Jimmy Nail and The Who, and has scored music for BBC programmes, film and television commercials (Source: hohner.de; Wikipedia). Today''s King Snakes line-up is built around Lamb on harmonica and vocals, his son Ryan Lamb on lead guitar, long-time vocalist/guitarist Chad Strentz, bassist Rod Demick and drummer Mike Thorne — a settled band that continues to tour Europe, Asia and the Middle East, including a scheduled appearance at the Kjøpsvik Blues Festival in Norway in July 2026 (Source: hohner.de; Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb). Guitarist Johnny Whitehill and the 1990s rhythm section of Martin Deegan and Jim Mercer are historical members of the classic-era King Snakes, not part of today''s touring band (Source: Wikipedia).', 'Paul Lamb, født 9. juli 1955 i Blyth, Northumberland, tok opp munnspill som gutt etter å ha hørt Sonny Terry, og spilte allerede som femtenåring på klubbscenen i Nordøst-England (Kilde: Wikipedia). Som tjueåring representerte han Storbritannia i VM i munnspill, noe som førte til at han møtte og studerte under selveste Terry, og til tidlig scenetid sammen med Buddy Guy, Junior Wells og Brownie McGhee (Kilde: allaboutbluesmusic.com; Wikipedia). Rundt 1980 gikk Lamb over til forsterket munnspill i Walter Horton-stil, og etter et tiår som solo-artist på den britiske klubbscenen dannet han Blues Burglars sammen med gitarist Johnny Whitehill, og spilte inn for Red Lightnin''-selskapet i 1986 (Kilde: allaboutbluesmusic.com).\n\nLamb flyttet til London og formaliserte, med utgangspunkt i Blues Burglars-samarbeidet, Paul Lamb & The King Snakes, hvis selvtitulerte debutalbum kom ut på Ace Records rundt 1990. Den klassiske tidlig-1990-tallsbesetningen hadde Whitehill på gitar sammen med Martin Deegan (trommer), Chad Strentz (vokal/gitar) og Jim Mercer (bass) (Kilde: Wikipedia). Bandet signerte med Ace Records og ga senere ut en lang rekke album via Indigo Records, med en turnéplan som på det meste har talt rundt 290 spillejobber i året (Kilde: hohner.de).\n\nI 1994 nådde Lamb den britiske singellisten med «Harmonica Man», spilt inn under artistnavnet Bravado for Pete Watermans PWL-selskap — et poputspill for en artist ellers forankret i tradisjonell elektrisk blues (Kilde: Wikipedia). Han har siden samarbeidet med Mark Knopfler, Rod Stewart, Jimmy Nail og The Who, og har laget musikk til BBC-programmer, film og TV-reklame (Kilde: hohner.de; Wikipedia). Dagens King Snakes-besetning er bygget rundt Lamb på munnspill og vokal, sønnen Ryan Lamb på sologitar, den mangeårige vokalisten/gitaristen Chad Strentz, bassist Rod Demick og trommeslager Mike Thorne — et stabilt band som fortsatt turnerer i Europa, Asia og Midtøsten, med en planlagt opptreden på Kjøpsvik Bluesfestival i Norge i juli 2026 (Kilde: hohner.de; Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb). Gitarist Johnny Whitehill og 1990-tallets rytmeseksjon med Martin Deegan og Jim Mercer er historiske medlemmer av den klassiske King Snakes-perioden, ikke del av dagens turnerende band (Kilde: Wikipedia).', 'Paul Lamb, född 9 juli 1955 i Blyth, Northumberland, tog upp munspel som pojke efter att ha hört Sonny Terry, och spelade redan som femtonåring på klubbscenen i nordöstra England (Källa: Wikipedia). Som tjugoåring representerade han Storbritannien i VM i munspel, vilket ledde till att han mötte och studerade under själve Terry, och till tidig scentid tillsammans med Buddy Guy, Junior Wells och Brownie McGhee (Källa: allaboutbluesmusic.com; Wikipedia). Runt 1980 gick Lamb över till förstärkt munspel i Walter Hortons stil, och efter ett decennium som soloartist på den brittiska klubbscenen bildade han Blues Burglars tillsammans med gitarristen Johnny Whitehill, och spelade in för bolaget Red Lightnin'' 1986 (Källa: allaboutbluesmusic.com).\n\nLamb flyttade till London och formaliserade, med utgångspunkt i Blues Burglars-samarbetet, Paul Lamb & The King Snakes, vars självbetitlade debutalbum kom ut på Ace Records omkring 1990. Den klassiska besättningen i tidiga 1990-talet hade Whitehill på gitarr tillsammans med Martin Deegan (trummor), Chad Strentz (sång/gitarr) och Jim Mercer (bas) (Källa: Wikipedia). Bandet skrev kontrakt med Ace Records och gav senare ut en lång rad album via Indigo Records, med en turnéplan som som mest har omfattat runt 290 spelningar om året (Källa: hohner.de).\n\n1994 nådde Lamb den brittiska singellistan med \"Harmonica Man\", inspelad under artistnamnet Bravado för Pete Watermans bolag PWL — ett popkorsdrag för en artist annars förankrad i traditionell elektrisk blues (Källa: Wikipedia). Han har sedan samarbetat med Mark Knopfler, Rod Stewart, Jimmy Nail och The Who, och har gjort musik till BBC-program, film och tv-reklam (Källa: hohner.de; Wikipedia). Dagens King Snakes-besättning är byggd kring Lamb på munspel och sång, sonen Ryan Lamb på sologitarr, den mångåriga sångaren/gitarristen Chad Strentz, basisten Rod Demick och trummisen Mike Thorne — ett stabilt band som fortsätter att turnera i Europa, Asien och Mellanöstern, med ett planerat framträdande på Kjøpsvik Bluesfestival i Norge i juli 2026 (Källa: hohner.de; Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb). Gitarristen Johnny Whitehill och 1990-talets rytmsektion med Martin Deegan och Jim Mercer är historiska medlemmar av den klassiska King Snakes-eran, inte en del av dagens turnerande band (Källa: Wikipedia).', 'Paul Lamb, geboren am 9. Juli 1955 in Blyth, Northumberland, griff als Junge zur Mundharmonika, nachdem er Sonny Terry gehört hatte, und spielte bereits mit fünfzehn Jahren auf der Club-Szene Nordostenglands (Quelle: Wikipedia). Mit zwanzig vertrat er Großbritannien bei der Mundharmonika-Weltmeisterschaft, was dazu führte, dass er Terry persönlich traf und bei ihm lernte, sowie früh gemeinsam mit Buddy Guy, Junior Wells und Brownie McGhee auf der Bühne stand (Quelle: allaboutbluesmusic.com; Wikipedia). Um 1980 wechselte Lamb zur verstärkten Mundharmonika im Stil von Walter Horton, und nach einem Jahrzehnt als Solokünstler auf der britischen Club-Szene gründete er mit Gitarrist Johnny Whitehill die Blues Burglars, mit denen er 1986 für das Label Red Lightnin'' aufnahm (Quelle: allaboutbluesmusic.com).\n\nLamb zog nach London und formte, aufbauend auf der Blues-Burglars-Partnerschaft, Paul Lamb & The King Snakes, deren selbstbetiteltes Debütalbum um 1990 bei Ace Records erschien. Die klassische Besetzung der frühen 1990er bestand aus Whitehill an der Gitarre neben Martin Deegan (Schlagzeug), Chad Strentz (Gesang/Gitarre) und Jim Mercer (Bass) (Quelle: Wikipedia). Die Band unterschrieb bei Ace Records und veröffentlichte später eine lange Reihe von Alben über Indigo Records, mit einem Tourplan, der in Spitzenzeiten rund 290 Auftritte pro Jahr umfasste (Quelle: hohner.de).\n\n1994 erreichte Lamb mit „Harmonica Man" die britischen Single-Charts, aufgenommen unter dem Pseudonym Bravado für Pete Watermans Label PWL — ein Pop-Ausflug für einen Künstler, der ansonsten im traditionellen Electric Blues verwurzelt ist (Quelle: Wikipedia). Er hat seitdem mit Mark Knopfler, Rod Stewart, Jimmy Nail und The Who zusammengearbeitet und Musik für BBC-Sendungen, Filme und Fernsehwerbung komponiert (Quelle: hohner.de; Wikipedia). Die heutige King-Snakes-Besetzung besteht aus Lamb an Mundharmonika und Gesang, seinem Sohn Ryan Lamb an der Leadgitarre, dem langjährigen Sänger/Gitarristen Chad Strentz, Bassist Rod Demick und Schlagzeuger Mike Thorne — eine feste Band, die weiterhin durch Europa, Asien und den Nahen Osten tourt, mit einem geplanten Auftritt beim Kjøpsvik Blues Festival in Norwegen im Juli 2026 (Quelle: hohner.de; Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb). Gitarrist Johnny Whitehill sowie die Rhythmusgruppe der 1990er mit Martin Deegan und Jim Mercer sind historische Mitglieder der klassischen King-Snakes-Ära, nicht Teil der heutigen Tourband (Quelle: Wikipedia).', 'Paul Lamb, urodzony 9 lipca 1955 roku w Blyth w hrabstwie Northumberland, sięgnął po harmonijkę ustną jako chłopiec po usłyszeniu Sonny''ego Terry''ego i już jako piętnastolatek grał na scenie klubowej północno-wschodniej Anglii (Źródło: Wikipedia). W wieku dwudziestu lat reprezentował Wielką Brytanię na Mistrzostwach Świata w Grze na Harmonijce, co doprowadziło do poznania i nauki u samego Terry''ego oraz wczesnych występów u boku Buddy''ego Guya, Juniora Wellsa i Browniego McGhee (Źródło: allaboutbluesmusic.com; Wikipedia). Około 1980 roku Lamb przeszedł na wzmacnianą harmonijkę w stylu Waltera Hortona, a po dekadzie jako solowy wykonawca na brytyjskiej scenie klubowej założył Blues Burglars wraz z gitarzystą Johnnym Whitehillem, nagrywając dla wytwórni Red Lightnin'' w 1986 roku (Źródło: allaboutbluesmusic.com).\n\nLamb przeniósł się do Londynu i, opierając się na współpracy z Blues Burglars, sformował Paul Lamb & The King Snakes, których debiutancki album ukazał się nakładem Ace Records około 1990 roku. Klasyczny skład z wczesnych lat 90. tworzyli Whitehill na gitarze wraz z Martinem Deeganem (perkusja), Chadem Strentzem (wokal/gitara) i Jimem Mercerem (bas) (Źródło: Wikipedia). Zespół podpisał kontrakt z Ace Records, a później wydał długą serię albumów przez Indigo Records, z grafikiem koncertowym sięgającym w szczytowym okresie około 290 występów rocznie (Źródło: hohner.de).\n\nW 1994 roku Lamb trafił na brytyjską listę singli z utworem „Harmonica Man", nagranym pod pseudonimem Bravado dla wytwórni PWL Pete''a Watermana — popowy epizod dla artysty zakorzenionego skądinąd w tradycyjnym electric blues (Źródło: Wikipedia). Współpracował od tego czasu z Markiem Knopflerem, Rodem Stewartem, Jimmym Nailem i The Who, a także tworzył muzykę do programów BBC, filmów i reklam telewizyjnych (Źródło: hohner.de; Wikipedia). Obecny skład King Snakes tworzą Lamb na harmonijce i wokalu, jego syn Ryan Lamb na gitarze prowadzącej, wieloletni wokalista/gitarzysta Chad Strentz, basista Rod Demick i perkusista Mike Thorne — ustabilizowany zespół, który wciąż koncertuje w Europie, Azji i na Bliskim Wschodzie, w tym zaplanowany występ na Kjøpsvik Blues Festival w Norwegii w lipcu 2026 roku (Źródło: hohner.de; Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb). Gitarzysta Johnny Whitehill oraz sekcja rytmiczna z lat 90. w składzie Martin Deegan i Jim Mercer to historyczni członkowie klasycznej ery King Snakes, nienależący do dzisiejszego zespołu koncertowego (Źródło: Wikipedia).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Blyth, Northumberland, England', '1990–', 'Paul Lamb stands as one of the last direct links between Sonny Terry''s generation of acoustic blues harmonica and the modern British electric blues scene — a player who learned from the source and then spent four decades carrying it forward through relentless touring (Source: hohner.de). His induction into the British Blues Awards Hall of Fame, alongside Peter Green and John Mayall, reflects a career judged less on a single hit and more on unbroken decades of playing (Source: Wikipedia). The band''s ability to stay together in a recognisable form for over three decades, now including his own son on lead guitar, has made Paul Lamb & The King Snakes one of the reference points for what a working British blues band looks like.', 'Paul Lamb står som en av de siste direkte forbindelsene mellom Sonny Terrys generasjon av akustisk bluesmunnspill og dagens britiske elektriske bluesscene — en musiker som lærte fra kilden og deretter brukte fire tiår på å føre den videre gjennom en ustoppelig turnévirksomhet (Kilde: hohner.de). Innlemmelsen hans i British Blues Awards Hall of Fame, sammen med Peter Green og John Mayall, gjenspeiler en karriere som vurderes mindre ut fra én enkelt hit og mer ut fra ubrutte tiår med spilling (Kilde: Wikipedia). Bandets evne til å holde sammen i en gjenkjennelig form i over tre tiår, nå med hans egen sønn på sologitar, har gjort Paul Lamb & The King Snakes til et av referansepunktene for hvordan et arbeidende britisk bluesband ser ut.', 'Paul Lamb är en av de sista direkta länkarna mellan Sonny Terrys generation av akustiskt bluesmunspel och dagens brittiska elektriska bluesscen — en musiker som lärde sig från källan och sedan ägnade fyra decennier åt att föra den vidare genom en oavbruten turnéverksamhet (Källa: hohner.de). Hans invigning i British Blues Awards Hall of Fame, tillsammans med Peter Green och John Mayall, speglar en karriär som bedöms mindre utifrån en enskild hit och mer utifrån obrutna decennier av spelande (Källa: Wikipedia). Bandets förmåga att hålla ihop i en igenkännbar form i över tre decennier, nu med hans egen son på sologitarr, har gjort Paul Lamb & The King Snakes till en av referenspunkterna för hur ett arbetande brittiskt bluesband ser ut.', 'Paul Lamb ist eines der letzten direkten Bindeglieder zwischen Sonny Terrys Generation akustischer Blues-Mundharmonika und der modernen britischen Electric-Blues-Szene — ein Musiker, der von der Quelle lernte und die Tradition dann vier Jahrzehnte lang durch unermüdliches Touren weitertrug (Quelle: hohner.de). Seine Aufnahme in die British Blues Awards Hall of Fame, gemeinsam mit Peter Green und John Mayall, spiegelt eine Karriere wider, die weniger an einem einzelnen Hit als an ungebrochenen Jahrzehnten des Spielens gemessen wird (Quelle: Wikipedia). Die Fähigkeit der Band, über drei Jahrzehnte in erkennbarer Form zusammenzubleiben, inzwischen mit seinem eigenen Sohn an der Leadgitarre, hat Paul Lamb & The King Snakes zu einem der Referenzpunkte dafür gemacht, wie eine aktive britische Bluesband aussieht.', 'Paul Lamb jest jednym z ostatnich bezpośrednich ogniw łączących pokolenie akustycznej harmonijki bluesowej Sonny''ego Terry''ego ze współczesną brytyjską sceną electric blues — muzykiem, który uczył się u źródła, a potem przez cztery dekady niósł tę tradycję dalej dzięki nieustannemu koncertowaniu (Źródło: hohner.de). Jego wprowadzenie do British Blues Awards Hall of Fame, obok Petera Greena i Johna Mayalla, odzwierciedla karierę ocenianą mniej przez pryzmat jednego przeboju, a bardziej przez nieprzerwane dekady grania (Źródło: Wikipedia). Zdolność zespołu do utrzymania rozpoznawalnego składu przez ponad trzy dekady, obecnie z własnym synem na gitarze prowadzącej, uczyniła Paul Lamb & The King Snakes jednym z punktów odniesienia dla tego, jak wygląda pracujący brytyjski zespół bluesowy.', '[]', '{"no":[{"title":"Harmonica Man","year":1994,"note":"Bravado feat. Paul Lamb — nådde UK Singles Chart, produsert av Pete Waterman (Kilde: Wikipedia)."},{"title":"Ya Ya","year":null,"note":"Fast liverepertoar, klassisk R&B-cover."}],"en":[{"title":"Harmonica Man","year":1994,"note":"Bravado feat. Paul Lamb — reached the UK Singles Chart, produced by Pete Waterman (Source: Wikipedia)."},{"title":"Ya Ya","year":null,"note":"Long-standing live staple, a classic R&B cover."}],"sv":[{"title":"Harmonica Man","year":1994,"note":"Bravado feat. Paul Lamb — nådde brittiska singellistan, producerad av Pete Waterman (Källa: Wikipedia)."},{"title":"Ya Ya","year":null,"note":"Långvarig liverepertoar, en klassisk R&B-cover."}],"de":[{"title":"Harmonica Man","year":1994,"note":"Bravado feat. Paul Lamb — erreichte die britischen Single-Charts, produziert von Pete Waterman (Quelle: Wikipedia)."},{"title":"Ya Ya","year":null,"note":"Langjähriger Live-Klassiker, ein klassischer R&B-Cover."}],"pl":[{"title":"Harmonica Man","year":1994,"note":"Bravado feat. Paul Lamb — trafił na brytyjską listę singli, wyprodukowany przez Pete''a Watermana (Źródło: Wikipedia)."},{"title":"Ya Ya","year":null,"note":"Wieloletni stały punkt koncertów, klasyczny cover R&B."}]}', '[]', '["Harmonica","Vocals","Guitar","Bass","Drums"]', '["Chicago Blues","Electric Blues","Traditional Blues","R&B"]', '{"no":[{"relation":"Sønn","name":"Ryan Lamb","note":"Sologitarist i dagens King Snakes-besetning (Kilde: hohner.de).","source":"hohner.de"}],"en":[{"relation":"Son","name":"Ryan Lamb","note":"Lead guitarist in today''s King Snakes line-up (Source: hohner.de).","source":"hohner.de"}],"sv":[{"relation":"Son","name":"Ryan Lamb","note":"Sologitarrist i dagens King Snakes-besättning (Källa: hohner.de).","source":"hohner.de"}],"de":[{"relation":"Sohn","name":"Ryan Lamb","note":"Leadgitarrist in der heutigen King-Snakes-Besetzung (Quelle: hohner.de).","source":"hohner.de"}],"pl":[{"relation":"Syn","name":"Ryan Lamb","note":"Gitarzysta prowadzący w obecnym składzie King Snakes (Źródło: hohner.de).","source":"hohner.de"}]}', '{"no":["1955: Paul Lamb født i Blyth, Northumberland (Kilde: Wikipedia).","c. 1970: Begynte å spille på klubbscenen i Nordøst-England, 15 år gammel.","c. 1975: Representerte Storbritannia i VM i munnspill; møtte og studerte under Sonny Terry.","c. 1980: Gikk over til forsterket munnspill; dannet Blues Burglars med Johnny Whitehill.","1986: Blues Burglars ga ut plate på Red Lightnin''-selskapet (Kilde: allaboutbluesmusic.com).","c. 1990: Paul Lamb & The King Snakes dannet, debutalbum på Ace Records.","1990–1992: Kåret til UK Blues Band of the Year tre år på rad (Kilde: Wikipedia).","1994: «Harmonica Man» (som Bravado) nådde UK Singles Chart.","2013: Paul Lamb kåret til British Blues Harmonica Player of the Year.","2017: Livealbumet «Live at the Royal Albert Hall» utgitt.","Juli 2026: Planlagt opptreden på Kjøpsvik Bluesfestival, Norge (Kilde: Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb)."],"en":["1955: Paul Lamb born in Blyth, Northumberland (Source: Wikipedia).","c. 1970: Started playing the North East England club circuit aged 15.","c. 1975: Represented the UK at the World Harmonica Championships; met and studied under Sonny Terry.","c. 1980: Switched to amplified harmonica; formed the Blues Burglars with Johnny Whitehill.","1986: The Blues Burglars recorded for the Red Lightnin'' label (Source: allaboutbluesmusic.com).","c. 1990: Paul Lamb & The King Snakes formed, debut album on Ace Records.","1990-1992: Voted UK Blues Band of the Year three years running (Source: Wikipedia).","1994: \"Harmonica Man\" (as Bravado) reached the UK Singles Chart.","2013: Paul Lamb voted British Blues Harmonica Player of the Year.","2017: Live album \"Live at the Royal Albert Hall\" released.","July 2026: Scheduled appearance at Kjøpsvik Blues Festival, Norway (Source: Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb)."],"sv":["1955: Paul Lamb föds i Blyth, Northumberland (Källa: Wikipedia).","c. 1970: Började spela på klubbscenen i nordöstra England, 15 år gammal.","c. 1975: Representerade Storbritannien i VM i munspel; mötte och studerade under Sonny Terry.","c. 1980: Gick över till förstärkt munspel; bildade Blues Burglars med Johnny Whitehill.","1986: Blues Burglars spelade in för bolaget Red Lightnin'' (Källa: allaboutbluesmusic.com).","c. 1990: Paul Lamb & The King Snakes bildas, debutalbum på Ace Records.","1990-1992: Utsedd till UK Blues Band of the Year tre år i rad (Källa: Wikipedia).","1994: \"Harmonica Man\" (som Bravado) når brittiska singellistan.","2013: Paul Lamb utsedd till British Blues Harmonica Player of the Year.","2017: Livealbumet \"Live at the Royal Albert Hall\" släpps.","Juli 2026: Planerat framträdande på Kjøpsvik Bluesfestival, Norge (Källa: Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb)."],"de":["1955: Paul Lamb wird in Blyth, Northumberland, geboren (Quelle: Wikipedia).","um 1970: Beginnt im Alter von 15 Jahren auf der Club-Szene Nordostenglands zu spielen.","um 1975: Vertritt Großbritannien bei der Mundharmonika-Weltmeisterschaft; trifft Sonny Terry und lernt bei ihm.","um 1980: Wechselt zur verstärkten Mundharmonika; gründet mit Johnny Whitehill die Blues Burglars.","1986: Die Blues Burglars nehmen für das Label Red Lightnin'' auf (Quelle: allaboutbluesmusic.com).","um 1990: Paul Lamb & The King Snakes werden gegründet, Debütalbum bei Ace Records.","1990-1992: Drei Jahre in Folge zur UK Blues Band of the Year gewählt (Quelle: Wikipedia).","1994: „Harmonica Man\" (als Bravado) erreicht die britischen Single-Charts.","2013: Paul Lamb wird zum British Blues Harmonica Player of the Year gewählt.","2017: Das Livealbum „Live at the Royal Albert Hall\" erscheint.","Juli 2026: Geplanter Auftritt beim Kjøpsvik Blues Festival, Norwegen (Quelle: Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb)."],"pl":["1955: Paul Lamb rodzi się w Blyth w hrabstwie Northumberland (Źródło: Wikipedia).","ok. 1970: Zaczyna grać na scenie klubowej północno-wschodniej Anglii w wieku 15 lat.","ok. 1975: Reprezentuje Wielką Brytanię na Mistrzostwach Świata w Grze na Harmonijce; poznaje Sonny''ego Terry''ego i uczy się u niego.","ok. 1980: Przechodzi na wzmacnianą harmonijkę; zakłada Blues Burglars z Johnnym Whitehillem.","1986: Blues Burglars nagrywają dla wytwórni Red Lightnin'' (Źródło: allaboutbluesmusic.com).","ok. 1990: Powstaje Paul Lamb & The King Snakes, debiutancki album w Ace Records.","1990-1992: Zespół wybierany UK Blues Band of the Year trzy lata z rzędu (Źródło: Wikipedia).","1994: „Harmonica Man\" (jako Bravado) trafia na brytyjską listę singli.","2013: Paul Lamb zostaje wybrany British Blues Harmonica Player of the Year.","2017: Ukazuje się album koncertowy „Live at the Royal Albert Hall\".","Lipiec 2026: Zaplanowany występ na Kjøpsvik Blues Festival w Norwegii (Źródło: Kjøpsvik Bluesklubb)."]}', '{"no":[{"category":"Annet","name":"Munnspill: Hohner Marine Band og Chromatics","note":"Lamb bruker utelukkende Hohner Marine Band og kromatiske munnspill: «The only Harmonica I choose to use is the Hohner Marine Band and Chromatics» (Kilde: hohner.de).","years":null}],"en":[{"category":"Annet","name":"Harmonica: Hohner Marine Band and Chromatics","note":"Lamb uses only Hohner Marine Band and chromatic harmonicas: \"The only Harmonica I choose to use is the Hohner Marine Band and Chromatics\" (Source: hohner.de).","years":null}],"sv":[{"category":"Annet","name":"Munspel: Hohner Marine Band och Chromatics","note":"Lamb använder uteslutande Hohner Marine Band och kromatiska munspel: \"The only Harmonica I choose to use is the Hohner Marine Band and Chromatics\" (Källa: hohner.de).","years":null}],"de":[{"category":"Annet","name":"Mundharmonika: Hohner Marine Band und Chromatics","note":"Lamb verwendet ausschließlich Hohner Marine Band und chromatische Mundharmonikas: „The only Harmonica I choose to use is the Hohner Marine Band and Chromatics\" (Quelle: hohner.de).","years":null}],"pl":[{"category":"Annet","name":"Harmonijka: Hohner Marine Band i Chromatics","note":"Lamb używa wyłącznie harmonijek Hohner Marine Band i chromatycznych: „The only Harmonica I choose to use is the Hohner Marine Band and Chromatics\" (Źródło: hohner.de).","years":null}]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[{"name":"Sonny Terry","note":"Lambs mentor; studerte direkte under ham etter møtet på 1970-tallet.","source":"Wikipedia"},{"name":"Buddy Guy","note":"Tidlig scenetid sammen med Guy på 1970-tallet.","source":"allaboutbluesmusic.com"},{"name":"Junior Wells","note":"Tidlig scenetid sammen med Wells på 1970-tallet.","source":"allaboutbluesmusic.com"},{"name":"Brownie McGhee","note":"Tidlig scenetid sammen med McGhee på 1970-tallet.","source":"allaboutbluesmusic.com"},{"name":"Mark Knopfler","note":"Dokumentert samarbeid utenfor King Snakes.","source":"hohner.de"},{"name":"The Who","note":"Dokumentert samarbeid utenfor King Snakes.","source":"Wikipedia"},{"name":"Jimmy Nail","note":"Dokumentert samarbeid utenfor King Snakes.","source":"Wikipedia"}],"en":[{"name":"Sonny Terry","note":"Lamb''s mentor; studied directly under him after meeting in the 1970s.","source":"Wikipedia"},{"name":"Buddy Guy","note":"Early stage time alongside Guy in the 1970s.","source":"allaboutbluesmusic.com"},{"name":"Junior Wells","note":"Early stage time alongside Wells in the 1970s.","source":"allaboutbluesmusic.com"},{"name":"Brownie McGhee","note":"Early stage time alongside McGhee in the 1970s.","source":"allaboutbluesmusic.com"},{"name":"Mark Knopfler","note":"Documented collaboration outside the King Snakes.","source":"hohner.de"},{"name":"The Who","note":"Documented collaboration outside the King Snakes.","source":"Wikipedia"},{"name":"Jimmy Nail","note":"Documented collaboration outside the King Snakes.","source":"Wikipedia"}],"sv":[{"name":"Sonny Terry","note":"Lambs mentor; studerade direkt under honom efter mötet på 1970-talet.","source":"Wikipedia"},{"name":"Buddy Guy","note":"Tidig scentid tillsammans med Guy på 1970-talet.","source":"allaboutbluesmusic.com"},{"name":"Junior Wells","note":"Tidig scentid tillsammans med Wells på 1970-talet.","source":"allaboutbluesmusic.com"},{"name":"Brownie McGhee","note":"Tidig scentid tillsammans med McGhee på 1970-talet.","source":"allaboutbluesmusic.com"},{"name":"Mark Knopfler","note":"Dokumenterat samarbete utanför King Snakes.","source":"hohner.de"},{"name":"The Who","note":"Dokumenterat samarbete utanfö