Album of the Year","category":"Za album „Connor Selby\""},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Traditional Blues Artist of the Year"}]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Connor Selby – British Traditional Blues Artist | SlowBlues', 'Connor Selby – Britisk tradisjonell blues-artist | SlowBlues', 'Connor Selby – Brittisk traditionell bluesartist | SlowBlues', 'Connor Selby – Britischer traditioneller Blues-Künstler | SlowBlues', 'Connor Selby – Brytyjski artysta tradycyjnego bluesa | SlowBlues', 'Connor Selby is a British traditional blues guitarist and singer from Kent, MOJO Blues Album of the Year 2023. Biography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Connor Selby er en britisk tradisjonell bluesgitarist og vokalist fra Kent, MOJOs bluesalbum året 2023. Biografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Connor Selby är en brittisk traditionell bluesgitarrist och sångare från Kent, MOJOs bluesalbum året 2023. Biografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Connor Selby ist ein britischer traditioneller Blues-Gitarrist und Sänger aus Kent, MOJO Blues Album of the Year 2023. Biografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Connor Selby to brytyjski gitarzysta i wokalista tradycyjnego bluesa z Kent, Blues Album of the Year magazynu MOJO 2023. Biografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{}', '[]', '[{"title":"connorselby.com — Bio","url":"https://www.connorselby.com/bio"},{"title":"australianmusician.com.au — Connor Selby: The New Face of British Blues Guitar","url":"https://australianmusician.com.au/connor-selby-the-new-face-of-british-blues-guitar/"}]', 'https://www.connorselby.com', NULL, '{}', '[]');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('ecd96b29-7413-4ce8-83a0-bea91e338fae', 'zac-schulze-gang', 'The Zac Schulze Gang', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'United Kingdom', 'United Kingdom', '/artists', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/a05df6_7099d928659941a699964463caf2a514~mv2.jpg', 'Foto: Joshua Atkins (offisielle pressebilder, august 2024, zacschulzegang.rocks)', '[]', '[]', 'A raw blues-rock trio from Gillingham, Kent, invited to play Eric Clapton''s Crossroads Guitar Festival and voted UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024.', 'En rå bluesrock-trio fra Gillingham i Kent, invitert til å spille på Eric Claptons Crossroads Guitar Festival, kåret til UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024.', 'En rå bluesrock-trio från Gillingham i Kent, inbjuden att spela på Eric Claptons Crossroads Guitar Festival, utsedd till UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024.', 'Ein rohes Blues-Rock-Trio aus Gillingham, Kent, eingeladen zu Eric Claptons Crossroads Guitar Festival, gekürt zur UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024.', 'Surowe trio blues-rockowe z Gillingham w hrabstwie Kent, zaproszone na Crossroads Guitar Festival Erica Claptona, okrzyknięte UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024.', 'The Zac Schulze Gang formed in Gillingham, in south-east England''s Medway area, in 2020, built around frontman Zac Schulze (guitar, vocals), his brother Ben Schulze (drums, vocals) and bassist Anthony "Ant" Greenwell (Source: zacschulzegang.rocks; noblepr.co.uk). The trio discovered Rory Gallagher together during the pandemic, and that shared discovery shaped a sound that blends rock and blues with punk, funk, country, jazz, soul, metal and pop influences (Source: noblepr.co.uk).\n\nSince forming, the gang have built their name through relentless touring — more than 250 shows a year across the UK and Europe — and were invited to play Eric Clapton''s Crossroads Guitar Festival in Los Angeles in 2023, followed by an appearance at Fairport''s Cropredy Convention in 2024 (Source: noblepr.co.uk). Their releases include "Made of Three" (2023) and the live album "Live and Loud" (2024), followed by their debut studio album "Straight To It" (2025) (Source: bluesrockreview.com).\n\nThe band won the UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year award in 2024 and the Young Artist of the Year award in 2025 (Source: noblepr.co.uk).', 'The Zac Schulze Gang ble dannet i Gillingham, i Medway-området i Sørøst-England, i 2020, bygget rundt frontfigur Zac Schulze (gitar, vokal), broren Ben Schulze (trommer, vokal) og bassist Anthony «Ant» Greenwell (Kilde: zacschulzegang.rocks; noblepr.co.uk). Trioen oppdaget Rory Gallagher sammen under pandemien, og denne felles oppdagelsen formet en lyd som blander rock og blues med punk-, funk-, country-, jazz-, soul-, metal- og pop-påvirkninger (Kilde: noblepr.co.uk).\n\nSiden dannelsen har bandet bygget navnet sitt gjennom ustanselig turnering — over 250 konserter i året i Storbritannia og Europa — og ble invitert til å spille på Eric Claptons Crossroads Guitar Festival i Los Angeles i 2023, etterfulgt av en opptreden på Fairports Cropredy Convention i 2024 (Kilde: noblepr.co.uk). Utgivelsene deres inkluderer «Made of Three» (2023) og livealbumet «Live and Loud» (2024), etterfulgt av debut-studioalbumet «Straight To It» (2025) (Kilde: bluesrockreview.com).\n\nBandet vant prisen UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year i 2024 og Young Artist of the Year i 2025 (Kilde: noblepr.co.uk).', 'The Zac Schulze Gang bildades i Gillingham, i Medway-området i sydöstra England, 2020, byggt kring frontfiguren Zac Schulze (gitarr, sång), brodern Ben Schulze (trummor, sång) och basisten Anthony \"Ant\" Greenwell (Källa: zacschulzegang.rocks; noblepr.co.uk). Trion upptäckte Rory Gallagher tillsammans under pandemin, och den gemensamma upptäckten formade ett sound som blandar rock och blues med punk-, funk-, country-, jazz-, soul-, metal- och popinfluenser (Källa: noblepr.co.uk).\n\nSedan bildandet har bandet byggt sitt namn genom ihärdigt turnerande — över 250 spelningar om året i Storbritannien och Europa — och blev inbjudna att spela på Eric Claptons Crossroads Guitar Festival i Los Angeles 2023, följt av ett framträdande på Fairports Cropredy Convention 2024 (Källa: noblepr.co.uk). Deras utgivningar inkluderar \"Made of Three\" (2023) och livealbumet \"Live and Loud\" (2024), följt av debutstudioalbumet \"Straight To It\" (2025) (Källa: bluesrockreview.com).\n\nBandet vann priset UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024 och Young Artist of the Year 2025 (Källa: noblepr.co.uk).', 'The Zac Schulze Gang wurde 2020 in Gillingham, im Medway-Gebiet Südostenglands, gegründet, um Frontmann Zac Schulze (Gitarre, Gesang), seinen Bruder Ben Schulze (Schlagzeug, Gesang) und Bassist Anthony „Ant" Greenwell herum (Quelle: zacschulzegang.rocks; noblepr.co.uk). Das Trio entdeckte während der Pandemie gemeinsam Rory Gallagher, und diese gemeinsame Entdeckung prägte einen Sound, der Rock und Blues mit Punk-, Funk-, Country-, Jazz-, Soul-, Metal- und Pop-Einflüssen verbindet (Quelle: noblepr.co.uk).\n\nSeit der Gründung hat sich die Band durch unermüdliches Touren einen Namen gemacht — über 250 Auftritte pro Jahr in Großbritannien und Europa — und wurde 2023 zu Eric Claptons Crossroads Guitar Festival in Los Angeles eingeladen, gefolgt von einem Auftritt bei Fairports Cropredy Convention 2024 (Quelle: noblepr.co.uk). Zu ihren Veröffentlichungen zählen „Made of Three" (2023) und das Livealbum „Live and Loud" (2024), gefolgt vom Debütstudioalbum „Straight To It" (2025) (Quelle: bluesrockreview.com).\n\nDie Band gewann 2024 den Preis UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year und 2025 den Young Artist of the Year (Quelle: noblepr.co.uk).', 'The Zac Schulze Gang powstał w Gillingham, w regionie Medway w południowo-wschodniej Anglii, w 2020 roku, zbudowany wokół frontmana Zaca Schulze (gitara, wokal), jego brata Bena Schulze (perkusja, wokal) i basisty Anthony''ego „Anta" Greenwella (Źródło: zacschulzegang.rocks; noblepr.co.uk). Trio odkryło wspólnie Rory''ego Gallaghera podczas pandemii, a to wspólne odkrycie ukształtowało brzmienie łączące rock i blues z wpływami punka, funku, country, jazzu, soulu, metalu i popu (Źródło: noblepr.co.uk).\n\nOd momentu powstania zespół zbudował swoją markę dzięki nieustannemu koncertowaniu — ponad 250 występów rocznie w Wielkiej Brytanii i Europie — i został zaproszony do gry na Crossroads Guitar Festival Erica Claptona w Los Angeles w 2023 roku, a następnie wystąpił na Cropredy Convention Fairport w 2024 roku (Źródło: noblepr.co.uk). Do ich wydawnictw należą „Made of Three" (2023) i album koncertowy „Live and Loud" (2024), a następnie debiutancki album studyjny „Straight To It" (2025) (Źródło: bluesrockreview.com).\n\nZespół zdobył nagrodę UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year w 2024 roku i Young Artist of the Year w 2025 roku (Źródło: noblepr.co.uk).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gillingham, Kent, England', '2020–', 'A pandemic-era discovery of Rory Gallagher turned into one of the UK''s hardest-touring young blues-rock acts, and an invitation to Eric Clapton''s own Crossroads Guitar Festival signals a level of recognition from the genre''s elder statesmen that few emerging British bands achieve this early in a career.', 'En oppdagelse av Rory Gallagher under pandemien ble til et av Storbritannias hardest turnerende unge bluesrock-band, og en invitasjon til Eric Claptons egen Crossroads Guitar Festival signaliserer en anerkjennelse fra sjangerens elder statesmen som få fremvoksende britiske band oppnår så tidlig i karrieren.', 'En upptäckt av Rory Gallagher under pandemin blev till ett av Storbritanniens hårdast turnerande unga bluesrockband, och en inbjudan till Eric Claptons egen Crossroads Guitar Festival signalerar ett erkännande från genrens äldre statsmän som få framväxande brittiska band uppnår så tidigt i karriären.', 'Eine Entdeckung von Rory Gallagher während der Pandemie wurde zu einer der am härtesten tourenden jungen Blues-Rock-Bands Großbritanniens, und eine Einladung zu Eric Claptons eigenem Crossroads Guitar Festival signalisiert eine Anerkennung durch die Altmeister des Genres, die nur wenige aufstrebende britische Bands so früh in ihrer Karriere erreichen.', 'Odkrycie Rory''ego Gallaghera w czasie pandemii zamieniło się w jeden z najintensywniej koncertujących młodych zespołów blues-rockowych w Wielkiej Brytanii, a zaproszenie na własny Crossroads Guitar Festival Erica Claptona sygnalizuje uznanie ze strony starszyzny gatunku, jakie niewiele wschodzących brytyjskich zespołów osiąga tak wcześnie w karierze.', '[]', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[]', '["Guitar","Drums","Bass","Vocals"]', '["Blues Rock","Contemporary Blues"]', '{"no":[{"relation":"Bror","name":"Ben Schulze","note":"Trommeslager; bror av frontfigur Zac Schulze.","source":"zacschulzegang.rocks"}],"en":[{"relation":"Brother","name":"Ben Schulze","note":"Drummer; brother of frontman Zac Schulze.","source":"zacschulzegang.rocks"}],"sv":[{"relation":"Bror","name":"Ben Schulze","note":"Trummis; bror till frontfiguren Zac Schulze.","source":"zacschulzegang.rocks"}],"de":[{"relation":"Bruder","name":"Ben Schulze","note":"Schlagzeuger; Bruder von Frontmann Zac Schulze.","source":"zacschulzegang.rocks"}],"pl":[{"relation":"Brat","name":"Ben Schulze","note":"Perkusista; brat frontmana Zaca Schulze.","source":"zacschulzegang.rocks"}]}', '{"no":["2020: Bandet dannet i Gillingham, Kent (Kilde: zacschulzegang.rocks).","2023: Spilte på Eric Claptons Crossroads Guitar Festival, Los Angeles.","2023: «Made of Three» utgitt.","2024: Opptrådte på Fairports Cropredy Convention.","2024: Livealbumet «Live and Loud» utgitt; kåret til UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year.","2025: Debut-studioalbumet «Straight To It» utgitt; Zac Schulze kåret til Young Artist of the Year (Kilde: noblepr.co.uk; bluesrockreview.com)."],"en":["2020: Band formed in Gillingham, Kent (Source: zacschulzegang.rocks).","2023: Played Eric Clapton''s Crossroads Guitar Festival, Los Angeles.","2023: \"Made of Three\" released.","2024: Appeared at Fairport''s Cropredy Convention.","2024: Live album \"Live and Loud\" released; named UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year.","2025: Debut studio album \"Straight To It\" released; Zac Schulze named Young Artist of the Year (Source: noblepr.co.uk; bluesrockreview.com)."],"sv":["2020: Bandet bildas i Gillingham, Kent (Källa: zacschulzegang.rocks).","2023: Spelar på Eric Claptons Crossroads Guitar Festival, Los Angeles.","2023: \"Made of Three\" släpps.","2024: Uppträder på Fairports Cropredy Convention.","2024: Livealbumet \"Live and Loud\" släpps; utses till UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year.","2025: Debutstudioalbumet \"Straight To It\" släpps; Zac Schulze utses till Young Artist of the Year (Källa: noblepr.co.uk; bluesrockreview.com)."],"de":["2020: Band wird in Gillingham, Kent, gegründet (Quelle: zacschulzegang.rocks).","2023: Auftritt bei Eric Claptons Crossroads Guitar Festival, Los Angeles.","2023: „Made of Three\" erscheint.","2024: Auftritt bei Fairports Cropredy Convention.","2024: Livealbum „Live and Loud\" erscheint; wird UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year.","2025: Debütstudioalbum „Straight To It\" erscheint; Zac Schulze wird Young Artist of the Year (Quelle: noblepr.co.uk; bluesrockreview.com)."],"pl":["2020: Zespół powstaje w Gillingham w hrabstwie Kent (Źródło: zacschulzegang.rocks).","2023: Występ na Crossroads Guitar Festival Erica Claptona w Los Angeles.","2023: Ukazuje się „Made of Three\".","2024: Występ na Cropredy Convention Fairport.","2024: Ukazuje się album koncertowy „Live and Loud\"; zespół zostaje UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year.","2025: Ukazuje się debiutancki album studyjny „Straight To It\"; Zac Schulze zostaje Young Artist of the Year (Źródło: noblepr.co.uk; bluesrockreview.com)."]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"The Zac Schulze Gang - Ballyshannon Blues (Official Music Video)","youtube_id":"xFLo1-jmsV0","channel":"The Zac Schulze Gang"},{"kind":"more","title":"The Zac Schulze Gang - Woman (Official Music Video)","youtube_id":"Wx3lxVE6RRM","channel":"The Zac Schulze Gang"}]', '{"no":[{"year":2023,"title":"Made of Three","notes":"Kilde: bluesrockreview.com."},{"year":2024,"title":"Live and Loud","notes":"Livealbum (Kilde: bluesrockreview.com)."},{"year":2025,"title":"Straight To It","notes":"Debut-studioalbum (Kilde: bluesrockreview.com)."}],"en":[{"year":2023,"title":"Made of Three","notes":"Source: bluesrockreview.com."},{"year":2024,"title":"Live and Loud","notes":"Live album (Source: bluesrockreview.com)."},{"year":2025,"title":"Straight To It","notes":"Debut studio album (Source: bluesrockreview.com)."}],"sv":[{"year":2023,"title":"Made of Three","notes":"Källa: bluesrockreview.com."},{"year":2024,"title":"Live and Loud","notes":"Livealbum (Källa: bluesrockreview.com)."},{"year":2025,"title":"Straight To It","notes":"Debutstudioalbum (Källa: bluesrockreview.com)."}],"de":[{"year":2023,"title":"Made of Three","notes":"Quelle: bluesrockreview.com."},{"year":2024,"title":"Live and Loud","notes":"Livealbum (Quelle: bluesrockreview.com)."},{"year":2025,"title":"Straight To It","notes":"Debütstudioalbum (Quelle: bluesrockreview.com)."}],"pl":[{"year":2023,"title":"Made of Three","notes":"Źródło: bluesrockreview.com."},{"year":2024,"title":"Live and Loud","notes":"Album koncertowy (Źródło: bluesrockreview.com)."},{"year":2025,"title":"Straight To It","notes":"Debiutancki album studyjny (Źródło: bluesrockreview.com)."}]}', '[]', '{"no":[{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Young Artist of the Year","category":"Zac Schulze"}],"en":[{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Young Artist of the Year","category":"Zac Schulze"}],"sv":[{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Young Artist of the Year","category":"Zac Schulze"}],"de":[{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Young Artist of the Year","category":"Zac Schulze"}],"pl":[{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year"},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Young Artist of the Year","category":"Zac Schulze"}]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'The Zac Schulze Gang – Kent Blues-Rock Trio | SlowBlues', 'The Zac Schulze Gang – Bluesrock-trio fra Kent | SlowBlues', 'The Zac Schulze Gang – Bluesrock-trio från Kent | SlowBlues', 'The Zac Schulze Gang – Blues-Rock-Trio aus Kent | SlowBlues', 'The Zac Schulze Gang – Trio blues-rockowe z Kent | SlowBlues', 'The Zac Schulze Gang are a Kent blues-rock trio, UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'The Zac Schulze Gang er en bluesrock-trio fra Kent, UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'The Zac Schulze Gang är en bluesrock-trio från Kent, UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'The Zac Schulze Gang ist ein Blues-Rock-Trio aus Kent, UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'The Zac Schulze Gang to trio blues-rockowe z Kent, UK Blues Emerging Band of the Year 2024. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/zacschulzegang/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/zacschulzegang/"}', '[]', '[{"title":"noblepr.co.uk — The Zac Schulze Gang April 2025 UK Tour","url":"https://www.noblepr.co.uk/press-releases/the-zac-schulze-gang/april-2025-uk-tour.htm"},{"title":"bluesrockreview.com — Straight To It review","url":"https://bluesrockreview.com/2025/09/the-zac-schulze-gang-straight-to-it-review.html"}]', 'https://www.zacschulzegang.rocks', 'https://www.facebook.com/zacschulzegang/', '{}', '[]');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('da8bedba-a880-4a08-95f8-89d060237128', 'brave-rival', 'Brave Rival', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'United Kingdom', 'United Kingdom', '/artists', 'https://braverival.com/wp-content/uploads/Brave-Rival_Will-Carter-26-Large.jpeg', 'Foto: Will Carter (offisiell EPK, braverival.com)', '[]', '[]', 'A Portsmouth blues-rock quartet fronted by Lindsey Bonnick, named Joe Bonamassa favourite and crowned Band of the Year at the 2025 UK Blues Awards.', 'En bluesrock-kvartett fra Portsmouth ledet av Lindsey Bonnick, utpekt som en Joe Bonamassa-favoritt, kåret til Band of the Year på UK Blues Awards 2025.', 'En bluesrock-kvartett från Portsmouth ledd av Lindsey Bonnick, utpekad som en Joe Bonamassa-favorit, utsedd till Band of the Year vid UK Blues Awards 2025.', 'Ein Blues-Rock-Quartett aus Portsmouth mit Frontfrau Lindsey Bonnick, von Joe Bonamassa als Favorit genannt, gekrönt als Band of the Year bei den UK Blues Awards 2025.', 'Kwartet blues-rockowy z Portsmouth prowadzony przez Lindsey Bonnick, ulubieniec Joego Bonamassy, okrzyknięty Band of the Year na UK Blues Awards 2025.', 'Brave Rival formed in Portsmouth, on England''s south coast, in 2019, and quickly built a reputation as one of the UK''s most electrifying live acts (Source: braverival.com). The band is fronted by vocalist Lindsey Bonnick, alongside guitarist Ed "the Shred" Clarke, bassist Billy Dedman and drummer Donna Peters; Chloe Josephine was a founding member who provided dual lead vocals alongside Bonnick before departing the band (Source: braverival.com).\n\nTheir 2022 debut album "Life''s Machine" caught the attention of critics and fans, including Joe Bonamassa, who named the band among his "favourite discoveries." The 2024 follow-up "Fight or Flight" earned a 9/10 review from Classic Rock Magazine, which called it "an album packed with ambition, fire, and killer songs" (Source: braverival.com). Drawing on influences including John Mayer, Aretha Franklin, Heart, Fleetwood Mac, Led Zeppelin and Tedeschi Trucks, the band blends blues, rock and soul into a heavy, riff-driven live sound (Source: braverival.com).\n\nBrave Rival were crowned Band of the Year at the 2025 UK Blues Awards.', 'Brave Rival ble dannet i Portsmouth, på Englands sørkyst, i 2019, og bygget raskt et rykte som et av Storbritannias mest elektriserende liveband (Kilde: braverival.com). Bandet ledes av vokalist Lindsey Bonnick, sammen med gitarist Ed «the Shred» Clarke, bassist Billy Dedman og trommeslager Donna Peters; Chloe Josephine var et grunnleggende medlem som leverte dobbel hovedvokal sammen med Bonnick før hun forlot bandet (Kilde: braverival.com).\n\nDebutalbumet «Life''s Machine» fra 2022 fanget oppmerksomheten til kritikere og fans, deriblant Joe Bonamassa, som nevnte bandet blant sine «favorittoppdagelser». Oppfølgeren «Fight or Flight» fra 2024 fikk 9/10 i anmeldelse fra Classic Rock Magazine, som kalte den «et album fylt med ambisjon, ild og drepende låter» (Kilde: braverival.com). Med inspirasjon fra blant andre John Mayer, Aretha Franklin, Heart, Fleetwood Mac, Led Zeppelin og Tedeschi Trucks, blander bandet blues, rock og soul til en tung, riffdrevet livelyd (Kilde: braverival.com).\n\nBrave Rival ble kåret til Band of the Year på UK Blues Awards 2025.', 'Brave Rival bildades i Portsmouth, på Englands sydkust, 2019, och byggde snabbt ett rykte som ett av Storbritanniens mest elektrifierande liveband (Källa: braverival.com). Bandet leds av sångerskan Lindsey Bonnick, tillsammans med gitarristen Ed \"the Shred\" Clarke, basisten Billy Dedman och trummisen Donna Peters; Chloe Josephine var en grundande medlem som levererade dubbel lead-sång tillsammans med Bonnick innan hon lämnade bandet (Källa: braverival.com).\n\nDebutalbumet \"Life''s Machine\" från 2022 fångade uppmärksamheten hos kritiker och fans, däribland Joe Bonamassa, som nämnde bandet bland sina \"favoritupptäckter\". Uppföljaren \"Fight or Flight\" från 2024 fick 9/10 i recension från Classic Rock Magazine, som kallade den \"ett album fyllt av ambition, eld och dräpande låtar\" (Källa: braverival.com). Med inspiration från bland andra John Mayer, Aretha Franklin, Heart, Fleetwood Mac, Led Zeppelin och Tedeschi Trucks blandar bandet blues, rock och soul till ett tungt, riffdrivet livesound (Källa: braverival.com).\n\nBrave Rival utsågs till Band of the Year vid UK Blues Awards 2025.', 'Brave Rival wurde 2019 in Portsmouth an der englischen Südküste gegründet und baute sich rasch den Ruf als eine der elektrisierendsten Liveacts Großbritanniens auf (Quelle: braverival.com). Die Band wird angeführt von Sängerin Lindsey Bonnick, gemeinsam mit Gitarrist Ed „the Shred" Clarke, Bassist Billy Dedman und Schlagzeugerin Donna Peters; Chloe Josephine war ein Gründungsmitglied, das gemeinsam mit Bonnick doppelten Leadgesang lieferte, bevor sie die Band verließ (Quelle: braverival.com).\n\nIhr Debütalbum „Life''s Machine" von 2022 erregte die Aufmerksamkeit von Kritikern und Fans, darunter Joe Bonamassa, der die Band zu seinen „liebsten Entdeckungen" zählte. Das Nachfolgealbum „Fight or Flight" von 2024 erhielt eine 9/10-Bewertung vom Classic Rock Magazine, das es als „ein Album voller Ambition, Feuer und großartiger Songs" bezeichnete (Quelle: braverival.com). Mit Einflüssen von unter anderem John Mayer, Aretha Franklin, Heart, Fleetwood Mac, Led Zeppelin und Tedeschi Trucks verbindet die Band Blues, Rock und Soul zu einem schweren, riffgetriebenen Livesound (Quelle: braverival.com).\n\nBrave Rival wurden bei den UK Blues Awards 2025 zur Band of the Year gekürt.', 'Brave Rival powstał w Portsmouth, na południowym wybrzeżu Anglii, w 2019 roku, i szybko zbudował reputację jednego z najbardziej elektryzujących zespołów koncertowych w Wielkiej Brytanii (Źródło: braverival.com). Zespół prowadzi wokalistka Lindsey Bonnick, wraz z gitarzystą Edem „the Shred" Clarkiem, basistą Billym Dedmanem i perkusistką Donną Peters; Chloe Josephine była członkinią założycielką, która zapewniała podwójny wokal prowadzący razem z Bonnick, zanim opuściła zespół (Źródło: braverival.com).\n\nDebiutancki album „Life''s Machine" z 2022 roku przyciągnął uwagę krytyków i fanów, w tym Joego Bonamassy, który wymienił zespół wśród swoich „ulubionych odkryć". Kontynuacja „Fight or Flight" z 2024 roku otrzymała ocenę 9/10 od Classic Rock Magazine, który nazwał ją „albumem pełnym ambicji, ognia i znakomitych piosenek" (Źródło: braverival.com). Czerpiąc inspirację między innymi z John Mayera, Arethy Franklin, Heart, Fleetwood Mac, Led Zeppelin i Tedeschi Trucks, zespół łączy blues, rock i soul w ciężkie, oparte na riffach brzmienie koncertowe (Źródło: braverival.com).\n\nBrave Rival zostali okrzyknięci Band of the Year na UK Blues Awards 2025.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Portsmouth, England', '2019–', 'Endorsed directly by Joe Bonamassa as one of his own favourite discoveries and now UK Blues Awards Band of the Year, Brave Rival represent a harder-edged, riff-driven strand of the current British blues-rock scene, built as much on classic rock songwriting as on blues form.', 'Anbefalt direkte av Joe Bonamassa som en av hans egne favorittoppdagelser, og nå Band of the Year på UK Blues Awards, representerer Brave Rival en hardere, riffdrevet gren av dagens britiske bluesrock-scene, bygget like mye på klassisk rock-låtskriving som på blues-form.', 'Rekommenderat direkt av Joe Bonamassa som en av hans egna favoritupptäckter, och nu Band of the Year vid UK Blues Awards, representerar Brave Rival en hårdare, riffdriven gren av dagens brittiska bluesrock-scen, byggd lika mycket på klassiskt rock-låtskrivande som på bluesform.', 'Direkt von Joe Bonamassa als eine seiner eigenen Lieblingsentdeckungen empfohlen und nun Band of the Year bei den UK Blues Awards, verkörpert Brave Rival einen härteren, riffgetriebenen Strang der aktuellen britischen Blues-Rock-Szene, aufgebaut ebenso sehr auf klassischem Rock-Songwriting wie auf Blues-Form.', 'Polecany bezpośrednio przez Joego Bonamassę jako jedno z jego ulubionych odkryć, a teraz Band of the Year na UK Blues Awards, Brave Rival reprezentuje ostrzejszy, oparty na riffach nurt obecnej brytyjskiej sceny blues-rockowej, zbudowany w równym stopniu na klasycznym pisaniu piosenek rockowych, co na formie bluesowej.', '[]', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[]', '["Vocals","Guitar","Bass","Drums"]', '["Blues Rock","Contemporary Blues"]', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":["2019: Bandet dannet i Portsmouth (Kilde: braverival.com).","2022: Debutalbumet «Life''s Machine» utgitt; fikk ros fra Joe Bonamassa.","2024: «Fight or Flight» utgitt, fikk 9/10 i Classic Rock Magazine.","2025: Kåret til Band of the Year på UK Blues Awards (Kilde: braverival.com)."],"en":["2019: Band formed in Portsmouth (Source: braverival.com).","2022: Debut album \"Life''s Machine\" released; praised by Joe Bonamassa.","2024: \"Fight or Flight\" released, earning 9/10 in Classic Rock Magazine.","2025: Named Band of the Year at the UK Blues Awards (Source: braverival.com)."],"sv":["2019: Bandet bildas i Portsmouth (Källa: braverival.com).","2022: Debutalbumet \"Life''s Machine\" släpps; berömt av Joe Bonamassa.","2024: \"Fight or Flight\" släpps, får 9/10 i Classic Rock Magazine.","2025: Utses till Band of the Year vid UK Blues Awards (Källa: braverival.com)."],"de":["2019: Band wird in Portsmouth gegründet (Quelle: braverival.com).","2022: Debütalbum „Life''s Machine\" erscheint; von Joe Bonamassa gelobt.","2024: „Fight or Flight\" erscheint, erhält 9/10 im Classic Rock Magazine.","2025: Auszeichnung als Band of the Year bei den UK Blues Awards (Quelle: braverival.com)."],"pl":["2019: Zespół powstaje w Portsmouth (Źródło: braverival.com).","2022: Ukazuje się debiutancki album „Life''s Machine\"; chwalony przez Joego Bonamassę.","2024: Ukazuje się „Fight or Flight\", zdobywając 9/10 w Classic Rock Magazine.","2025: Tytuł Band of the Year na UK Blues Awards (Źródło: braverival.com)."]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[{"name":"Will Wilde","note":"Gjesteopptreden på «Stand Up».","source":"YouTube"}],"en":[{"name":"Will Wilde","note":"Guest feature on \"Stand Up.\"","source":"YouTube"}],"sv":[{"name":"Will Wilde","note":"Gästmedverkan på \"Stand Up\".","source":"YouTube"}],"de":[{"name":"Will Wilde","note":"Gastauftritt bei „Stand Up\".","source":"YouTube"}],"pl":[{"name":"Will Wilde","note":"Gościnny udział w „Stand Up\".","source":"YouTube"}]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"Brave Rival - Stand Up (feat. Will Wilde) (Official Music Video)","youtube_id":"ev_1u9LAllk","channel":"Brave Rival"},{"kind":"more","title":"Brave Rival - Bad Choices (Official Music Video)","youtube_id":"AcWtDiG5e2Y","channel":"Brave Rival"}]', '{"no":[{"year":2022,"title":"Life''s Machine","notes":"Debutalbum; fikk ros fra Joe Bonamassa (Kilde: braverival.com)."},{"year":2024,"title":"Fight or Flight","notes":"9/10 i Classic Rock Magazine (Kilde: braverival.com)."}],"en":[{"year":2022,"title":"Life''s Machine","notes":"Debut album; praised by Joe Bonamassa (Source: braverival.com)."},{"year":2024,"title":"Fight or Flight","notes":"9/10 in Classic Rock Magazine (Source: braverival.com)."}],"sv":[{"year":2022,"title":"Life''s Machine","notes":"Debutalbum; berömt av Joe Bonamassa (Källa: braverival.com)."},{"year":2024,"title":"Fight or Flight","notes":"9/10 i Classic Rock Magazine (Källa: braverival.com)."}],"de":[{"year":2022,"title":"Life''s Machine","notes":"Debütalbum; von Joe Bonamassa gelobt (Quelle: braverival.com)."},{"year":2024,"title":"Fight or Flight","notes":"9/10 im Classic Rock Magazine (Quelle: braverival.com)."}],"pl":[{"year":2022,"title":"Life''s Machine","notes":"Debiutancki album; chwalony przez Joego Bonamassę (Źródło: braverival.com)."},{"year":2024,"title":"Fight or Flight","notes":"9/10 w Classic Rock Magazine (Źródło: braverival.com)."}]}', '[]', '{"no":[{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Band of the Year"}],"en":[{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Band of the Year"}],"sv":[{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Band of the Year"}],"de":[{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Band of the Year"}],"pl":[{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Awards Band of the Year"}]}', '{"no":[{"quote":"An album packed with ambition, fire, and killer songs.","author":"Classic Rock Magazine","role":"Anmeldelse av «Fight or Flight», 9/10","source_title":"Classic Rock Magazine","source_url":null,"year":2024}],"en":[{"quote":"An album packed with ambition, fire, and killer songs.","author":"Classic Rock Magazine","role":"Review of \"Fight or Flight,\" 9/10","source_title":"Classic Rock Magazine","source_url":null,"year":2024}],"sv":[{"quote":"An album packed with ambition, fire, and killer songs.","author":"Classic Rock Magazine","role":"Recension av \"Fight or Flight\", 9/10","source_title":"Classic Rock Magazine","source_url":null,"year":2024}],"de":[{"quote":"An album packed with ambition, fire, and killer songs.","author":"Classic Rock Magazine","role":"Rezension von „Fight or Flight\", 9/10","source_title":"Classic Rock Magazine","source_url":null,"year":2024}],"pl":[{"quote":"An album packed with ambition, fire, and killer songs.","author":"Classic Rock Magazine","role":"Recenzja „Fight or Flight\", 9/10","source_title":"Classic Rock Magazine","source_url":null,"year":2024}]}', 'Brave Rival – Portsmouth Blues-Rock Band | SlowBlues', 'Brave Rival – Bluesrock-band fra Portsmouth | SlowBlues', 'Brave Rival – Bluesrock-band från Portsmouth | SlowBlues', 'Brave Rival – Blues-Rock-Band aus Portsmouth | SlowBlues', 'Brave Rival – Zespół blues-rockowy z Portsmouth | SlowBlues', 'Brave Rival are a Portsmouth blues-rock band, 2025 UK Blues Awards Band of the Year. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Brave Rival er et bluesrock-band fra Portsmouth, Band of the Year på UK Blues Awards 2025. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Brave Rival är ett bluesrock-band från Portsmouth, Band of the Year vid UK Blues Awards 2025. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Brave Rival ist eine Blues-Rock-Band aus Portsmouth, Band of the Year bei den UK Blues Awards 2025. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Brave Rival to zespół blues-rockowy z Portsmouth, Band of the Year na UK Blues Awards 2025. Biografia, dyskografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{}', '[]', '[{"title":"braverival.com — Band","url":"https://braverival.com/band/"}]', 'https://braverival.com', NULL, '{}', '[]');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('86a7bc8a-b21c-4aa7-a040-bc6e1d347b2c', 'dom-martin', 'Dom Martin', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'United Kingdom', 'United Kingdom', '/artists', 'https://static.wixstatic.com/media/fd8b6f_2fa93fbe619d45ed90aee89306fc0895~mv2.jpg', 'Foto: Rob Blackham / Blackham Images (Storrington, februar 2024, dommart.in)', '[]', '[]', 'A Belfast-born guitarist and singer-songwriter hailed as Rory Gallagher''s musical inheritor, four-time UK Blues Award winner and UK Blues Hall of Fame inductee.', 'En gitarist og låtskriver fra Belfast, hyllet som Rory Gallaghers musikalske arvtaker, fire ganger vinner av UK Blues Award og innlemmet i UK Blues Hall of Fame.', 'En gitarrist och låtskrivare från Belfast, hyllad som Rory Gallaghers musikaliska arvtagare, fyrfaldig UK Blues Award-vinnare och medlem av UK Blues Hall of Fame.', 'Ein Gitarrist und Songwriter aus Belfast, gefeiert als musikalischer Erbe von Rory Gallagher, viermaliger UK-Blues-Award-Gewinner und Mitglied der UK Blues Hall of Fame.', 'Gitarzysta i autor piosenek z Belfastu, okrzyknięty muzycznym spadkobiercą Rory''ego Gallaghera, czterokrotny zdobywca UK Blues Award i członek UK Blues Hall of Fame.', 'Dom Martin grew up on the tough, community-driven streets of Belfast, Northern Ireland, and played free gigs in pubs and bars around the North for years while struggling financially, with early struggles with drugs and alcohol that he has spoken openly about (Source: theevenhand.com; guitarworld.com). In 2017 he stepped onto the stage at an open-mic session in a local golf club, where he was spotted by someone with music-industry connections — a chance encounter that changed the direction of his career (Source: guitarworld.com).\n\nHis 2022 album "A Savage Life" propelled him into the UK and European blues-rock scenes, earning five nominations at the 2022-2023 UK Blues Awards and wins for Blues Instrumentalist of the Year and Acoustic Blues Act of the Year. His follow-up, "Buried in the Hail" (September 2023, Forty Below Records), earned Classic Rock Magazine''s "Blues Album of the Month" and won Blues Album of the Year at the 2024 UK Blues Awards (Source: bluesblastmagazine.com; rockandbluesmuse.com).\n\nMartin is a European Blues Award winner (2019, Best Solo/Acoustic Act) and a UK Blues Award winner in 2020, 2021, 2023 and 2025 (Instrumentalist of the Year), represented the UK at the International Blues Challenge in Memphis in 2022, and is a UK Blues Hall of Fame inductee. His acoustic guitar work and distinctive "Belfast Blues" voice have drawn comparisons to John Martyn, Rory Gallagher, Van Morrison and Foy Vance (Source: theevenhand.com).', 'Dom Martin vokste opp i de tøffe, fellesskapsdrevne gatene i Belfast, Nord-Irland, og spilte gratis konserter på puber og barer rundt i Nord-Irland i flere år mens han slet økonomisk, med tidlige kamper mot rus og alkohol som han har snakket åpent om (Kilde: theevenhand.com; guitarworld.com). I 2017 gikk han opp på scenen på en open mic-kveld i en lokal golfklubb, der han ble oppdaget av noen med kontakter i musikkbransjen — et tilfeldig møte som endret karriereretningen hans (Kilde: guitarworld.com).\n\nAlbumet «A Savage Life» fra 2022 løftet ham inn i den britiske og europeiske bluesrock-scenen, med fem nominasjoner ved UK Blues Awards 2022-2023 og seire for Blues Instrumentalist of the Year og Acoustic Blues Act of the Year. Oppfølgeren «Buried in the Hail» (september 2023, Forty Below Records) fikk Classic Rock Magazines «Blues Album of the Month» og vant Blues Album of the Year på UK Blues Awards 2024 (Kilde: bluesblastmagazine.com; rockandbluesmuse.com).\n\nMartin er vinner av European Blues Award (2019, Best Solo/Acoustic Act) og UK Blues Award-vinner i 2020, 2021, 2023 og 2025 (Instrumentalist of the Year), representerte Storbritannia i International Blues Challenge i Memphis i 2022, og er innlemmet i UK Blues Hall of Fame. Det akustiske gitarspillet hans og den særegne «Belfast Blues»-stemmen har fått sammenligninger med John Martyn, Rory Gallagher, Van Morrison og Foy Vance (Kilde: theevenhand.com).', 'Dom Martin växte upp på de hårda, gemenskapsdrivna gatorna i Belfast, Nordirland, och spelade gratiskonserter på pubar och barer runt om i Nordirland i flera år medan han kämpade ekonomiskt, med tidiga kamper mot droger och alkohol som han talat öppet om (Källa: theevenhand.com; guitarworld.com). 2017 klev han upp på scenen vid en öppen mikrofon-kväll på en lokal golfklubb, där han upptäcktes av någon med musikbranschkontakter — ett slumpmässigt möte som förändrade riktningen på hans karriär (Källa: guitarworld.com).\n\nAlbumet \"A Savage Life\" från 2022 lyfte honom in i den brittiska och europeiska bluesrockscenen, med fem nomineringar vid UK Blues Awards 2022-2023 och segrar för Blues Instrumentalist of the Year och Acoustic Blues Act of the Year. Uppföljaren \"Buried in the Hail\" (september 2023, Forty Below Records) fick Classic Rock Magazines \"Blues Album of the Month\" och vann Blues Album of the Year vid UK Blues Awards 2024 (Källa: bluesblastmagazine.com; rockandbluesmuse.com).\n\nMartin är vinnare av European Blues Award (2019, Best Solo/Acoustic Act) och UK Blues Award-vinnare 2020, 2021, 2023 och 2025 (Instrumentalist of the Year), representerade Storbritannien i International Blues Challenge i Memphis 2022, och är invald i UK Blues Hall of Fame. Hans akustiska gitarrspel och särpräglade \"Belfast Blues\"-röst har fått jämförelser med John Martyn, Rory Gallagher, Van Morrison och Foy Vance (Källa: theevenhand.com).', 'Dom Martin wuchs in den rauen, gemeinschaftsgeprägten Straßen von Belfast, Nordirland, auf und spielte jahrelang unbezahlte Gigs in Pubs und Bars in Nordirland, während er finanziell kämpfte, mit frühen Kämpfen gegen Drogen und Alkohol, über die er offen gesprochen hat (Quelle: theevenhand.com; guitarworld.com). 2017 betrat er die Bühne bei einer Open-Mic-Session in einem örtlichen Golfclub, wo er von jemandem mit Musikbranchenkontakten entdeckt wurde — eine zufällige Begegnung, die die Richtung seiner Karriere veränderte (Quelle: guitarworld.com).\n\nSein Album „A Savage Life" von 2022 katapultierte ihn in die britische und europäische Blues-Rock-Szene, mit fünf Nominierungen bei den UK Blues Awards 2022-2023 und Siegen als Blues Instrumentalist of the Year und Acoustic Blues Act of the Year. Das Nachfolgealbum „Buried in the Hail" (September 2023, Forty Below Records) erhielt vom Classic Rock Magazine den Titel „Blues Album of the Month" und gewann bei den UK Blues Awards 2024 den Blues Album of the Year (Quelle: bluesblastmagazine.com; rockandbluesmuse.com).\n\nMartin ist Gewinner des European Blues Award (2019, Best Solo/Acoustic Act) und UK-Blues-Award-Gewinner 2020, 2021, 2023 und 2025 (Instrumentalist of the Year), vertrat Großbritannien 2022 bei der International Blues Challenge in Memphis und ist Mitglied der UK Blues Hall of Fame. Sein akustisches Gitarrenspiel und seine unverwechselbare „Belfast Blues"-Stimme wurden mit John Martyn, Rory Gallagher, Van Morrison und Foy Vance verglichen (Quelle: theevenhand.com).', 'Dom Martin dorastał na trudnych, silnie zżytych ulicach Belfastu w Irlandii Północnej i przez lata grywał darmowe koncerty w pubach i barach w całej Irlandii Północnej, zmagając się z problemami finansowymi oraz, o czym mówił otwarcie, wczesnymi zmaganiami z narkotykami i alkoholem (Źródło: theevenhand.com; guitarworld.com). W 2017 roku wszedł na scenę podczas wieczoru otwartego mikrofonu w lokalnym klubie golfowym, gdzie został zauważony przez kogoś z kontaktami w branży muzycznej — przypadkowe spotkanie, które zmieniło kierunek jego kariery (Źródło: guitarworld.com).\n\nJego album „A Savage Life" z 2022 roku wprowadził go na brytyjską i europejską scenę blues-rockową, przynosząc pięć nominacji na UK Blues Awards 2022-2023 oraz zwycięstwa w kategoriach Blues Instrumentalist of the Year i Acoustic Blues Act of the Year. Kontynuacja „Buried in the Hail" (wrzesień 2023, Forty Below Records) zdobyła tytuł „Blues Album of the Month" magazynu Classic Rock i wygrała Blues Album of the Year na UK Blues Awards 2024 (Źródło: bluesblastmagazine.com; rockandbluesmuse.com).\n\nMartin jest laureatem European Blues Award (2019, Best Solo/Acoustic Act) oraz UK Blues Award w latach 2020, 2021, 2023 i 2025 (Instrumentalist of the Year), reprezentował Wielką Brytanię na International Blues Challenge w Memphis w 2022 roku i jest członkiem UK Blues Hall of Fame. Jego akustyczna gra na gitarze i charakterystyczny głos „Belfast Blues" bywają porównywane do Johna Martyna, Rory''ego Gallaghera, Van Morrisona i Foy Vance''a (Źródło: theevenhand.com).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Belfast, Northern Ireland', '2017–', 'Hailed by Guitar World as potentially "Rory Gallagher''s musical inheritor," Dom Martin carries Northern Ireland''s blues-rock tradition forward through a raw, largely acoustic-rooted style and unflinchingly honest songwriting about his own struggles — a rare case of a UK Blues Hall of Fame induction arriving within less than a decade of an artist''s first real stage appearance.', 'Hyllet av Guitar World som muligens «Rory Gallaghers musikalske arvtaker», fører Dom Martin Nord-Irlands bluesrock-tradisjon videre gjennom en rå, i stor grad akustisk forankret stil og en uforbeholdent ærlig låtskriving om egne kamper — et sjeldent tilfelle der innlemmelse i UK Blues Hall of Fame kommer mindre enn et tiår etter artistens første virkelige sceneopptreden.', 'Hyllad av Guitar World som möjligen \"Rory Gallaghers musikaliska arvtagare\", för Dom Martin Nordirlands bluesrocktradition vidare genom en rå, till stor del akustiskt förankrad stil och ett oförbehållsamt ärligt låtskrivande om egna kamper — ett sällsynt fall där invalet i UK Blues Hall of Fame kommer mindre än ett decennium efter artistens första riktiga scenframträdande.', 'Vom Guitar World als möglicher „musikalischer Erbe von Rory Gallagher" gefeiert, trägt Dom Martin Nordirlands Blues-Rock-Tradition durch einen rohen, weitgehend akustisch verwurzelten Stil und schonungslos ehrliches Songwriting über seine eigenen Kämpfe weiter — ein seltener Fall, in dem eine Aufnahme in die UK Blues Hall of Fame weniger als ein Jahrzehnt nach dem ersten echten Bühnenauftritt eines Künstlers erfolgt.', 'Okrzyknięty przez Guitar World potencjalnym „muzycznym spadkobiercą Rory''ego Gallaghera", Dom Martin kontynuuje północnoirlandzką tradycję blues-rocka poprzez surowy, w dużej mierze akustyczny styl i bezkompromisowo szczere pisanie piosenek o własnych zmaganiach — rzadki przypadek, gdy wprowadzenie do UK Blues Hall of Fame następuje mniej niż dekadę po pierwszym prawdziwym występie scenicznym artysty.', '[]', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[]', '["Guitar","Vocals"]', '["Acoustic Blues","Blues Rock","Traditional Blues"]', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":["2017: Oppdaget under en open mic-kveld på en golfklubb nær Antrim, Nord-Irland (Kilde: guitarworld.com).","2019: Vant European Blues Award, Best Solo/Acoustic Act.","2022: «A Savage Life» utgitt, fem nominasjoner ved UK Blues Awards.","2022: Representerte Storbritannia i International Blues Challenge, Memphis.","September 2023: «Buried in the Hail» utgitt på Forty Below Records.","2024: «Buried in the Hail» kåret til Blues Album of the Year.","2025: Vant UK Blues Award, Instrumentalist of the Year, fjerde gang."],"en":["2017: Discovered during an open-mic night at a golf club near Antrim, Northern Ireland (Source: guitarworld.com).","2019: Won the European Blues Award, Best Solo/Acoustic Act.","2022: \"A Savage Life\" released, five nominations at the UK Blues Awards.","2022: Represented the UK at the International Blues Challenge, Memphis.","September 2023: \"Buried in the Hail\" released on Forty Below Records.","2024: \"Buried in the Hail\" named Blues Album of the Year.","2025: Won the UK Blues Award, Instrumentalist of the Year, for the fourth time."],"sv":["2017: Upptäcktes under en öppen mikrofon-kväll på en golfklubb nära Antrim, Nordirland (Källa: guitarworld.com).","2019: Vann European Blues Award, Best Solo/Acoustic Act.","2022: \"A Savage Life\" släpps, fem nomineringar vid UK Blues Awards.","2022: Representerade Storbritannien i International Blues Challenge, Memphis.","September 2023: \"Buried in the Hail\" släpps på Forty Below Records.","2024: \"Buried in the Hail\" utses till Blues Album of the Year.","2025: Vinner UK Blues Award, Instrumentalist of the Year, för fjärde gången."],"de":["2017: Entdeckung bei einer Open-Mic-Nacht in einem Golfclub nahe Antrim, Nordirland (Quelle: guitarworld.com).","2019: Gewinn des European Blues Award, Best Solo/Acoustic Act.","2022: „A Savage Life\" erscheint, fünf Nominierungen bei den UK Blues Awards.","2022: Vertritt Großbritannien bei der International Blues Challenge, Memphis.","September 2023: „Buried in the Hail\" erscheint bei Forty Below Records.","2024: „Buried in the Hail\" wird Blues Album of the Year.","2025: Gewinnt den UK Blues Award, Instrumentalist of the Year, zum vierten Mal."],"pl":["2017: Odkryty podczas wieczoru otwartego mikrofonu w klubie golfowym niedaleko Antrim w Irlandii Północnej (Źródło: guitarworld.com).","2019: Zdobywa European Blues Award, Best Solo/Acoustic Act.","2022: Ukazuje się „A Savage Life\", pięć nominacji na UK Blues Awards.","2022: Reprezentuje Wielką Brytanię na International Blues Challenge w Memphis.","Wrzesień 2023: Ukazuje się „Buried in the Hail\" nakładem Forty Below Records.","2024: „Buried in the Hail\" zostaje Blues Album of the Year.","2025: Zdobywa UK Blues Award, Instrumentalist of the Year, po raz czwarty."]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"Dom Martin - \"Unhinged\" (First single from Buried In The Hail)","youtube_id":"vBDnI9K5PSE","channel":"Dom Martin Official"},{"kind":"more","title":"Dom Martin - Buried In The Hail (Live) (Official Audio)","youtube_id":"MzvOfNMdArU","channel":"Dom Martin Official"}]', '{"no":[{"year":2022,"title":"A Savage Life","notes":"Fem nominasjoner ved UK Blues Awards 2022-2023 (Kilde: bluesblastmagazine.com)."},{"year":2023,"title":"Buried in the Hail","label":"Forty Below Records","notes":"Classic Rock Magazines «Blues Album of the Month»; Blues Album of the Year 2024 (Kilde: rockandbluesmuse.com)."}],"en":[{"year":2022,"title":"A Savage Life","notes":"Five nominations at the 2022-2023 UK Blues Awards (Source: bluesblastmagazine.com)."},{"year":2023,"title":"Buried in the Hail","label":"Forty Below Records","notes":"Classic Rock Magazine''s \"Blues Album of the Month\"; Blues Album of the Year 2024 (Source: rockandbluesmuse.com)."}],"sv":[{"year":2022,"title":"A Savage Life","notes":"Fem nomineringar vid UK Blues Awards 2022-2023 (Källa: bluesblastmagazine.com)."},{"year":2023,"title":"Buried in the Hail","label":"Forty Below Records","notes":"Classic Rock Magazines \"Blues Album of the Month\"; Blues Album of the Year 2024 (Källa: rockandbluesmuse.com)."}],"de":[{"year":2022,"title":"A Savage Life","notes":"Fünf Nominierungen bei den UK Blues Awards 2022-2023 (Quelle: bluesblastmagazine.com)."},{"year":2023,"title":"Buried in the Hail","label":"Forty Below Records","notes":"„Blues Album of the Month\" des Classic Rock Magazine; Blues Album of the Year 2024 (Quelle: rockandbluesmuse.com)."}],"pl":[{"year":2022,"title":"A Savage Life","notes":"Pięć nominacji na UK Blues Awards 2022-2023 (Źródło: bluesblastmagazine.com)."},{"year":2023,"title":"Buried in the Hail","label":"Forty Below Records","notes":"„Blues Album of the Month\" magazynu Classic Rock; Blues Album of the Year 2024 (Źródło: rockandbluesmuse.com)."}]}', '[]', '{"no":[{"year":2019,"title":"European Blues Award","category":"Best Solo/Acoustic Act"},{"year":2020,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2021,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2022,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Instrumentalist of the Year / Acoustic Blues Act of the Year","category":"For «A Savage Life»"},{"year":2023,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Album of the Year","category":"For «Buried in the Hail»"},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":null,"title":"UK Blues Hall of Fame"}],"en":[{"year":2019,"title":"European Blues Award","category":"Best Solo/Acoustic Act"},{"year":2020,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2021,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2022,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Instrumentalist of the Year / Acoustic Blues Act of the Year","category":"For \"A Savage Life\""},{"year":2023,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Album of the Year","category":"For \"Buried in the Hail\""},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":null,"title":"UK Blues Hall of Fame"}],"sv":[{"year":2019,"title":"European Blues Award","category":"Best Solo/Acoustic Act"},{"year":2020,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2021,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2022,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Instrumentalist of the Year / Acoustic Blues Act of the Year","category":"För \"A Savage Life\""},{"year":2023,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Album of the Year","category":"För \"Buried in the Hail\""},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":null,"title":"UK Blues Hall of Fame"}],"de":[{"year":2019,"title":"European Blues Award","category":"Best Solo/Acoustic Act"},{"year":2020,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2021,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2022,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Instrumentalist of the Year / Acoustic Blues Act of the Year","category":"Für „A Savage Life\""},{"year":2023,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Album of the Year","category":"Für „Buried in the Hail\""},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":null,"title":"UK Blues Hall of Fame"}],"pl":[{"year":2019,"title":"European Blues Award","category":"Best Solo/Acoustic Act"},{"year":2020,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2021,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2022,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Instrumentalist of the Year / Acoustic Blues Act of the Year","category":"Za „A Savage Life\""},{"year":2023,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":2024,"title":"UK Blues Award — Blues Album of the Year","category":"Za „Buried in the Hail\""},{"year":2025,"title":"UK Blues Award — Instrumentalist of the Year"},{"year":null,"title":"UK Blues Hall of Fame"}]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Dom Martin – Belfast Blues Guitarist & Songwriter | SlowBlues', 'Dom Martin – Bluesgitarist og låtskriver fra Belfast | SlowBlues', 'Dom Martin – Bluesgitarrist och låtskrivare från Belfast | SlowBlues', 'Dom Martin – Blues-Gitarrist und Songwriter aus Belfast | SlowBlues', 'Dom Martin – Belfastski gitarzysta i autor piosenek bluesowych | SlowBlues', 'Dom Martin is a Belfast blues guitarist and singer-songwriter, UK Blues Hall of Fame inductee. Biography, discography and booking on SlowBlues.', 'Dom Martin er en bluesgitarist og låtskriver fra Belfast, innlemmet i UK Blues Hall of Fame. Biografi, diskografi og booking hos SlowBlues.', 'Dom Martin är en bluesgitarrist och låtskrivare från Belfast, invald i UK Blues Hall of Fame. Biografi, diskografi och bokning hos SlowBlues.', 'Dom Martin ist ein Blues-Gitarrist und Songwriter aus Belfast, Mitglied der UK Blues Hall of Fame. Biografie, Diskografie und Booking bei SlowBlues.', 'Dom Martin to belfastski gitarzysta i autor piosenek bluesowych, członek UK Blues Hall of Fame. Biografia i booking na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/MusicDomMartin/"}', '[]', '[{"title":"guitarworld.com — Meet Dom Martin","url":"https://www.guitarworld.com/features/dom-martin-a-savage-life"},{"title":"bluesblastmagazine.com — Buried in the Hail Album Review","url":"https://www.bluesblastmagazine.com/dom-martin-buried-in-the-hail-album-review/"},{"title":"theevenhand.com — Dom Martin: His life story fuels his songs","url":"https://theevenhand.com/dom-martin-his-life-story-fuels-his-songs/"}]', 'https://www.dommart.in', 'https://www.facebook.com/MusicDomMartin/', '{"booking_agency":"Big D Bookings","agent_name":null,"booking_email":"decocknico@bigdbookings.com","booking_phone":"+32 477 44 27 03","booking_url":"https://www.bigdbookings.com/dommartin","source_url":"https://www.bigdbookings.com/dommartin","note":"Booking handled internationally via Big D Bookings (Belgium)."}', '[]');

