tle":"Edison Award","category":"Bästa rockakt"}],"de":[{"year":2019,"title":"Edison Award","category":"Beste Rockband"}],"pl":[{"year":2019,"title":"Edison Award","category":"Najlepszy zespół rockowy"}]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'DeWolff – Dutch Psychedelic Blues Rock Trio | SlowBlues', 'DeWolff – Nederlandsk psykedelisk bluesrock-trio | SlowBlues', 'DeWolff – Nederländsk psykedelisk bluesrocktrio | SlowBlues', 'DeWolff – Niederländisches psychedelisches Bluesrock-Trio | SlowBlues', 'DeWolff – Holenderskie psychodeliczne trio bluesrockowe | SlowBlues', 'DeWolff play heavy, organ-driven psychedelic blues rock from Limburg, Netherlands. Biography, discography, awards and more on SlowBlues.', 'DeWolff spiller tung, orgeldrevet psykedelisk bluesrock fra Limburg i Nederland. Biografi, diskografi, priser og mer hos SlowBlues.', 'DeWolff spelar tung, orgelledd psykedelisk bluesrock från Limburg i Nederländerna. Biografi, diskografi, priser och mer hos SlowBlues.', 'DeWolff spielt schweren, orgelgetriebenen psychedelischen Bluesrock aus Limburg, Niederlande. Biografie, Diskografie, Auszeichnungen und mehr bei SlowBlues.', 'DeWolff gra ciężki, oparty na organach psychodeliczny bluesrock z Limburgii w Holandii. Biografia, dyskografia, nagrody i więcej na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/dewolfficial"}', '[{"label":"Discogs","url":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/1391845"},{"label":"AllMusic","url":"https://www.allmusic.com/artist/mn0002482492"},{"label":"Bandcamp","url":"https://dewolff.bandcamp.com/"}]', '[{"title":"nl.wikipedia.org — DeWolff","url":"https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/DeWolff"},{"title":"MusicBrainz — DeWolff","url":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/99b74d28-9a6f-4b9c-b60d-55a39caf186e"},{"title":"Setlist.fm — DeWolff concert history","url":"https://www.setlist.fm/setlists/dewolff-3bd42428.html"}]', 'https://www.dewolff.nu/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"https://www.dewolff.nu/","source_url":"https://www.dewolff.nu/","note":"No direct public booking contact confirmed. Contact via the official website."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('f1a2b3c4-2222-4a6e-9c8b-2d1e5f7a9b3c', 'julian-sas', 'Julian Sas', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Western Europe', 'Netherlands', '/artists', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/13-03-30_Paaspop_Julian_Sas_01.jpg', NULL, 'Foto: Achim Raschka (Paaspop 2013, Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 4.0)', '[]', '["G60wwZwbs0o","As6Ei1olg30","rYrD9_jepRc","evjqoxM3zBw","eb1ge6VANi0","ZDZZNTdERx0","NBRcObrtsvA"]', 'A Dutch blues-rock guitarist and bandleader active since the mid-1990s, deeply rooted in the Rory Gallagher tradition.', 'En nederlandsk bluesrock-gitarist og bandleder som har vært aktiv siden midten av 1990-tallet, dypt forankret i Rory Gallagher-tradisjonen.', 'En nederländsk bluesrock-gitarrist och bandledare som varit aktiv sedan mitten av 1990-talet, djupt rotad i Rory Gallagher-traditionen.', 'Ein niederländischer Bluesrock-Gitarrist und Bandleader, aktiv seit Mitte der 1990er-Jahre, tief verwurzelt in der Rory-Gallagher-Tradition.', 'Holenderski gitarzysta bluesrockowy i lider zespołu, aktywny od połowy lat 90., głęboko zakorzeniony w tradycji Rory''ego Gallaghera.', 'Julian Sas was born on 29 May 1970 in Beneden-Leeuwen, in the municipality of West Maas en Waal, and has become one of the Netherlands'' most consistent blues-rock guitarists and bandleaders (Source: nl.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). He founded the Julian Sas Band in 1996 and has released a steady stream of studio albums ever since, including "Where Will It End?" (1996), "A Smile to My Soul" (1997), "Twilight Skies of Life" (2005, which charted at number 90), "Wandering Between Worlds" (2009), "Bound to Roll" (2012), "Coming Home" (2016), "Stand Your Ground" (2019) and the acoustic-leaning "Electracoustic" (2022). His playing draws on American guitar heroes Johnny Winter, Walter Trout and Jimi Hendrix, and on blues pioneers John Lee Hooker, Freddie King and Willie Dixon, but his most defining influence is the Irish blues-rocker Rory Gallagher -- a connection so close that Sas has performed dedicated "Julian Plays Rory" concerts alongside Gallagher''s own former rhythm section, bassist Gerry McAvoy and drummer Brendan O''Neill (Source: nl.wikipedia.org). The current Julian Sas Band lineup includes Gerben Koolen on bass, who joined in December 2025, and Lars-Erik van Elzakker on drums (Source: juliansas.com; nl.wikipedia.org). Sas remains an active touring musician on the European blues circuit.', 'Julian Sas ble født 29. mai 1970 i Beneden-Leeuwen, i kommunen West Maas en Waal, og har blitt en av Nederlands mest konsekvente bluesrock-gitarister og bandledere (Kilde: nl.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). Han grunnla Julian Sas Band i 1996 og har siden gitt ut en jevn strøm av studioalbum, blant annet «Where Will It End?» (1996), «A Smile to My Soul» (1997), «Twilight Skies of Life» (2005, som klatret til 90. plass på listene), «Wandering Between Worlds» (2009), «Bound to Roll» (2012), «Coming Home» (2016), «Stand Your Ground» (2019) og det mer akustiske «Electracoustic» (2022). Spillestilen hans henter fra amerikanske gitarhelter som Johnny Winter, Walter Trout og Jimi Hendrix, og fra bluespionerer som John Lee Hooker, Freddie King og Willie Dixon, men den mest definerende innflytelsen er den irske bluesrockeren Rory Gallagher -- en forbindelse så tett at Sas har holdt egne «Julian Plays Rory»-konserter sammen med Gallaghers egen tidligere rytmeseksjon, bassist Gerry McAvoy og trommeslager Brendan O''Neill (Kilde: nl.wikipedia.org). Dagens Julian Sas Band-besetning består av Gerben Koolen på bass, som ble med i desember 2025, og Lars-Erik van Elzakker på trommer (Kilde: juliansas.com; nl.wikipedia.org). Sas er fortsatt en aktiv turnerende musiker på den europeiske bluesscenen.', 'Julian Sas föddes den 29 maj 1970 i Beneden-Leeuwen, i kommunen West Maas en Waal, och har blivit en av Nederländernas mest konsekventa bluesrock-gitarrister och bandledare (Källa: nl.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). Han grundade Julian Sas Band 1996 och har sedan dess släppt en jämn ström av studioalbum, bland annat "Where Will It End?" (1996), "A Smile to My Soul" (1997), "Twilight Skies of Life" (2005, som nådde plats 90 på listorna), "Wandering Between Worlds" (2009), "Bound to Roll" (2012), "Coming Home" (2016), "Stand Your Ground" (2019) och det mer akustiska "Electracoustic" (2022). Hans spelstil hämtar från amerikanska gitarrhjältar som Johnny Winter, Walter Trout och Jimi Hendrix, och från bluespionjärer som John Lee Hooker, Freddie King och Willie Dixon, men det mest avgörande inflytandet är den irländske bluesrockaren Rory Gallagher -- en koppling så nära att Sas har hållit egna "Julian Plays Rory"-konserter tillsammans med Gallaghers egen tidigare rytmsektion, basisten Gerry McAvoy och trummisen Brendan O''Neill (Källa: nl.wikipedia.org). Dagens Julian Sas Band-sättning består av Gerben Koolen på bas, som anslöt i december 2025, och Lars-Erik van Elzakker på trummor (Källa: juliansas.com; nl.wikipedia.org). Sas är fortsatt en aktiv turnerande musiker på den europeiska bluesscenen.', 'Julian Sas wurde am 29. Mai 1970 in Beneden-Leeuwen, in der Gemeinde West Maas en Waal, geboren und hat sich zu einem der beständigsten Bluesrock-Gitarristen und Bandleader der Niederlande entwickelt (Quelle: nl.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). Er gründete 1996 die Julian Sas Band und veröffentlicht seitdem kontinuierlich Studioalben, darunter „Where Will It End?" (1996), „A Smile to My Soul" (1997), „Twilight Skies of Life" (2005, das Platz 90 der Charts erreichte), „Wandering Between Worlds" (2009), „Bound to Roll" (2012), „Coming Home" (2016), „Stand Your Ground" (2019) und das eher akustische „Electracoustic" (2022). Sein Spiel schöpft aus amerikanischen Gitarrenhelden wie Johnny Winter, Walter Trout und Jimi Hendrix sowie aus Blues-Pionieren wie John Lee Hooker, Freddie King und Willie Dixon, doch der prägendste Einfluss ist der irische Bluesrocker Rory Gallagher -- eine Verbindung, die so eng ist, dass Sas eigene „Julian Plays Rory"-Konzerte gemeinsam mit Gallaghers ehemaliger Rhythmusgruppe gespielt hat, Bassist Gerry McAvoy und Schlagzeuger Brendan O''Neill (Quelle: nl.wikipedia.org). Die aktuelle Besetzung der Julian Sas Band besteht aus Gerben Koolen am Bass, der im Dezember 2025 dazustieß, und Lars-Erik van Elzakker am Schlagzeug (Quelle: juliansas.com; nl.wikipedia.org). Sas ist weiterhin als Live-Musiker auf der europäischen Bluesszene aktiv.', 'Julian Sas urodził się 29 maja 1970 roku w Beneden-Leeuwen, w gminie West Maas en Waal, i stał się jednym z najbardziej konsekwentnych holenderskich gitarzystów bluesrockowych i liderów zespołów (Źródło: nl.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). W 1996 roku założył Julian Sas Band i od tego czasu regularnie wydaje albumy studyjne, w tym „Where Will It End?" (1996), „A Smile to My Soul" (1997), „Twilight Skies of Life" (2005, który uplasował się na 90. miejscu list przebojów), „Wandering Between Worlds" (2009), „Bound to Roll" (2012), „Coming Home" (2016), „Stand Your Ground" (2019) oraz bardziej akustyczny „Electracoustic" (2022). Jego gra czerpie z amerykańskich bohaterów gitary, takich jak Johnny Winter, Walter Trout i Jimi Hendrix, oraz pionierów bluesa, takich jak John Lee Hooker, Freddie King i Willie Dixon, ale najważniejszym wpływem jest irlandzki bluesrockowiec Rory Gallagher -- związek na tyle bliski, że Sas grał dedykowane koncerty „Julian Plays Rory" wraz z byłą sekcją rytmiczną Gallaghera, basistą Gerrym McAvoyem i perkusistą Brendanem O''Neillem (Źródło: nl.wikipedia.org). Obecny skład Julian Sas Band to Gerben Koolen na basie, który dołączył w grudniu 2025 roku, oraz Lars-Erik van Elzakker na perkusji (Źródło: juliansas.com; nl.wikipedia.org). Sas pozostaje aktywnym muzykiem koncertowym na europejskiej scenie bluesowej.', '1970-05-29', NULL, NULL, 'Beneden-Leeuwen, West Maas en Waal, Nederland', 'Beneden-Leeuwen, Nederland', '1996–nu', 'Julian Sas has kept the Rory Gallagher-style blues-rock guitar tradition alive in continental Europe for three decades, both through his own band''s steady output and through direct collaboration with Gallagher''s former rhythm section in dedicated tribute concerts (Source: nl.wikipedia.org).', 'Julian Sas har holdt Rory Gallagher-inspirert bluesrock-gitartradisjon i live på det europeiske kontinentet i tre tiår, både gjennom sitt eget bands jevne produksjon og gjennom direkte samarbeid med Gallaghers tidligere rytmeseksjon i egne hyllestkonserter (Kilde: nl.wikipedia.org).', 'Julian Sas har hållit den Rory Gallagher-inspirerade bluesrock-gitarrtraditionen vid liv på den europeiska kontinenten i tre decennier, både genom sitt eget bands jämna produktion och genom direkt samarbete med Gallaghers tidigare rytmsektion i egna hyllningskonserter (Källa: nl.wikipedia.org).', 'Julian Sas hat die von Rory Gallagher geprägte Bluesrock-Gitarrentradition drei Jahrzehnte lang auf dem europäischen Kontinent am Leben erhalten, sowohl durch die beständige Arbeit seiner eigenen Band als auch durch direkte Zusammenarbeit mit Gallaghers ehemaliger Rhythmusgruppe bei eigenen Tribute-Konzerten (Quelle: nl.wikipedia.org).', 'Julian Sas przez trzy dekady podtrzymywał na kontynencie europejskim tradycję gitary bluesrockowej w stylu Rory''ego Gallaghera, zarówno poprzez regularną twórczość własnego zespołu, jak i bezpośrednią współpracę z byłą sekcją rytmiczną Gallaghera podczas dedykowanych koncertów tribute (Źródło: nl.wikipedia.org).', '[]', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[]', '["Vocals","Guitar"]', '["Blues Rock","Electric Blues","Contemporary Blues"]', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":["1996: Julian Sas Band grunnlagt; debutalbumet «Where Will It End?» utgitt (Kilde: MusicBrainz).","2005: «Twilight Skies of Life» klatret til 90. plass på listene.","Desember 2025: Gerben Koolen ble med som ny bassist (Kilde: juliansas.com)."],"en":["1996: Julian Sas Band founded; debut album \"Where Will It End?\" released (Source: MusicBrainz).","2005: \"Twilight Skies of Life\" charted at #90.","December 2025: Gerben Koolen joined as new bassist (Source: juliansas.com)."],"sv":["1996: Julian Sas Band grundades; debutalbumet \"Where Will It End?\" släpptes (Källa: MusicBrainz).","2005: \"Twilight Skies of Life\" nådde plats 90 på listorna.","December 2025: Gerben Koolen anslöt som ny basist (Källa: juliansas.com)."],"de":["1996: Gründung der Julian Sas Band; Debütalbum „Where Will It End?\" erscheint (Quelle: MusicBrainz).","2005: „Twilight Skies of Life\" erreicht Platz 90 der Charts.","Dezember 2025: Gerben Koolen stößt als neuer Bassist dazu (Quelle: juliansas.com)."],"pl":["1996: Założenie Julian Sas Band; wydanie debiutanckiego albumu \"Where Will It End?\" (Źródło: MusicBrainz).","2005: \"Twilight Skies of Life\" na 90. miejscu list przebojów.","Grudzień 2025: Gerben Koolen dołącza jako nowy basista (Źródło: juliansas.com)."]}', '{"no":[{"category":"Gitar","name":"Sologitar (Julian Sas)","note":"Sterkt forankret i Rory Gallagher-tradisjonen.","years":null}],"en":[{"category":"Gitar","name":"Lead guitar (Julian Sas)","note":"Deeply rooted in the Rory Gallagher tradition.","years":null}],"sv":[{"category":"Gitar","name":"Sologitarr (Julian Sas)","note":"Djupt rotad i Rory Gallagher-traditionen.","years":null}],"de":[{"category":"Gitar","name":"Leadgitarre (Julian Sas)","note":"Tief verwurzelt in der Rory-Gallagher-Tradition.","years":null}],"pl":[{"category":"Gitar","name":"Gitara prowadząca (Julian Sas)","note":"Głęboko zakorzeniona w tradycji Rory''ego Gallaghera.","years":null}]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[{"name":"Gerry McAvoy","note":"Rory Gallaghers tidligere bassist; spilte i «Julian Plays Rory»-hyllestkonserter.","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"},{"name":"Brendan O''Neill","note":"Rory Gallaghers tidligere trommeslager; spilte i «Julian Plays Rory»-hyllestkonserter.","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"}],"en":[{"name":"Gerry McAvoy","note":"Rory Gallagher''s former bassist; performed in the \"Julian Plays Rory\" tribute concerts.","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"},{"name":"Brendan O''Neill","note":"Rory Gallagher''s former drummer; performed in the \"Julian Plays Rory\" tribute concerts.","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"}],"sv":[{"name":"Gerry McAvoy","note":"Rory Gallaghers tidigare basist; spelade i \"Julian Plays Rory\"-hyllningskonserterna.","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"},{"name":"Brendan O''Neill","note":"Rory Gallaghers tidigare trummis; spelade i \"Julian Plays Rory\"-hyllningskonserterna.","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"}],"de":[{"name":"Gerry McAvoy","note":"Rory Gallaghers ehemaliger Bassist; spielte bei den „Julian Plays Rory\"-Tribute-Konzerten.","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"},{"name":"Brendan O''Neill","note":"Rory Gallaghers ehemaliger Schlagzeuger; spielte bei den „Julian Plays Rory\"-Tribute-Konzerten.","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"}],"pl":[{"name":"Gerry McAvoy","note":"Były basista Rory''ego Gallaghera; występował na koncertach tribute \"Julian Plays Rory\".","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"},{"name":"Brendan O''Neill","note":"Były perkusista Rory''ego Gallaghera; występował na koncertach tribute \"Julian Plays Rory\".","source":"nl.wikipedia.org"}]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"Walter Trout and Julian Sas Jamsession part 1 - Rocknacht - Groesbeek 5-12-1997","youtube_id":"G60wwZwbs0o","channel":"Blues Moose"},{"kind":"featured","title":"Julian Sas - Hey Joe (HQ)","youtube_id":"As6Ei1olg30","channel":"Guido van Hout-Winkel (G.Speelt)"},{"kind":"more","title":"Walter Trout and Julian Sas Jamsession part 2 - Rocknacht - Groesbeek 5-12-1997","youtube_id":"rYrD9_jepRc","channel":"Blues Moose"},{"kind":"more","title":"Walter Trout and Julian Sas Jamsession part 3 - Rocknacht - Groesbeek 5-12-1997","youtube_id":"evjqoxM3zBw","channel":"Blues Moose"},{"kind":"more","title":"Walter Trout and Julian Sas Jamsession part 4 - Rocknacht - Groesbeek 5-12-1997","youtube_id":"eb1ge6VANi0","channel":"Blues Moose"},{"kind":"more","title":"Walter Trout and Julian Sas Jamsession part 5 - Rocknacht - Groesbeek 5-12-1997","youtube_id":"ZDZZNTdERx0","channel":"Blues Moose"},{"kind":"more","title":"Walter Trout and Julian Sas Jamsession part 6 - Rocknacht - Groesbeek 5-12-1997","youtube_id":"NBRcObrtsvA","channel":"Blues Moose"}]', '{"no":[{"year":1996,"title":"Where Will It End?"},{"year":1997,"title":"A Smile to My Soul"},{"year":2005,"title":"Twilight Skies of Life","notes":"Klatret til 90. plass på listene (Kilde: MusicBrainz)."},{"year":2009,"title":"Wandering Between Worlds"},{"year":2012,"title":"Bound to Roll"},{"year":2016,"title":"Coming Home"},{"year":2019,"title":"Stand Your Ground"},{"year":2022,"title":"Electracoustic","notes":"Akustisk-preget album (Kilde: MusicBrainz)."}],"en":[{"year":1996,"title":"Where Will It End?"},{"year":1997,"title":"A Smile to My Soul"},{"year":2005,"title":"Twilight Skies of Life","notes":"Charted at #90 (Source: MusicBrainz)."},{"year":2009,"title":"Wandering Between Worlds"},{"year":2012,"title":"Bound to Roll"},{"year":2016,"title":"Coming Home"},{"year":2019,"title":"Stand Your Ground"},{"year":2022,"title":"Electracoustic","notes":"An acoustic-leaning album (Source: MusicBrainz)."}],"sv":[{"year":1996,"title":"Where Will It End?"},{"year":1997,"title":"A Smile to My Soul"},{"year":2005,"title":"Twilight Skies of Life","notes":"Nådde plats 90 på listorna (Källa: MusicBrainz)."},{"year":2009,"title":"Wandering Between Worlds"},{"year":2012,"title":"Bound to Roll"},{"year":2016,"title":"Coming Home"},{"year":2019,"title":"Stand Your Ground"},{"year":2022,"title":"Electracoustic","notes":"Ett mer akustiskt album (Källa: MusicBrainz)."}],"de":[{"year":1996,"title":"Where Will It End?"},{"year":1997,"title":"A Smile to My Soul"},{"year":2005,"title":"Twilight Skies of Life","notes":"Erreichte Platz 90 der Charts (Quelle: MusicBrainz)."},{"year":2009,"title":"Wandering Between Worlds"},{"year":2012,"title":"Bound to Roll"},{"year":2016,"title":"Coming Home"},{"year":2019,"title":"Stand Your Ground"},{"year":2022,"title":"Electracoustic","notes":"Ein eher akustisches Album (Quelle: MusicBrainz)."}],"pl":[{"year":1996,"title":"Where Will It End?"},{"year":1997,"title":"A Smile to My Soul"},{"year":2005,"title":"Twilight Skies of Life","notes":"Uplasował się na 90. miejscu list przebojów (Źródło: MusicBrainz)."},{"year":2009,"title":"Wandering Between Worlds"},{"year":2012,"title":"Bound to Roll"},{"year":2016,"title":"Coming Home"},{"year":2019,"title":"Stand Your Ground"},{"year":2022,"title":"Electracoustic","notes":"Album o bardziej akustycznym charakterze (Źródło: MusicBrainz)."}]}', '[]', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', 'Julian Sas – Dutch Blues-Rock Guitarist | SlowBlues', 'Julian Sas – Nederlandsk bluesrock-gitarist | SlowBlues', 'Julian Sas – Nederländsk bluesrock-gitarrist | SlowBlues', 'Julian Sas – Niederländischer Bluesrock-Gitarrist | SlowBlues', 'Julian Sas – Holenderski gitarzysta bluesrockowy | SlowBlues', 'Julian Sas is a Dutch blues-rock guitarist and bandleader in the Rory Gallagher tradition. Biography, discography and more on SlowBlues.', 'Julian Sas er en nederlandsk bluesrock-gitarist og bandleder i Rory Gallagher-tradisjonen. Biografi, diskografi og mer hos SlowBlues.', 'Julian Sas är en nederländsk bluesrock-gitarrist och bandledare i Rory Gallagher-traditionen. Biografi, diskografi och mer hos SlowBlues.', 'Julian Sas ist ein niederländischer Bluesrock-Gitarrist und Bandleader in der Rory-Gallagher-Tradition. Biografie, Diskografie und mehr bei SlowBlues.', 'Julian Sas to holenderski gitarzysta bluesrockowy i lider zespołu w tradycji Rory''ego Gallaghera. Biografia, dyskografia i więcej na SlowBlues.', '{}', '[{"label":"Discogs","url":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/638117"},{"label":"AllMusic","url":"https://www.allmusic.com/artist/mn0000910671"}]', '[{"title":"nl.wikipedia.org — Julian Sas","url":"https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julian_Sas"},{"title":"MusicBrainz — Julian Sas","url":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/f89778d6-fedb-4a41-864a-79ab5c21e76c"}]', 'http://www.juliansas.com/', NULL, '{"booking_agency":null,"agent_name":null,"booking_email":null,"booking_phone":null,"booking_url":"http://www.juliansas.com/","source_url":"http://www.juliansas.com/","note":"No direct public booking contact confirmed. Contact via the official website."}', '[]');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES ('f1a2b3c4-3333-4a6e-9c8b-2d1e5f7a9b3c', 'my-baby', 'MY BABY', NULL, 'Modern', 'Modern Era', 'Western Europe', 'Netherlands', '/artists', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/ZC16_My_Baby.jpg', NULL, 'Photo: Ciell (Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 4.0)', '[]', '["CRuKXOoW-H8","bTKHJJMtSyE","EqawXp6Upkk"]', 'A Dutch-New Zealand trio from Amsterdam fusing delta blues trance with funk, soul and psychedelic energy.', 'Et nederlandsk-new zealandsk trio fra Amsterdam som fusjonerer delta-blues-trance med funk, soul og psykedelisk energi.', 'En nederländsk-nyzeeländsk trio från Amsterdam som fusionerar deltablues-trance med funk, soul och psykedelisk energi.', 'Ein niederländisch-neuseeländisches Trio aus Amsterdam, das Delta-Blues-Trance mit Funk, Soul und psychedelischer Energie verschmilzt.', 'Holendersko-nowozelandzkie trio z Amsterdamu, łączące transowego delta blues z funkiem, soulem i psychodeliczną energią.', 'MY BABY is a Dutch-New Zealand band formed in Amsterdam in 2012 by former members of the Amsterdam soul band The Souldiers (Source: en.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). Early connections through the PR manager of bass legend Larry Graham helped land the band shows at Paradiso Amsterdam and the North Sea Jazz Club that same year. The trio''s sound fuses blues, country and funk with a hypnotic, trance-like intensity that MusicBrainz tags simply as "delta trance" alongside more conventional blues and soul labels. The current lineup is Cato van Dijck on lead vocals, bass and violin, her brother Joost van Dijck on drums, and Daniel "Dafreez" Johnston on guitars (Source: en.wikipedia.org). MY BABY''s debut album "My Baby Loves Voodoo!" (2013) earned an Edison Award nomination in the audience category, and the band won the Edison Award outright in the Alternative category for "Shamanaid" (2015, also released with a companion "Remedy II" EP). Later albums include "Prehistoric Rhythm" (2017), "Mounaiki ~ By the Bright of Night" (2018), the live album "Live!" (2019), "Sake sake sake" (2022) and "Echo" (2025). The band has also picked up two nominations for Best Live Act at the NPO Radio 6 Soul & Jazz Awards. MY BABY has played major festivals including Lowlands, Down The Rabbit Hole, Paaspop, Zwarte Cross, Noorderslag, Freak Valley and Glastonbury (2016), toured Eastern Europe, South Africa and New Zealand, and supported American blues artist Seasick Steve on his 2015 UK tour.', 'MY BABY er et nederlandsk-new zealandsk band dannet i Amsterdam i 2012 av tidligere medlemmer av soulbandet The Souldiers fra Amsterdam (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). Tidlige forbindelser gjennom PR-ansvarlig for bass-legenden Larry Graham bidro til å skaffe bandet spillejobber på Paradiso Amsterdam og North Sea Jazz Club samme år. Trioens lyd smelter sammen blues, country og funk med en hypnotisk, transeaktig intensitet som MusicBrainz rett og slett tagger som «delta trance» ved siden av mer konvensjonelle blues- og soul-merkelapper. Dagens besetning er Cato van Dijck på lead vokal, bass og fiolin, broren Joost van Dijck på trommer, og Daniel «Dafreez» Johnston på gitarer (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org). MY BABYs debutalbum «My Baby Loves Voodoo!» (2013) fikk en Edison Award-nominasjon i publikumskategorien, og bandet vant selve Edison Award i kategorien Alternative for «Shamanaid» (2015, også utgitt med en tilhørende «Remedy II»-EP). Senere album inkluderer «Prehistoric Rhythm» (2017), «Mounaiki ~ By the Bright of Night» (2018), liveutgivelsen «Live!» (2019), «Sake sake sake» (2022) og «Echo» (2025). Bandet har også fått to nominasjoner til Beste liveakt ved NPO Radio 6 Soul & Jazz Awards. MY BABY har spilt store festivaler som Lowlands, Down The Rabbit Hole, Paaspop, Zwarte Cross, Noorderslag, Freak Valley og Glastonbury (2016), turnert i Øst-Europa, Sør-Afrika og New Zealand, og vært støtteakt for den amerikanske bluesartisten Seasick Steve på hans UK-turné i 2015.', 'MY BABY är ett nederländsk-nyzeeländskt band bildat i Amsterdam 2012 av tidigare medlemmar i soulbandet The Souldiers från Amsterdam (Källa: en.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). Tidiga kontakter genom PR-ansvarig för basslegendaren Larry Graham hjälpte bandet att få spelningar på Paradiso Amsterdam och North Sea Jazz Club samma år. Triöns sound smälter samman blues, country och funk med en hypnotisk, transliknande intensitet som MusicBrainz helt enkelt taggar som "delta trance" vid sidan av mer konventionella blues- och soul-etiketter. Dagens sättning är Cato van Dijck på ledsång, bas och fiol, hennes bror Joost van Dijck på trummor, och Daniel "Dafreez" Johnston på gitarrer (Källa: en.wikipedia.org). MY BABYs debutalbum "My Baby Loves Voodoo!" (2013) fick en Edison Award-nominering i publikkategorin, och bandet vann själva Edison Award i kategorin Alternative för "Shamanaid" (2015, även utgivet med en tillhörande "Remedy II"-EP). Senare album inkluderar "Prehistoric Rhythm" (2017), "Mounaiki ~ By the Bright of Night" (2018), livealbumet "Live!" (2019), "Sake sake sake" (2022) och "Echo" (2025). Bandet har även fått två nomineringar till Bästa liveakt vid NPO Radio 6 Soul & Jazz Awards. MY BABY har spelat stora festivaler som Lowlands, Down The Rabbit Hole, Paaspop, Zwarte Cross, Noorderslag, Freak Valley och Glastonbury (2016), turnerat i Östeuropa, Sydafrika och Nya Zeeland, och varit förband åt den amerikanska bluesartisten Seasick Steve på hans UK-turné 2015.', 'MY BABY ist eine niederländisch-neuseeländische Band, die 2012 in Amsterdam von ehemaligen Mitgliedern der Amsterdamer Soulband The Souldiers gegründet wurde (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). Frühe Kontakte über den PR-Manager der Basslegende Larry Graham verhalfen der Band im selben Jahr zu Auftritten im Paradiso Amsterdam und im North Sea Jazz Club. Der Sound des Trios verschmilzt Blues, Country und Funk mit einer hypnotischen, tranceartigen Intensität, die MusicBrainz schlicht als „Delta Trance" neben konventionelleren Blues- und Soul-Labels taggt. Die aktuelle Besetzung ist Cato van Dijck am Leadgesang, Bass und Violine, ihr Bruder Joost van Dijck am Schlagzeug und Daniel „Dafreez" Johnston an den Gitarren (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org). MY BABYs Debütalbum „My Baby Loves Voodoo!" (2013) erhielt eine Edison-Award-Nominierung in der Publikumskategorie, und die Band gewann den Edison Award selbst in der Kategorie Alternative für „Shamanaid" (2015, auch mit einer begleitenden „Remedy II"-EP veröffentlicht). Spätere Alben umfassen „Prehistoric Rhythm" (2017), „Mounaiki ~ By the Bright of Night" (2018), das Livealbum „Live!" (2019), „Sake sake sake" (2022) und „Echo" (2025). Die Band erhielt zudem zwei Nominierungen als beste Live-Act bei den NPO Radio 6 Soul & Jazz Awards. MY BABY spielte auf großen Festivals wie Lowlands, Down The Rabbit Hole, Paaspop, Zwarte Cross, Noorderslag, Freak Valley und Glastonbury (2016), tourte durch Osteuropa, Südafrika und Neuseeland und war 2015 Vorband des amerikanischen Bluesmusikers Seasick Steve auf dessen UK-Tour.', 'MY BABY to holendersko-nowozelandzki zespół założony w Amsterdamie w 2012 roku przez byłych członków amsterdamskiego zespołu soulowego The Souldiers (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org; MusicBrainz). Wczesne kontakty za pośrednictwem menedżera PR legendy basu Larry''ego Grahama pomogły zespołowi zdobyć koncerty w Paradiso Amsterdam i North Sea Jazz Club w tym samym roku. Brzmienie tria łączy blues, country i funk z hipnotyczną, transową intensywnością, którą MusicBrainz oznacza po prostu jako „delta trance" obok bardziej konwencjonalnych etykiet blues i soul. Obecny skład to Cato van Dijck na wokalu prowadzącym, basie i skrzypcach, jej brat Joost van Dijck na perkusji oraz Daniel „Dafreez" Johnston na gitarach (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org). Debiutancki album MY BABY „My Baby Loves Voodoo!" (2013) otrzymał nominację do Edison Award w kategorii publiczności, a zespół zdobył samą nagrodę Edison Award w kategorii Alternative za „Shamanaid" (2015, wydany również z towarzyszącym EP „Remedy II"). Późniejsze albumy to „Prehistoric Rhythm" (2017), „Mounaiki ~ By the Bright of Night" (2018), album koncertowy „Live!" (2019), „Sake sake sake" (2022) i „Echo" (2025). Zespół otrzymał również dwie nominacje do nagrody za najlepszy występ na żywo podczas NPO Radio 6 Soul & Jazz Awards. MY BABY grało na dużych festiwalach, takich jak Lowlands, Down The Rabbit Hole, Paaspop, Zwarte Cross, Noorderslag, Freak Valley i Glastonbury (2016), koncertowało w Europie Wschodniej, RPA i Nowej Zelandii, a w 2015 roku było supportem amerykańskiego artysty bluesowego Seasick Steve''a podczas jego trasy po Wielkiej Brytanii.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Amsterdam, Nederland', '2012–nu', 'MY BABY has carried a distinctly hypnotic, trance-inflected strand of delta blues onto major European festival stages, earning a Dutch Edison Award and international touring credibility alongside acts like Seasick Steve (Source: en.wikipedia.org).', 'MY BABY har brakt en klart hypnotisk, transepreget gren av delta-blues til store europeiske festivalscener, og har vunnet en nederlandsk Edison Award og internasjonal turnétroverdighet ved siden av akter som Seasick Steve (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).', 'MY BABY har fört en tydligt hypnotisk, transepräglad gren av deltablues till stora europeiska festivalscener, och har vunnit en nederländsk Edison Award och internationell turnétrovärdighet vid sidan av akter som Seasick Steve (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).', 'MY BABY hat einen deutlich hypnotischen, tranceartigen Zweig des Delta-Blues auf große europäische Festivalbühnen gebracht und dabei einen niederländischen Edison Award sowie internationale Tourneeglaubwürdigkeit neben Acts wie Seasick Steve gewonnen (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).', 'MY BABY wprowadziło wyraźnie hipnotyczną, transową odmianę delta bluesa na duże europejskie sceny festiwalowe, zdobywając holenderską nagrodę Edison Award i międzynarodową wiarygodność koncertową u boku takich artystów jak Seasick Steve (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).', '[]', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '[]', '["Vocals","Bass","Violin","Drums","Guitar"]', '["Delta Blues","Blues Rock","Contemporary Blues"]', '{"no":[{"relation":"Søsken","name":"Joost van Dijck","note":"Cato van Dijcks bror, trommeslager i bandet.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}],"en":[{"relation":"Sibling","name":"Joost van Dijck","note":"Cato van Dijck''s brother, the band''s drummer.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}],"sv":[{"relation":"Syskon","name":"Joost van Dijck","note":"Cato van Dijcks bror, bandets trumslagare.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}],"de":[{"relation":"Geschwister","name":"Joost van Dijck","note":"Cato van Dijcks Bruder, der Schlagzeuger der Band.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}],"pl":[{"relation":"Rodzeństwo","name":"Joost van Dijck","note":"Brat Cato van Dijck, perkusista zespołu.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}]}', '{"no":["2012: Bandet dannet i Amsterdam av tidligere medlemmer av The Souldiers; spilte Paradiso og North Sea Jazz Club (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org).","2013: Debutalbumet «My Baby Loves Voodoo!» fikk Edison Award-nominasjon.","2015: Vant Edison Award (Alternative) for «Shamanaid»; støtteakt for Seasick Steve i UK.","2016: Spilte Glastonbury Festival."],"en":["2012: Band formed in Amsterdam by former members of The Souldiers; played Paradiso and North Sea Jazz Club (Source: en.wikipedia.org).","2013: Debut album \"My Baby Loves Voodoo!\" earned an Edison Award nomination.","2015: Won the Edison Award (Alternative) for \"Shamanaid\"; supported Seasick Steve in the UK.","2016: Played Glastonbury Festival."],"sv":["2012: Bandet bildades i Amsterdam av tidigare medlemmar i The Souldiers; spelade Paradiso och North Sea Jazz Club (Källa: en.wikipedia.org).","2013: Debutalbumet \"My Baby Loves Voodoo!\" fick en Edison Award-nominering.","2015: Vann Edison Award (Alternative) för \"Shamanaid\"; förband åt Seasick Steve i Storbritannien.","2016: Spelade på Glastonbury Festival."],"de":["2012: Bandgründung in Amsterdam durch ehemalige Mitglieder von The Souldiers; Auftritte im Paradiso und North Sea Jazz Club (Quelle: en.wikipedia.org).","2013: Debütalbum „Shamanaid\" erhält Edison-Award-Nominierung.","2015: Gewinn des Edison Award (Alternative) für „Shamanaid\"; Vorband für Seasick Steve in Großbritannien.","2016: Auftritt beim Glastonbury Festival."],"pl":["2012: Powstanie zespołu w Amsterdamie przez byłych członków The Souldiers; koncerty w Paradiso i North Sea Jazz Club (Źródło: en.wikipedia.org).","2013: Debiutancki album \"My Baby Loves Voodoo!\" otrzymuje nominację do Edison Award.","2015: Zdobycie Edison Award (Alternative) za \"Shamanaid\"; support dla Seasick Steve''a w Wielkiej Brytanii.","2016: Występ na festiwalu Glastonbury."]}', '{"no":[{"category":"Vokal","name":"Vokal, bass og fiolin (Cato van Dijck)","note":"Bandets frontfigur.","years":null},{"category":"Gitar","name":"Gitar (Daniel «Dafreez» Johnston)","note":null,"years":null}],"en":[{"category":"Gitar","name":"Vocals, bass and violin (Cato van Dijck)","note":"The band''s frontwoman.","years":null},{"category":"Gitar","name":"Guitar (Daniel \"Dafreez\" Johnston)","note":null,"years":null}],"sv":[{"category":"Gitar","name":"Sång, bas och fiol (Cato van Dijck)","note":"Bandets frontfigur.","years":null},{"category":"Gitar","name":"Gitarr (Daniel \"Dafreez\" Johnston)","note":null,"years":null}],"de":[{"category":"Gitar","name":"Gesang, Bass und Violine (Cato van Dijck)","note":"Die Frontfrau der Band.","years":null},{"category":"Gitar","name":"Gitarre (Daniel „Dafreez\" Johnston)","note":null,"years":null}],"pl":[{"category":"Gitar","name":"Wokal, bas i skrzypce (Cato van Dijck)","note":"Liderka zespołu.","years":null},{"category":"Gitar","name":"Gitara (Daniel „Dafreez\" Johnston)","note":null,"years":null}]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":[{"name":"Seasick Steve","note":"MY BABY var støtteakt for den amerikanske bluesartisten på hans UK-turné i 2015.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}],"en":[{"name":"Seasick Steve","note":"MY BABY supported the American blues artist on his 2015 UK tour.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}],"sv":[{"name":"Seasick Steve","note":"MY BABY var förband åt den amerikanska bluesartisten på hans UK-turné 2015.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}],"de":[{"name":"Seasick Steve","note":"MY BABY war 2015 Vorband des amerikanischen Bluesmusikers auf dessen UK-Tour.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}],"pl":[{"name":"Seasick Steve","note":"MY BABY był supportem amerykańskiego artysty bluesowego podczas jego trasy po Wielkiej Brytanii w 2015 roku.","source":"en.wikipedia.org"}]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"MY BABY - Vestrock 2023","youtube_id":"CRuKXOoW-H8","channel":"MY BABY (official)"},{"kind":"more","title":"MOUNAIKI - LIVE!","youtube_id":"bTKHJJMtSyE","channel":"MY BABY (official)"},{"kind":"more","title":"MY BABY: a dream i dream - Live performance video","youtube_id":"EqawXp6Upkk","channel":"MY BABY (official)"}]', '{"no":[{"year":2013,"title":"My Baby Loves Voodoo!","notes":"Debutalbum, Edison Award-nominert i publikumskategorien (Kilde: en.wikipedia.org)."},{"year":2015,"title":"Shamanaid","no