er Presse ab 2015 dokumentiert.","years":null}],"pl":[{"category":"Wokal/Bas","name":"Ruud Weber","note":"Obecny członek (Źródło: kingoftheworld.eu).","years":"2011–obecnie"},{"category":"Gitara","name":"Stef Delbaere","note":"Belgijski gitarzysta, obecny członek, zaliczany przez magazyn Gitarist do czołówki gitarzystów bluesowo-rockowych Beneluksu.","years":null},{"category":"Klawisze/Wokal","name":"Govert van der Kolm","note":"Obecny członek (Źródło: kingoftheworld.eu).","years":"2011–obecnie"},{"category":"Perkusja/Wokal","name":"Marlon Pichel","note":"Obecny członek, kompozytor, coraz bardziej centralna rola wokalna.","years":null},{"category":"Gitara","name":"Erwin Java","note":"Członek założyciel i gitarzysta, prowadził zespół w latach 2011–2018. Wcześniej gitarzysta Cuby & The Blizzards (1986–2011). Wprowadzony do Dutch Blues Hall of Fame w 2026 roku.","years":"2011–2018"},{"category":"Członek","name":"Fokke de Jong","note":"Były członek, udokumentowany w prasie od 2015 roku.","years":null}]}', '{"no":[],"en":[],"sv":[],"de":[],"pl":[]}', '{"no":["Matt Schofield (gjestegitarist, «Live At The Boerderij» / «Get Up, Get Down & Get With It», 2024)","Shirma Rouse (gjestevokalist, 2024)","Christine Tambakis (gjestevokalist, 2024)","Big Pete (gjest, «Live At The Boerderij», 2024)"],"en":["Matt Schofield (guest guitarist, \"Live At The Boerderij\" / \"Get Up, Get Down & Get With It\", 2024)","Shirma Rouse (guest vocalist, 2024)","Christine Tambakis (guest vocalist, 2024)","Big Pete (guest, \"Live At The Boerderij\", 2024)"],"sv":["Matt Schofield (gästgitarrist, \"Live At The Boerderij\" / \"Get Up, Get Down & Get With It\", 2024)","Shirma Rouse (gästsångerska, 2024)","Christine Tambakis (gästsångerska, 2024)","Big Pete (gäst, \"Live At The Boerderij\", 2024)"],"de":["Matt Schofield (Gastgitarrist, „Live At The Boerderij\" / „Get Up, Get Down & Get With It\", 2024)","Shirma Rouse (Gastsängerin, 2024)","Christine Tambakis (Gastsängerin, 2024)","Big Pete (Gast, „Live At The Boerderij\", 2024)"],"pl":["Matt Schofield (gościnny gitarzysta, \"Live At The Boerderij\" / \"Get Up, Get Down & Get With It\", 2024)","Shirma Rouse (gościnna wokalistka, 2024)","Christine Tambakis (gościnna wokalistka, 2024)","Big Pete (gość, \"Live At The Boerderij\", 2024)"]}', '[{"kind":"featured","title":"On my way back home - live at the Boerderij - by King of the World OFFICIAL VIDEO","youtube_id":"EHQngbqTM-Q","channel":"KingoftheWorldBlues"},{"kind":"featured","title":"2022 King of the World - Full Show @ Aan de Slinger Houten","youtube_id":"WZ2xERLj940","channel":"Paul van Druten"},{"kind":"more","title":"Life After You Live @ Metropool by King of the World OFFICIAL VIDEO","youtube_id":"ImzeyRptkCo","channel":"KingoftheWorldBlues"},{"kind":"more","title":"Eyes Of A Child live @ Veronica Soundz Live by King of the World OFFICIAL VIDEO","youtube_id":"KhtRV7VyM8M","channel":"KingoftheWorldBlues"},{"kind":"more","title":"Money Talks live @ Veronica Soundz Live by King of the World OFFICIAL VIDEO","youtube_id":"KnVoT_Z7lH0","channel":"KingoftheWorldBlues"},{"kind":"more","title":"On My Way Back Home Live @ Metropool by King of the World OFFICIAL VIDEO","youtube_id":"frzeB547fq4","channel":"KingoftheWorldBlues"},{"kind":"more","title":"Eyes wide open - live at the Boerderij - by King of the World OFFICIAL VIDEO","youtube_id":"hn0i_a26ca4","channel":"KingoftheWorldBlues"}]', '{"no":[{"year":2013,"title":"Can''t Go Home","label":"KOTW Records"},{"year":2014,"title":"KOTW"},{"year":2015,"title":"Live At Paradiso","notes":"Livealbum."},{"year":2016,"title":"Cincinnati"},{"year":2019,"title":"Connected"},{"year":2022,"title":"Royal Ten"},{"year":2024,"title":"Live At The Boerderij","notes":"2xCD + DVD, med gjester Matt Schofield, Shirma Rouse, Big Pete og Christine Tambakis."},{"year":2024,"title":"Get Up, Get Down & Get With It"},{"year":2026,"title":"The Raw Project"}],"en":[{"year":2013,"title":"Can''t Go Home","label":"KOTW Records"},{"year":2014,"title":"KOTW"},{"year":2015,"title":"Live At Paradiso","notes":"Live album."},{"year":2016,"title":"Cincinnati"},{"year":2019,"title":"Connected"},{"year":2022,"title":"Royal Ten"},{"year":2024,"title":"Live At The Boerderij","notes":"2xCD + DVD, with guests Matt Schofield, Shirma Rouse, Big Pete and Christine Tambakis."},{"year":2024,"title":"Get Up, Get Down & Get With It"},{"year":2026,"title":"The Raw Project"}],"sv":[{"year":2013,"title":"Can''t Go Home","label":"KOTW Records"},{"year":2014,"title":"KOTW"},{"year":2015,"title":"Live At Paradiso","notes":"Livealbum."},{"year":2016,"title":"Cincinnati"},{"year":2019,"title":"Connected"},{"year":2022,"title":"Royal Ten"},{"year":2024,"title":"Live At The Boerderij","notes":"2xCD + DVD, med gästerna Matt Schofield, Shirma Rouse, Big Pete och Christine Tambakis."},{"year":2024,"title":"Get Up, Get Down & Get With It"},{"year":2026,"title":"The Raw Project"}],"de":[{"year":2013,"title":"Can''t Go Home","label":"KOTW Records"},{"year":2014,"title":"KOTW"},{"year":2015,"title":"Live At Paradiso","notes":"Livealbum."},{"year":2016,"title":"Cincinnati"},{"year":2019,"title":"Connected"},{"year":2022,"title":"Royal Ten"},{"year":2024,"title":"Live At The Boerderij","notes":"2xCD + DVD, mit Gästen Matt Schofield, Shirma Rouse, Big Pete und Christine Tambakis."},{"year":2024,"title":"Get Up, Get Down & Get With It"},{"year":2026,"title":"The Raw Project"}],"pl":[{"year":2013,"title":"Can''t Go Home","label":"KOTW Records"},{"year":2014,"title":"KOTW"},{"year":2015,"title":"Live At Paradiso","notes":"Album koncertowy."},{"year":2016,"title":"Cincinnati"},{"year":2019,"title":"Connected"},{"year":2022,"title":"Royal Ten"},{"year":2024,"title":"Live At The Boerderij","notes":"2xCD + DVD, z gośćmi Mattem Schofieldem, Shirmą Rouse, Big Pete i Christine Tambakis."},{"year":2024,"title":"Get Up, Get Down & Get With It"},{"year":2026,"title":"The Raw Project"}]}', '[]', '{"no":[{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Beste band"},{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award (Erwin Java)","category":"Beste gitarist"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Beste toetsenist"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Beste trommeslager"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Beste bassist (3x)"}],"en":[{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Best Band"},{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award (Erwin Java)","category":"Best Guitarist"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Best Keyboardist"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Best Drummer"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Best Bassist (3x)"}],"sv":[{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Bästa band"},{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award (Erwin Java)","category":"Bästa gitarrist"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Bästa keyboardist"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Bästa trummis"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Bästa basist (3x)"}],"de":[{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Beste Band"},{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award (Erwin Java)","category":"Bester Gitarrist"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Bester Keyboarder"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Bester Schlagzeuger"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Bester Bassist (3x)"}],"pl":[{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Najlepszy zespół"},{"year":2013,"title":"Dutch Blues Award (Erwin Java)","category":"Najlepszy gitarzysta"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Najlepszy klawiszowiec"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Najlepszy perkusista"},{"year":null,"title":"Dutch Blues Award","category":"Najlepszy basista (3x)"}]}', '{"no":["\"KOTW is on the top of their game!\" (Jazzism, 1-2022)","\"King Of The World er nederlandsk blues-adel.\" (File Under, juli 2015)","\"Dette er det beste bluesbandet-i-videste-forstand som Nederland for tiden har.\" (Jazzism, okt/nov 2016)"],"en":["\"KOTW is on the top of their game!\" (Jazzism, 1-2022)","\"King Of The World is Dutch blues royalty.\" (File Under, July 2015)","\"This is the best blues band, in the broadest sense of the word, that the Netherlands currently has.\" (Jazzism, Oct/Nov 2016)"],"sv":["\"KOTW is on the top of their game!\" (Jazzism, 1-2022)","\"King Of The World är nederländsk blueskungahet.\" (File Under, juli 2015)","\"Detta är det bästa bluesbandet, i vidaste bemärkelse, som Nederländerna för närvarande har.\" (Jazzism, okt/nov 2016)"],"de":["\"KOTW is on the top of their game!\" (Jazzism, 1-2022)","„King Of The World ist niederländischer Blues-Adel.\" (File Under, Juli 2015)","„Das ist die beste Bluesband im weitesten Sinne, die die Niederlande derzeit haben.\" (Jazzism, Okt./Nov. 2016)"],"pl":["\"KOTW is on the top of their game!\" (Jazzism, 1-2022)","„King Of The World to holenderska bluesowa arystokracja.\" (File Under, lipiec 2015)","„To najlepszy zespół bluesowy, w najszerszym tego słowa znaczeniu, jaki obecnie ma Holandia.\" (Jazzism, październik/listopad 2016)"]}', 'King of the World – Dutch Blues Supergroup | SlowBlues', 'King of the World – Nederlandsk blues-supergruppe | SlowBlues', 'King of the World – Nederländsk bluessupergrupp | SlowBlues', 'King of the World – Niederländische Blues-Supergroup | SlowBlues', 'King of the World – Holenderska supergrupa bluesowa | SlowBlues', 'King of the World is a Dutch blues supergroup active since 2011, tied to Cuby & The Blizzards, with 8 albums and multiple Dutch Blues Awards. Biography, discography, videos on SlowBlues.', 'King of the World er en nederlandsk blues-supergruppe aktiv siden 2011, med bånd til Cuby & The Blizzards, 8 album og flere nederlandske Blues Awards. Biografi, diskografi, videoer hos SlowBlues.', 'King of the World är en nederländsk bluessupergrupp aktiv sedan 2011, med kopplingar till Cuby & The Blizzards, 8 album och flera nederländska Blues Awards. Biografi, diskografi, videor hos SlowBlues.', 'King of the World ist eine niederländische Blues-Supergroup, aktiv seit 2011, verbunden mit Cuby & The Blizzards, 8 Alben und mehreren niederländischen Blues Awards. Biografie, Diskografie, Videos bei SlowBlues.', 'King of the World to holenderska supergrupa bluesowa działająca od 2011 roku, powiązana z Cuby & The Blizzards, 8 albumów i wiele holenderskich Blues Awards. Biografia, dyskografia, filmy na SlowBlues.', '{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/kingofheworldblues","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kotwblues/","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/user/KingoftheWorldBlues"}', '[{"label":"Discogs","url":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/3979571"}]', '[{"title":"Official site — kingoftheworld.eu","url":"https://www.kingoftheworld.eu/"},{"title":"MusicBrainz — King Of The World","url":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/cc638f46-a6c0-41bc-bcde-e7fbb9a06d81"},{"title":"Dutch Blues Foundation — Erwin Java in de Dutch Blues Hall of Fame","url":"https://www.dutchbluesfoundation.nl/erwin-java-opgenomen-in-de-dutch-blues-hall-of-fame/"}]', 'https://www.kingoftheworld.eu/', 'https://www.facebook.com/kingofheworldblues', '{"booking_agency":"FOR THE ROAD (Netherlands) / KOTW Productions (international)","agent_name":"Walter Wilhem (NL)","booking_email":"info@kingoftheworld.eu","booking_phone":"+31 (0)6 41860102","booking_url":"https://www.kingoftheworld.eu/index.php/band-members/","source_url":"https://www.kingoftheworld.eu/index.php/king-of-the-world/","note":"NL bookings via FOR THE ROAD (Walter Wilhem, walter@fortheroad.nl, +31 6 14199130); international via KOTW Productions."}', '[]');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO artists (id, slug, name, alt_name, tag, era, region, country, base_path, img, og_image, image_credit, gallery_images, youtube_video_ids, short_en, short_no, short_sv, short_de, short_pl, biography_en, biography_no, biography_sv, biography_de, biography_pl, born, died, birth_name, birth_place, origin, active_years, influence_en, influence_no, influence_sv, influence_de, influence_pl, bio, signature_songs_i18n, labels, instruments_simple, styles, family_i18n, formative_i18n, instruments_i18n, anecdotes_i18n, collaborators_i18n, videos, discography_i18n, key_recordings, awards_i18n, press_quotes_i18n, seo_title_en, seo_title_no, seo_title_sv, seo_title_de, seo_title_pl, seo_description_en, seo_description_no, seo_description_sv, seo_description_de, seo_description_pl, social_links, external_links, article_references, website_url, facebook_url, booking_info, related_slugs) VALUES (
'b1a1a1a1-0001-4001-8001-000000000001','the-bluesbones','The BluesBones',NULL,'Modern','Modern Era','Western Europe','Belgium','/artists',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','[]',
'A five-piece Belgian blues-rock band known for chart-topping releases and a 2017 European Blues Challenge runner-up finish.',
'Et femmanns belgisk blues-rock-band kjent for listetopper og en andreplass i European Blues Challenge 2017.',
'Ett femmannaband från Belgien känt för listettor och en andraplats i European Blues Challenge 2017.',
'Eine fünfköpfige belgische Blues-Rock-Band, bekannt für Chart-Erfolge und einen zweiten Platz bei der European Blues Challenge 2017.',
'Pięcioosobowy belgijski zespół blues-rockowy znany z sukcesów na listach przebojów i drugiego miejsca w European Blues Challenge 2017.',
'The BluesBones are a five-piece Belgian blues-rock band known for a wide musical range, from driving blues-rock and tender, sensitive ballads to swampy slide guitar and heavier rock elements (Source: Discogs). The band has made a mark internationally with repeated chart placements: three times at number one on the UK blues charts (2018, 2020 and 2023) and number one on the US blues/rock charts in 2020, with a number three finish in 2023 (Source: official website). The BluesBones won the Belgian Blues Challenge in 2016 and took second place in the European Blues Challenge the following year, in 2017 (Source: official website; Discogs). The band was later named Band of the Year at the Belgian Blues Awards in 2024, a title their own channels state they also won in 2026 (Source: official website). At the band''s core are vocalist Nico De Cock, guitarist Stef Paglia and Edwin Risbourg on Hammond organ and Rhodes piano, with Geert Boeckx on bass; the lineup has since seen some changes on guitar and drums (Source: Discogs, "Chasing Shadows," 2018; official website). The band has been actively recording since at least 2012, with the concept album "Chasing Shadows" (2018) standing as a central work in the catalogue, recorded at Save The Music Studio and produced by Tim Janssens (Source: Discogs).',
'The BluesBones er et belgisk blues-rock-band bestående av fem erfarne musikere, kjent for et bredt musikalsk spenn fra rocka blues og sarte, sensitive balladeversjoner til sumpete slide-gitar og tyngre rock-elementer (Kilde: Discogs). Bandet har markert seg internasjonalt med gjentatte listeplasseringer: tre ganger på førsteplass på de britiske bluesslistene (2018, 2020 og 2023) og førsteplass på de amerikanske blues/rock-listene i 2020, med en tredjeplass i 2023 (Kilde: bandets offisielle nettside). The BluesBones vant Belgian Blues Challenge i 2016 og tok andreplassen i European Blues Challenge året etter, i 2017 (Kilde: bandets offisielle nettside; Discogs). Bandet ble senere kåret til Årets band ved Belgian Blues Awards i 2024, en pris de ifølge egne kanaler også vant i 2026 (Kilde: bandets offisielle nettside). Kjernen i bandet er vokalist Nico De Cock, gitarist Stef Paglia og Edwin Risbourg på Hammond-orgel og Rhodes-piano, med Geert Boeckx på bass; besetningen har siden fått noen endringer på gitar og trommer (Kilde: Discogs, "Chasing Shadows", 2018; bandets offisielle nettside). Bandet har vært aktivt innspillende siden minst 2012, med konseptalbumet "Chasing Shadows" (2018) som et sentralt verk i katalogen, spilt inn på Save The Music Studio og produsert av Tim Janssens (Kilde: Discogs).',
'The BluesBones är ett belgiskt blues-rock-band bestående av fem erfarna musiker, känt för ett brett musikaliskt register från drivande blues-rock och känsliga ballader till sumpig slidegitarr och tyngre rockinslag (Källa: Discogs). Bandet har satt avtryck internationellt med upprepade listplaceringar: tre gånger etta på de brittiska blueslistorna (2018, 2020 och 2023) och etta på de amerikanska blues/rock-listorna 2020, med en tredjeplats 2023 (Källa: officiell webbplats). The BluesBones vann Belgian Blues Challenge 2016 och tog andraplatsen i European Blues Challenge året därpå, 2017 (Källa: officiell webbplats; Discogs). Bandet utsågs senare till Årets band vid Belgian Blues Awards 2024, en titel de enligt egna kanaler även vann 2026 (Källa: officiell webbplats). Kärnan i bandet är sångaren Nico De Cock, gitarristen Stef Paglia och Edwin Risbourg på Hammondorgel och Rhodes-piano, med Geert Boeckx på bas; sättningen har sedan dess sett vissa förändringar på gitarr och trummor (Källa: Discogs, "Chasing Shadows", 2018; officiell webbplats). Bandet har spelat in aktivt sedan minst 2012, med konceptalbumet "Chasing Shadows" (2018) som ett centralt verk i katalogen, inspelat på Save The Music Studio och producerat av Tim Janssens (Källa: Discogs).',
'The BluesBones sind eine fünfköpfige belgische Blues-Rock-Band, bekannt für ihre musikalische Bandbreite von treibendem Blues-Rock und zarten, gefühlvollen Balladen bis hin zu sumpfiger Slide-Gitarre und schwereren Rock-Elementen (Quelle: Discogs). Die Band hat sich international einen Namen gemacht mit wiederholten Chart-Platzierungen: dreimal Platz eins der britischen Blues-Charts (2018, 2020 und 2023) und Platz eins der US-Blues/Rock-Charts 2020, mit einem dritten Platz 2023 (Quelle: offizielle Website). The BluesBones gewannen 2016 die Belgian Blues Challenge und belegten im darauffolgenden Jahr, 2017, den zweiten Platz bei der European Blues Challenge (Quelle: offizielle Website; Discogs). Die Band wurde später bei den Belgian Blues Awards 2024 zur Band des Jahres gekürt, ein Titel, den sie laut eigenen Kanälen auch 2026 gewann (Quelle: offizielle Website). Den Kern der Band bilden Sänger Nico De Cock, Gitarrist Stef Paglia und Edwin Risbourg an Hammond-Orgel und Rhodes-Piano, mit Geert Boeckx am Bass; die Besetzung hat seitdem einige Wechsel an Gitarre und Schlagzeug erlebt (Quelle: Discogs, "Chasing Shadows", 2018; offizielle Website). Die Band nimmt seit mindestens 2012 aktiv auf, wobei das Konzeptalbum "Chasing Shadows" (2018) als zentrales Werk des Katalogs gilt, aufgenommen im Save The Music Studio und produziert von Tim Janssens (Quelle: Discogs).',
'The BluesBones to pięcioosobowy belgijski zespół blues-rockowy, znany z szerokiego zakresu muzycznego — od dynamicznego blues-rocka i delikatnych, wrażliwych ballad po bagienną gitarę slide i cięższe elementy rockowe (Źródło: Discogs). Zespół zaznaczył swoją obecność na arenie międzynarodowej dzięki wielokrotnym pozycjom na listach przebojów: trzykrotnie na pierwszym miejscu brytyjskich list bluesowych (2018, 2020 i 2023) oraz na pierwszym miejscu amerykańskich list blues/rock w 2020 roku, z trzecim miejscem w 2023 (Źródło: oficjalna strona). The BluesBones wygrali Belgian Blues Challenge w 2016 roku i zajęli drugie miejsce w European Blues Challenge rok później, w 2017 (Źródło: oficjalna strona; Discogs). Zespół został później uznany za Zespół Roku podczas Belgian Blues Awards w 2024 roku, tytuł ten według ich własnych kanałów zdobyli również w 2026 roku (Źródło: oficjalna strona). Trzon zespołu stanowią wokalista Nico De Cock, gitarzysta Stef Paglia oraz Edwin Risbourg na organach Hammonda i pianinie Rhodes, wraz z Geertem Boeckxem na basie; skład od tego czasu przeszedł pewne zmiany na gitarze i perkusji (Źródło: Discogs, "Chasing Shadows", 2018; oficjalna strona). Zespół aktywnie nagrywa co najmniej od 2012 roku, a album koncepcyjny "Chasing Shadows" (2018) stanowi centralne dzieło w katalogu, nagrany w Save The Music Studio i wyprodukowany przez Tima Janssensa (Źródło: Discogs).',
NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Belgia','2012–',
'The BluesBones'' repeated chart placements on both UK and US blues/rock charts, together with their European Blues Challenge runner-up finish, have helped raise the international profile of Belgian blues in the 2010s and 2020s (Source: official website).',
'The BluesBones sine gjentatte listeplasseringer på både britiske og amerikanske blues/rock-lister, sammen med andreplassen i European Blues Challenge, har bidratt til å løfte den internasjonale profilen til belgisk blues på 2010- og 2020-tallet (Kilde: bandets offisielle nettside).',
'The BluesBones upprepade listplaceringar på både brittiska och amerikanska blues/rock-listor, tillsammans med andraplatsen i European Blues Challenge, har bidragit till att lyfta den internationella profilen för belgisk blues under 2010- och 2020-talen (Källa: officiell webbplats).',
'Die wiederholten Chart-Platzierungen von The BluesBones auf britischen und US-amerikanischen Blues/Rock-Charts sowie ihr zweiter Platz bei der European Blues Challenge haben dazu beigetragen, das internationale Profil des belgischen Blues in den 2010er- und 2020er-Jahren zu schärfen (Quelle: offizielle Website).',
'Wielokrotne pozycje The BluesBones na brytyjskich i amerykańskich listach blues/rock, wraz z drugim miejscem w European Blues Challenge, przyczyniły się do podniesienia międzynarodowej rangi belgijskiego bluesa w latach 2010. i 2020. (Źródło: oficjalna strona).',
